,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/3b99b044bc163b19c2b6688ca6c0af8d496ea00b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:12:49Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:18:07Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs: describe the Studio check without a gears-frontx source\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md drops the gears-frontx clone from the local commands and\nstates the conventions for template documents: one system per template over\n<template>/architecture, ids under the template''s own cpt-template-<name>-\nprefix, gears-frontx decisions cited as links, and the PR that brings a\ntemplate''s PRD and DESIGN setting those kinds to required = true. The\nREADME CI list names what the Studio job now validates.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b7324b3d76c7b5a263f0ae62203b3f63da94431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/0b7324b3d76c7b5a263f0ae62203b3f63da94431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/3b99b044bc163b19c2b6688ca6c0af8d496ea00b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gera