:"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/98520ff47ad317f0829866b0bda3c35c475016b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:49:53Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:18:07Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"chore: state what the artifact registry enforces\n\nThe registry registers no code paths because ADR-0033 says template residue markers bind nothing. In cfs v1.6.2 required = true is not enforced while a [workspace] is declared, so every kind stays required = false and the comment says what that does and does not catch. The two [[ignore]] entries matched nothing and are dropped.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fa6113cf293c87461ac80745f48d8d4968b4f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/7fa6113cf293c87461ac80745f48d8d4968b4f6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/98520ff47ad317f0829866b0bda3c35c475016b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a