 The kit is marked tracking = \"ignored\", matching the .gitignore that already kept its files out; cfs now writes that ignore entry itself. The studio-validate-kits job is removed: the bootstrap step of studio-validate already validates the installed kit, and this repository registers no kit of its own. The cfs release is pinned once, as CFS_VERSION. /.prs/ is ignored for the pr-review data directory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f2be0526c1a0655c1f7577f430fadd47d6a10c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/9f2be0526c1a0655c1f7577f430fadd47d6a10c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/4492f91896c94177365fcae51707ad0e12d4dcba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4492f91896c94177365fcae51707ad0e12d4dcba","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDQ0OTJmOTE4OTZjOTQxNzczN