/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/5493db30b296c08e7c21fc05940fe129f292eecb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:12:01Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:18:07Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"chore: register the architecture documents with Constructor Studio\n\nInitialize Constructor Studio at v1.6.2 with the sdlc kit v1.2.1, runtime and agent files ignored, kit content regenerated rather than committed.\n\nThe registry holds documents only: a root system over architecture/ and a Workspace Templates child over architecture/workspace-templates, every kind optional so a tree without documents passes. No code path is registered, because the residue @cpt- markers in template-shell, template-mfe and scripts bind nothing (gears-frontx ADR-0033) and would fail as orphan references.\n\ngears-frontx is declared as a workspace source at .cf-studio/.workspace/gears-frontx (gitignored), so references to ids it defines resolve.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"86af855b44be3eb027bff8cc096513f1495e3bb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/86af855b44be3eb027bff8cc096513f1495e3bb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/5493db30b296c08e7c21fc05940fe129f292eecb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"veri