ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e5376567f8b7de8655c6fc0ffc3363cb9b49ffed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:06:18Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): realize an unclaimed unit only inside selected or applied template ground\n\nAn unclaimed unit is per-unit work only inside the ground of a selected or already-applied template, and is reported as residual work with nothing written outside such ground, matching the scaffolding routing of gears-frontx#609. The mapping''s shell bundle note and the DESIGN''s O6 and recorded risk say so.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b52c786d38f1ab7d304239309c903f4e5839fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/7b52c786d38f1ab7d304239309c903f4e5839fd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/e5376567f8b7de8655c6fc0ffc3363cb9b49ffed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/e5376567f8b7de8655c6fc0ffc3363cb9b49ffed","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGU1Mzc2NTY3ZjhiN2RlODY1NWM2ZmMwZmZjMzM2M2NiOWI0OWZmZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2","sha":"dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2"}],"sha":"e5376567f8b7de8655c6fc0ffc3363cb9b49ffed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e5376567f8b7de8655c6fc0ffc3363cb9b49ffed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42838667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itechmeat","id":42838667,"login":"itechmeat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM4NjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T11:05:48Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): keep screens free of microfrontends and templates off each other''s packages\n\nThe family''s screens are feature templates that carry nothing microfrontend-specific. Each is a React feature, API wiring included, that a project renders as a plain React component or wraps into a microfrontend with template-mfe. The MFE package, its mfe.json and the Module Federation build belong to that wrapping step, and the extension entry, route, order band and menu labels are now required of the wrapped screen, from values the screen member states. A new requirement, fr-mfe-agnostic-screen, says so with an acceptance criterion and DESIGN obligation O7. The mapping''s draft layout moves each screen''s feature to features/<screen>/ and drops mfe_packages/<screen>/ from the screen templates'' claims.\n\nNo member depends on a package published from another template: a template-level package is used by its own template only. The plan to take the shell''s MF-host layer from template-shell''s build export is gone from the PRD, the DESIGN and the mapping. The open question keeps two options without a lean: the shell carries the layer as its own content, or its framework-level parts come from an ecosystem library. template-mfe''s MFE packages already depend on @gears-frontx/react and on template-shell''s build export, and that is recorded there as a known conflict.\n\nA family member is now called a member. \"Sibling template\" means an alternative template of the same kind, and template-workspace is one of template-shell. The release tag shape is <template>/v<semver>, and a vendor fork keeps it in its own repository. Each template may ship its own AI skills and guidelines, which is what stands in for the shell''s retired add-a-screen skill. template-workspace-chat is the same template as the chat feature template a console composes, and its name is an open question. The architecture README states the placement rules and allows a directory per standalone template.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"deb93149a3d4dac36d1da96c7d91eb24e4cb7418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/deb93149a3d4dac36d1da96c7d91eb24e4cb7418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGRkZTkwZDU2MGJmZGM1Yzg3OWJlOGM3NGRiYTRkMmJhNjg3NzU4ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2","sha":"fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2"}],"sha":"dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dde90d560bfdc5c879be8c74dba4d2ba687758d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42838667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itechmeat","id":42838667,"login":"itechmeat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM4NjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:33:15Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): stop attributing to the ADRs what they do not say\n\nEight corrections from a cross-check against gears-frontx#609 at\na4efc56d, all of them the same kind of defect: a record cited for more\nthan it decides, or for a reason that is not its own.\n\nADR-0017 as amended does not fix per-sibling refs. It records that the\nsource-spec carries a version in one repository-scoped place, and says\nin terms that the ref namespace serving independent sibling versioning\nis the family''s own convention. Both documents claimed the record\ndecided it, and neither declared one. This repository carries no tags\nand its publish workflow cuts none, so there was nothing to inherit:\nthe family now declares git tags of the form <sibling>/v<semver>, one\nper sibling release, as a PRD requirement with an acceptance criterion\nand a DESIGN component, with the resulting source-spec spelled out.\n\nADR-0018 declines a cross-template compatibility field because adding\nit without the enforcement would publish a declaration nothing reads,\nnot because it would widen the manifest for one family. The reason is\nrestated, and so is its consequence: applying a screen sibling with no\nshell present succeeds, and fails only where the content runs. The\ndescription is the one place that decision leaves the precondition, and\nit is also the only thing #609''s scaffolding selection reads, so each\nsibling''s description must claim its own unit and name its precondition\n- O6 in the DESIGN, an FR with an acceptance criterion in the PRD, and\na risk row.\n\nADR-0033 is untouched by #609, so \"as amended\" is gone from it.\n\nAdding a screen is conditionally frontx add, not unconditionally:\n#609 routes an add-a-unit request to the scaffolding entry point, which\nplans an add only where an installed template''s description claims the\nunit and reports a unit no template claims as residual work. The\nexploration says so, and says what retiring add-inbox-screen with\nnothing costs in that case.\n\nThe screen extension domain is not single-occupant; the shell mounts\none screen at a time out of the admitted set. And the PRD''s References\ntable no longer lists the contract-schema-ownership ADR, which its body\ndoes not cite.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"758b0b28a27c1075f8f55320c99b2cb201cc76d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/758b0b28a27c1075f8f55320c99b2cb201cc76d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGZkZDBlMTNkNDU5YzNiMDAwNGIyODE4YjIzYmVlNmRmMzczYzcyYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d","sha":"dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d"}],"sha":"fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fdd0e13d459c3b0004b2818b23bee6df373c72b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42838667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itechmeat","id":42838667,"login":"itechmeat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM4NjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:18:40Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): give the PRD frontmatter, and settle the wording\n\nFrontmatter matches the DESIGN''s type/system/status. The two NFRs are\nstated as MUST NOT rather than \"No ... MUST\".\n\nThe rest is the consistency pass the label change made necessary:\nnothing is called ecosystem-visible or ecosystem-facing any more where\nthe thing named is this family''s own, the label is described the same\nway in every place that describes it, and the stale references to an\naddressed action and an i18n key are gone.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e707d53245ff02afb265d79b8f40deda15f3aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/5e707d53245ff02afb265d79b8f40deda15f3aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGRkMGViNTdlN2ZlMTUwOThmYzQ2NGNkNmUxMjIyNzZlNGM1ZDI3NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/51aa9648784c00e6ed383a04275f6ad49f9dcc14","sha":"51aa9648784c00e6ed383a04275f6ad49f9dcc14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/51aa9648784c00e6ed383a04275f6ad49f9dcc14"}],"sha":"dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dd0eb57e7fe15098fc464cd6e122276e4c5d275d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42838667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itechmeat","id":42838667,"login":"itechmeat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM4NjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/51aa9648784c00e6ed383a04275f6ad49f9dcc14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:17:23Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): say where each cited fact actually lives\n\nSeven corrections, all of them about attribution:\n\n- presentation.route and presentation.label are required by the derived\n  screen-extension schema published from this repository\n  (template-shell/src/gts/schemas/extension_screen.v1.json), not by the\n  ecosystem''s ext/extension.v1.json, which requires only id, domain and\n  entry. Name that owner instead of calling it ecosystem-visible.\n- @gears-frontx/react is published from template-shell/packages/react\n  here. No @gears-frontx/routing package exists in either repository;\n  the mention is gone.\n- template-shell on main carries no routing of any kind and reads\n  presentation.route nowhere, so the PRD no longer claims hash routing.\n  The technique stays the shell''s own; the FR is named for the outcome.\n- demo-mfe is not the runtime''s, it is one of this repository''s own\n  template-mfe packages, beside _blank-mfe; both are now cited.\n- template-inbox is the reference branch of gears-frontx#596, closed and\n  do-not-merge, not shipped state.\n- Each References note says the \"as amended\" ADR text lands with\n  gears-frontx#609, which merges first.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cf2161d3682f380322feae6ebc3322db9e478e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/0cf2161d3682f380322feae6ebc3322db9e478e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/51aa9648784c00e6ed383a04275f6ad49f9dcc14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"