adeb909af4c9d86d32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:15:26Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): give O5 a requirement to trace to, and one id prefix\n\nDESIGN O5 forbade a cross-sibling build-time import and PRD 4.2 and 11\ncalled that shape a requirement, but no FR stated it, so the obligation\ntraced to nothing. State it as an FR under the shell-screen integration\ncontract, with an acceptance criterion, and repoint the two sections\nthat pointed at the i18n section instead.\n\nIds now all read cpt-frontx-workspace-templates-{kind}-{slug}. The\nDESIGN''s component, constraint and interface ids sat in the ecosystem''s\nown namespace and would read as ecosystem-owned; two ids also renamed\nfor what they now describe.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb2d906c7b8274d5c422c2a434aa595e9760018f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/fb2d906c7b8274d5c422c2a434aa595e9760018f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/dc4b06b5a02bdfaf4eace2adeb909af4c9d86d32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/dc4b06b5a02bdfaf4eace2adeb909af4c9d86d32","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGRjNGIwNmI1YTAyYmRmYWY0ZWFjZTJhZGViOTA5YWY0YzlkODZkMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/e6a0e3dff0160ecc0182d9625af7f42732795185","sha":"e6a0e3dff0160ecc0182d9625af7f42732795185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e6a0e3dff0160ecc0182d9625af7f42732795185"}],"sha":"dc4b06b5a02bdfaf4eace2adeb909af4c9d86d32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/dc4b06b5a02bdfaf4eace2adeb909af4c9d86d32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42838667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itechmeat","id":42838667,"login":"itechmeat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM4NjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itechmeat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e6a0e3dff0160ecc0182d9625af7f42732795185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:14:17Z","email":"itechmeat@gmail.com","name":"Sergey Eroshenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:46:19Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(architecture): label siblings from static manifest data, not a dispatch\n\nAdmission is manifest-driven and loads no remote, and the menu is built\nfrom the admitted extension set, so on the load that first paints the\nmenu every sibling but the routed one has run no code. A registration\naction a sibling dispatches therefore cannot label it at the moment the\nlabel is needed.\n\nReplace it with two static fields under the extension entry''s existing\npresentation object: the label the derived screen-extension schema\nalready requires, plus a labels map from language code to display\nstring. The shell reads both off the admitted set in the same pass it\nreads route, icon and order, and the fallback is two declared steps -\nthe current language''s entry, then label - so it always terminates in a\nrendered string.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Eroshenkov <itechmeat@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"498df3d2e4505892065960938935aa1f42be2a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/498df3d2e4505892065960938935aa1f42be2a9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/e6a0e3dff0160ecc0182d9625af7f42732795185","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/oth