e":"2026-09-26T01:29:14Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(demo-mfe): cover unmount()''s routing.stop() -> releaseAll() -> super.unmount() order\n\nThis regression test drives releaseAll() directly against a\nreal registry, so it never notices if DemoMfeWidgetsHostLifecycle''s\nown unmount() override stopped calling releaseAll(), or called it out\nof order against routing.stop()/super.unmount(). Add a test against\nthis file''s own faked ExtensionDomainSlot/ConcurrentMountStrategy/\nThemeAwareReactLifecycle that exercises the real override and asserts\ncall order via invocationCallOrder.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e58ddf72f41e243b7b36090e39af899e95aee02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/e58ddf72f41e243b7b36090e39af899e95aee02d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/424471059c9cea58c779765b497ffc6fb338a562","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/own