ail":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"docs(routing): document the shell''s routed domains and the Back-during-mount limitation\n\nRewrite navigation-composition.md''s stale claims (route declared but\nunconsumed, no deep links/history/bookmarking) to describe what the\nshell now does: four routed base domains, DomainRouting observers,\nback-projection after mount/unmount, the entry_addresses broadcast,\nand the unresolved-route fallback. Add the known Back-during-mount\nlimitation to live-run/README.md''s own observations.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"911075f0c892b746c314e7fcf009197d978897bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/911075f0c892b746c314e7fcf009197d978897bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/2afaaeffeff5bcd154656adfdf26e9319f9e323e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscrip