tx-templates/git/commits/cc41d97b7838bc0fb2c0174ebb30ef33f02817aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/cc41d97b7838bc0fb2c0174ebb30ef33f02817aa","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGNjNDFkOTdiNzgzOGJjMGZiMmMwMTc0ZWJiMzBlZjMzZjAyODE3YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104","sha":"f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104"}],"sha":"cc41d97b7838bc0fb2c0174ebb30ef33f02817aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/cc41d97b7838bc0fb2c0174ebb30ef33f02817aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:33:56Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(demo-mfe): release Widgets Host occupants on unmount before the slot''s own detach\n\nWidgetsDomainImpl.mount() early-returns for an extension registry.getMountedExtensions()\nalready lists as mounted, but DemoMfeWidgetsHostLifecycle.unmount() only stopped routing --\nit never told the registry the occupants were gone. Since the nested MfeRegistry is a\nmodule-singleton that outlives one mount, a second entry into Widgets Host (back/forward,\nor a fresh in-app Back) found every widget still \"mounted\" and never called\nstrategy.mount() again: the widget content area stayed permanently blank.\n\nExtensionDomainSlot''s own cleanup effect (mounter.detach()) mass-unmounts the DOM on\nleave but never clears the mounted-extensions bookkeeping, so it cannot be relied on for\nthis. WidgetsDomainImpl.releaseAll() unmounts every occupant through the same\nstrategy.unmount() path the domain''s own unmount_ext handler uses -- the one call that\nclears the registry''s mounted set -- run strictly before super.unmount(container)\ntriggers the slot''s detach, so the two mass-unmount paths never race the same ids.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"349abb11a6c160620c3ea6d5e0774a6c320dbdef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/349abb11a6c160620c3ea6d5e0774a6c320dbdef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGYwNjdhZmYzN2E1Y2FlZWE4YmEzMjg4OWIxYWI4MDkwMGMwYzkxMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e","sha":"5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e"}],"sha":"f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f067aff37a5caeea8ba32889b1ab80900c0c9104"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:51:50Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(demo-mfe): register entry_addresses schema before manifest domains in widgets-host bootstrap\n\nbootstrapWidgetsRuntime registered every manifest-declared domain —\nincluding the widgets domain, whose sharedProperties references\nentry_addresses — before entryAddressesSchema was registered on the\nnested type system. Real GTS validation then threw \"entry_addresses\n... not found in registry\", registerDomain(widgetsDomain) was never\nreached, and Widgets Host stayed blank on every cold load (#638).\n\nHoist the four application-layer schema registrations (theme, language,\nextension_screen, entry_addresses) ahead of the manifest-driven domain\nloop so they cover both screenDomain (registered further down) and any\nmanifest domain whose sharedProperties references them. Correct the\nstale comment to state the real requirement.\n\nAdd a regression test using a real, freshly-constructed GtsPlugin\ninstance (not the FakeRegistry''s non-validating stub) to exercise\nbootstrapWidgetsRuntime''s registration order directly.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"da5f0cc0bdc6e97b52465012d3227f5fe2c6e574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/da5f0cc0bdc6e97b52465012d3227f5fe2c6e574"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDVlYjc4YzNmNGMyYmU1NjA4OTE0NWQ0MDY4NzI5ZDIyYTJmODk1MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f","sha":"cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f"}],"sha":"5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/5eb78c3f4c2be56089145d4068729d22a2f8951e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:28:55Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(widgets): align mount logging, ping edge cases, navigate errors, and HMR teardown in widget-a/b\n\nWidget-a''s mount and ping logs now use console.info, matching widget-b\nand the shell''s own mount logging; widget-b''s doc comment is corrected\nto state the console.info level precisely.\n\nAdd tests for a ping arriving with no live session for its id --\nafter its own container has unmounted, and while a different\nextension''s session is live (so the lookup can''t fall through to a\nforeign session).\n\nWrap the ping handler''s router.navigate() call in try/catch, logging\nvia console.error before rethrowing, so a failed write is never\nsilently swallowed once it has already cleared the providerMounted\nqueue; test that a rejection is both logged and still propagates.\n\nRelease widget-a''s module-level sessions on import.meta.hot dispose\n(unmounting every live container, which detaches its adapted history\nthrough the normal effect-cleanup path, then clearing the map),\nmirroring the shell''s and demo-mfe''s own HMR teardown so a replacement\nmodule doesn''t orphan the old one''s subscriptions.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"410809f677ba0ce74271e68e014761198c3bd011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/410809f677ba0ce74271e68e014761198c3bd011"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGNjMmU3Y2QxZmU0ZGYyOTczZjk5OTZlN2Y0MWRjMmE3YWZkY2YwNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4d2d0f3d69231df896038d479ea900235efb809f","sha":"4d2d0f3d69231df896038d479ea900235efb809f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4d2d0f3d69231df896038d479ea900235efb809f"}],"sha":"cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/cc2e7cd1fe4df2973f9996e7f41dc2a7afdcf05f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4d2d0f3d69231df896038d479ea900235efb809f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:12:04Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(demo-mfe): guard Widgets Host routing against re-entry, HMR leaks, and a silent opening-gate rejection\n\nPin the write-coalescing and mount-dedup guarantees that survived a\nmutation check but had no test proving them (one history write\ncarrying all three widget tokens, one real mount call per widget\ndespite a URL-restore/auto-mount race, entry-address broadcast before\nthe observer starts and before the first mount dispatch). Add a\nre-entry guard so a second onAttached for the same domain mount stops\nthe previous routing/observer before replacing it, an HMR dispose for\nthe widgets navigation singleton mirroring the shell''s own, and a\ncatch on the opening/auto-mount gating chain so a rejection there logs\ninstead of hanging mount(). Key the widgets-host test''s fake registry\noverrides by (subject, actionType) and document its lack of\nper-subject serialization.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce3bc4fb54f82f19a12c2444520d709e20b0f4e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/ce3bc4fb54f82f19a12c2444520d709e20b0f4e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/4d2d0f3d69231df896038d479ea900235efb809f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned