:246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/06fac14647b9a6f7157d7b6e13c5db9f4c0d70fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDA2ZmFjMTQ2NDdiOWE2ZjcxNTdkN2I2ZTEzYzVkYjlmNGMwZDcwZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/04f3488def11bd80adfa36f6643a0b07312b479d","sha":"04f3488def11bd80adfa36f6643a0b07312b479d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/04f3488def11bd80adfa36f6643a0b07312b479d"}],"sha":"06fac14647b9a6f7157d7b6e13c5db9f4c0d70fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/06fac14647b9a6f7157d7b6e13c5db9f4c0d70fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/04f3488def11bd80adfa36f6643a0b07312b479d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:18:07Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(template-shell): strengthen the epoch-guard regression test and fix stale comments\n\n- domain-routing.test.ts: the stop/start-cycle test now also opens a\n  further window after the stale call settles and asserts it still\n  collects into one replace, catching a removed/never-bumped epoch\n  guard that the prior assertions alone let through silently.\n- bootstrap.ts: correct bootstrapMFE''s JSDoc — schema registration\n  order, when entry-addresses broadcast (initial, per extension,\n  final), and that ShellRouting is only started/stopped by its\n  consumer''s onAttached/onDetached, never by this function.\n- domain-routing.ts: cite ExclusiveMountStrategy.mount/\n  OptionalMountStrategy by symbol instead of a line number in another\n  repo, note both evict, and note all four shell domains are single-\n  cardinality; point the \"test below\" comment at the actual test file\n  instead of implying it is further down in this one.\n- MfeScreenContainer.tsx: document that the module-scoped bootstrap\n  promise stays cached on rejection (no retry, since a partial\n  bootstrap is not idempotent) and ignores later `app` changes.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab89fc94c7a4358002c08e4a9549a56589e6fc03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/ab89fc94c7a4358002c08e4a9549a56589e6fc03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/0