wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/8c56d7be1135146e0e47784f03a7fbe515fa52cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:10:15Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"feat(demo-mfe): route its screens and give Widgets Host its own routed widgets domain\n\nEach of demo-mfe''s five screens now mounts under its own EngineProvider,\ncomposed over the entry the host addressed for it (or standalone when\nnone was broadcast). Widgets Host''s nested widgets domain gets its own\nrouted, multiple-cardinality DomainRouting: auto-mount of its three\nwidgets coalesces with any URL-restore or chain-driven mount of the same\nsubject, and the opening write is deferred until Widgets Host''s own\nentry is itself in the URL, then flushed once as a single replace.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4512a906336dd11c0301d8a7b2cc718d021ff097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/4512a906336dd11c0301d8a7b2cc718d021ff097"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/8c56d7be1135146e0e47784f03a7fbe515fa52cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/8c56d7be1135146e0e47784f03a7fbe515fa52cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDhjNTZkN2JlMTEzNTE0NmUwZTQ3Nzg0ZjAzYTdmYmU1MTVmYTUyY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e","sha":"f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e"}],"sha":"8c56d7be1135146e0e47784f03a7fbe515fa52cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/8c56d7be1135146e0e47784f03a7fbe515fa52cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T16:29:01Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(template-shell): memoize the screen-status subscription and dedupe shell-domain key derivation\n\nMfeScreenContainer''s useRouteStatus now memoizes the subscribe\nfunction passed to useSyncExternalStore with useCallback([routing]),\nso a re-render no longer tears down and rebuilds the screen-domain\nstatus subscription.\n\nLeft DomainRouting.onTransition''s status object as is — skipping the\nnotification when entries/unresolved counts are unchanged would also\nswallow the resolutionChanged same-URL occupant swap (a same-count,\ndifferent-occupant transition), which the existing test covering that\nswap depends on being notified of; not a safe change to make here.\n\ncreateShellRouting builds `domains` from the same per-domain entries\nused to construct each DomainRouting, so each domain''s route key is\nderived once instead of once for its DomainRouting and again for the\ndomains list. Dropped createShellRouting''s own `nav = shellNavigation()`\ndefault: bootstrapMFE is its only production caller and already\nresolves that default itself before calling in; tests keep passing\n`nav` explicitly, as before.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"65255985aa08ef214d0f36f55066e86207ae8096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/65255985aa08ef214d0f36f55066e86207ae8096"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGY1MDIyNjVkOGFlMmY1NzcwMTU5NWNmNTYyZmI0ODcyM2E0ZDZmOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0","sha":"e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0"}],"sha":"f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/f502265d8ae2f57701595cf562fb48723a4d6f8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T16:24:02Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(template-shell): pin bootstrap ordering, entry-addresses broadcast, and screen-container remount behavior\n\n- bootstrap.test.ts: strengthens the screen mount-handler ordering test\n  to also record when the handler''s own promise settles, so afterMount\n  running any later than the strategy''s own settlement (not just later\n  than the URL check) is caught; adds a real-routing/no-spy case\n  asserting exactly one push to /?screen=hello-world; adds the matching\n  ordering case for an optional domain''s mount AND unmount handlers\n  (afterMount/afterUnmount); strengthens the entry-addresses broadcast\n  test to assert the value broadcast after each individual registration\n  resolves, not just the final one, so a broadcast issued ahead of its\n  registerExtension no longer passes; adds a case for a throwing\n  broadcast not rejecting bootstrapMFE and not blocking later\n  registrations.\n- shell-routing.test.ts: includes the screen domain in the \"observes\n  all four domains\" assertion (a URL entry lets a dropped start() call\n  for one domain show up as a status mismatch, where a bare count did\n  not).\n- MfeScreenContainer.test.tsx: the ExtensionDomainSlot fake now reads\n  onAttached/onDetached through a ref on mount, matching how the real\n  slot attaches/detaches once rather than on every parent re-render;\n  adds cases for stop() on detach and for a real remount (unmount then\n  a later, distinct render) reusing the settled bootstrap rather than\n  re-invoking it.\n\nEach new assertion was confirmed to fail under the mutation it targets\n(afterMount deferred past the handler''s own settlement, afterUnmount\nremoved, a broadcast issued before its registration, screen dropped\nfrom start()''s loop) and to pass against the corresponding fix.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"37317d84693c05243eedb2d8705b307f929b9aea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/37317d84693c05243eedb2d8705b307f929b9aea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGUzNTBmMzYwM2U2NDU2OTM2Yzk3Y2FiNmY4NmRhNWViNmVlNzNkZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0","sha":"fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0"}],"sha":"e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/e350f3603e6456936c97cab6f86da5eb6ee73df0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T16:23:49Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(template-shell): stop routing on screen-slot detach, isolate broadcast failures, and survive a real remount\n\nCloses review findings in the shell''s app-level MFE glue:\n\n- ShellRouting gains stop(), wired to the screen slot''s onDetached, so\n  a teardown of the container (not just of one mounted screen) releases\n  all four domains'' history observers instead of leaking them.\n- The entry-addresses module singleton stops routing and clears itself\n  on Vite HMR dispose, so a hot-replaced module does not leave the\n  previous instance''s observers subscribed to the same history forever.\n- A broadcastAddresses() failure during per-extension registration is\n  caught and logged rather than aborting the whole bootstrap pass;\n  registerExtension itself stays all-or-nothing as before. A final\n  broadcast after the registration loop recovers the correct state\n  even if an intermediate round was lost.\n- MfeScreenContainer hoists the bootstrapMFE call to a module-scoped\n  promise instead of a per-instance ref, so a genuine remount (unmount\n  then a later, distinct mount) reuses the prior bootstrap instead of\n  re-registering every domain and extension a second time.\n- Corrects a stale comment in bootstrapMFE claiming main.tsx also\n  registers entryAddressesSchema (it does not), and updates the\n  navigation-composition guideline''s registration-order section to\n  match the current schema/broadcast ordering.\n- Removes two @cpt- markers left in template territory, where they\n  bind nothing.\n\nNo production-code change was needed for the back-projection ordering\nitself (already correct) or for template-shell/src/routing — this pass\nstayed inside src-app/app/mfe.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"597656044ad97dce10546044c953bf72c5b116ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/597656044ad97dce10546044c953bf72c5b116ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGZkNmYyMWM5MTBiNGEyMTBhMGY0ZTE0YTdiMWRmODIzMDUwZjk2ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63","sha":"4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63"}],"sha":"fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/fd6f21c910b4a210a0f4e14a7b1df823050f96f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T16:06:09Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(routing-shell): flush withOpening on the last exit, not the first entry\n\nopeningDepth was checked for \"outermost\" only at entry, so two\noverlapping (non-nested) windows, or a window still pending when stop()\nran, could flush from the wrong call and let writes leak out one by one\ninstead of collecting into a single replace. stop() now bumps an epoch\nand resets depth/collection itself; withOpening captures its own epoch\nat entry and only decrements/flushes when that epoch is still current,\nflushing when its own exit brings the depth back to zero rather than\nbecause it happened to be first in.\n\nAlso corrects a stale comment: the prior single-occupant is displaced by\nExclusiveMountStrategy''s own eviction in mount() (mount-strategies.ts),\nnot by afterMount''s URL-only replaced write. Documents the\nresolutionChanged-only gate and the clear-in-stop behavior as\ndeliberate defence-in-depth, since only their joint effect has an\nobservable test scenario.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"aae871d92ccea6795e74b2454b461377b5026a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/aae871d92ccea6795e74b2454b461377b5026a99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDRmZjExZmZhNzE1YTNiN2QxYWIwYzRkMjcxMDJhMDBjMmJlNThiNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2","sha":"2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2"}],"sha":"4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4ff11ffa715a3b7d1ab0c4d27102a00c2be58b63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:59:23Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"feat(template-shell): route the four shell domains and broadcast each occupant''s entry address\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccd65717b3df87965e12d0b210290007d4f78828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/ccd65717b3df87965e12d0b210290007d4f78828"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDI4MTFjMzYyYTA5YjMxMTczMzEyOWU5N2RlNDRiMmNiN2RmMzczZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525","sha":"be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525"}],"sha":"2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/2811c362a09b311733129e97de44b2cb7df373d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:46:19Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(template-shell): pin DomainRouting''s cardinality, nesting, and restart-safety fixes, plus independent fake-navigation subscriber release\n\n- Moves the resolutionChanged-swap test to a multiple-cardinality\n  domain, and adds a single-occupant counterpart proving mount(new) is\n  dispatched with NO unmount(prior) — pins the cardinality restriction.\n- Pins that a nested withOpening call combines with its outer call\n  into one replace instead of losing the outer collection.\n- Pins that a stop/start cycle does not unmount a still-mounted\n  extension when its token is rediscovered as added under a new owner.\n- Pins the afterUnmount guard directly (a stopped instance ignores\n  afterUnmount even when the URL still carries the token), and that\n  withOpening flushes and rethrows when fn throws.\n- Rewords the lastOwnerByToken JSDoc (covered by the fix commit).\n- fakeNavigation now keys subscribers by a registration token (mirrors\n  FanOutDispatcher''s SubscriberToken, so two subscriptions of the same\n  callback release independently) and isolates a throwing subscriber\n  via console.error instead of letting it unwind the round (mirrors\n  FanOutDispatcher.runRound''s catch + reportRoutingDefect, never\n  rethrowing) — pinned by a new fake-navigation.test.ts.\n\nMost of these tests fail on dffd7ef9 without their fix commit; the\nafterUnmount/withOpening-throw tests already passed there (the guards\nwere already in place, just unpinned) and are added here as\ncharacterization tests, not regression drivers.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b6602ca8aa5799102b7f1d392add2635ab086bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/0b6602ca8aa5799102b7f1d392add2635ab086bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGJlMmQ5N2FkNjYyOGY0ZDRiOTMyN2Y0ZTU3OWJlMTEwMWYwZDE1MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3","sha":"4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3"}],"sha":"be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/be2d97ad6628f4d4b9327f4e579be1101f0d1525"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:46:07Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(template-shell): scope DomainRouting''s prior-owner unmount to multiple-cardinality, nest withOpening, and clear lastOwnerByToken on stop\n\nThe resolutionChanged prior-owner unmount now fires only for a\n''multiple''-cardinality domain and only over diff.resolutionChanged\n(never diff.added) — a ''single''-cardinality domain''s own\nswitch-to-new-occupant write already retires the old occupant, so\ndispatching an unmount here too double-unmounted it; a token\nrediscovered as `added` (e.g. after a stop/start cycle) is not a\nresolutionChanged swap and must not be compared against a stale owner.\n\nwithOpening is now nest-safe: an inner call opened from inside an\nouter one''s fn shares the same collection instead of resetting it, and\nonly the outermost call''s own settlement flushes it.\n\nstop() now clears lastOwnerByToken, so a token rediscovered after a\nrestart is compared against nothing rather than the owner seen before\nthe domain stopped.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"d33419f3d05e5389284f857ea1d8b9c4111b4eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/d33419f3d05e5389284f857ea1d8b9c4111b4eaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKDRhZGQwOTZmYWQwMjcwMDljZTU4NjhlNjMyY2ZkNTRhMmQ5YzgyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc","sha":"c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc"}],"sha":"4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/4add096fad027009ce5868e632cfd54a2d9c82c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:37:31Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(template-shell): key entry-addresses fixtures by real extension ids\n\nKey the accept fixtures (and reject rows) by real GTS extension ids\nfrom the templates'' own mfe.json manifests instead of token-like\nplaceholders, keeping the extension token distinct from the map key\nand exercising a key containing both ~ and _.\n\nAdd reject rows for a domain-key segment and an extension token each\nstarting with a digit or a hyphen.\n\nReplace the validateName cross-check that only asserted two\nindependently-picked literal lists against each other with one that\nruns the same literals through both validateName and the schema\n(register/throw) and requires the same verdict, so the two can\nactually be shown in lockstep rather than merely claimed to be.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"359b194ab18886d3fb49ad8c642055192023557d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/359b194ab18886d3fb49ad8c642055192023557d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGMxZjhiMzk5ZmNiNWQ1ZmU5NDY5NGVlNDZjMDdiMjEzOTg0YzgxZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00","sha":"c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00"}],"sha":"c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c1f8b399fcb5d5fe94694ee46c07b213984c81fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:31:09Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"test(template-shell): harden the fake navigation double and close gaps in DomainRouting''s status, dispatch, and entry-address coverage\n\nfake-navigation.ts: the test double now snapshots each round''s\nHistoryNotification (including location) at push/replace/set time\ninstead of recomputing it lazily when a queued round drains, skips a\nsubscriber released mid-round via a liveness check against the live\nSet, and caps reentrant draining at the same round count the real\nFanOutDispatcher does (mirrored as a literal - the package does not\nre-export REENTRANT_ROUND_LIMIT). Adds subscriberCount() for proving a\nrelease actually happened.\n\ndomain-routing.test.ts / entry-address.test.ts add:\n- subscriberCount() assertions proving stop()/flush actually released\n  the history subscription, not just stopped firing by coincidence.\n- a dispatchChain describe block pinning all three DispatchResult\n  outcomes: synchronous throw, a rejecting chain promise (settled still\n  resolves), and a chain that returns nothing (#648).\n- a single-cardinality switch test asserting no unmount is dispatched\n  when one occupant replaces another directly.\n- coverage for the self-heal stray-duplicate-entry branch, a\n  resolutionChanged transition, subscribeStatus, and a positive\n  entryAddressFor result.\n- renames the start()-idempotency test off \"(echo)\", which belongs to\n  the separate echo-suppression test.\n- tests pinning that afterUnmount clears opening/pendingOpen, that no\n  write or subscription happens from a late afterMount/afterUnmount\n  after stop(), that an isolated status-listener throw does not stop\n  the remaining listeners, that a resolutionChanged swap unmounts the\n  prior owner, that two subscriptions of one listener release\n  independently, and that readEntryAddress rejects an invalid\n  domainKey/extension while accepting a nested domain''s composed key.\n\nVerified against f4c1c85 (before the domain-routing.ts fixes landed)\nthat the status/dispatch/entry-address behavior tests fail there,\nexercising production behavior this and prior commits fix. The\nsubscriberCount() and dispatchChain assertions also fail at f4c1c85,\nbut only because those fake-navigation.ts and dispatchChain helpers do\nnot exist yet at that commit, not because production behavior itself\nregresses there — they pin the current contract rather than drive a\nfix.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1b0c881495650ef22e94f49289fbac6fec85cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/e1b0c881495650ef22e94f49289fbac6fec85cdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246844849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GeraBart","id":246844849,"login":"GeraBart","node_id":"U_kgDODraNsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeraBart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00","node_id":"C_kwDOTn9Ds9oAKGMxOThlNzA4MDdiMDhlNzkzZmRmMmRhNmJjYjM4NTUxY2VjNDJkMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commit/022595078d35d6dac832ec937be03a3c37cad71e","sha":"022595078d35d6dac832ec937be03a3c37cad71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/022595078d35d6dac832ec937be03a3c37cad71e"}],"sha":"c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/c198e70807b08e793fdf2da6bcb38551cec42d00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263342938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/022595078d35d6dac832ec937be03a3c37cad71e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:30:54Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(template-shell): harden DomainRouting''s opening window, status listeners, resolutionChanged handling, and public surface\n\n- afterUnmount now drops a token from the opening/pendingOpen collection\n  it belongs to, so a widget unmounted mid-window is not written back\n  once the window closes.\n- afterMount/afterUnmount ignore a call that arrives after stop(), so a\n  late-settling mount never writes to history or opens an unreleased\n  pending-write subscription.\n- beginOpening/endOpening are replaced by withOpening(fn), which always\n  flushes the collected writes via try/finally even if fn throws.\n- A throwing status listener no longer stops the remaining listeners\n  from being notified.\n- dispatchChain uses a type-predicate isThenable check and\n  Promise.resolve(returned).catch instead of an inline cast.\n- A resolutionChanged swap (an owner replaced under a URL entry that\n  never left the URL) now unmounts the prior owner when it is still\n  mounted, tracked via a token->owner map DomainRouting keeps itself;\n  source() documents why it declares no onChange.\n- stop() resets status to zero and notifies status listeners, and\n  subscribeStatus keys its Set by a wrapper token rather than the\n  listener reference, so two subscriptions of the identical callback\n  stay independently releasable.\n- The routing/index.ts barrel exports exactly what the shell and\n  Widgets Host consume (DomainRouting, dispatchChain,\n  buildEntryAddresses, readEntryAddress, rootDomainKeyOf) instead of\n  `export *`; declaredRouteOf/extensionTokenOf and the\n  DomainRoutingOptions/DomainRouteStatus/DispatchResult types stay\n  internal.\n- readEntryAddress validates domainKey and extension as names before\n  trusting the shared-property value.\n- Renames options/label parameters, enclosingPresent takes its address\n  as an argument instead of a non-null assertion, and JSDoc documents\n  the repeat-mount and afterMount/afterUnmount ordering invariants.\n\nWidgets Host''s planned attach handler (WidgetsHostScreen.handleAttached)\ncalls beginOpening()/endOpening() directly; that call must become\nawait routing.withOpening(() => Promise.allSettled(...)) instead.\n\nSigned-off-by: G S <grigoriis.dev@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7c12fed64a1dcc51860244d17cde2ab96de9664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/trees/f7c12fed64a1dcc51860244d17cde2ab96de9664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/git/commits/022595078d35d6dac832ec937be03a3c37cad71e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"c