r_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gs-layer","id":263342938,"login":"gs-layer","node_id":"U_kgDOD7JLWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gs-layer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/gears-frontx-templates/commits/0db1185c47e2136309d6297d77074bb65c2c73eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:12:34Z","email":"grigoriis.dev@gmail.com","name":"G S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:43:56Z","email":"246844849+GeraBart@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GeraBart"},"message":"fix(template-shell): tighten the entry-addresses schema and its test fixtures\n\nTightens entry_addresses.v1.json with propertyNames.minLength on the\nextension-id map, and extends the reject table with an even segment\ncount, an empty segment, an extra property, and invalid extension\ntokens, plus a cross-check that the schema''s per-segment pattern\nagrees with routing''s validateName. Test fixtures switch from\ntoken-shaped placeholder keys (''ext.a''/''ext.b'') to extension-id-shaped\nkeys (''hello-world''/''widget-alpha''); real extension ids drawn from the\ntemplates'' own mfe.json manifests land in a later commit. Also pins\nthe register()-throw assertion to the actual GTS error message, moves\nschema registration into beforeAll, drops a redundant validateInstance\nassertion, documents in constants.ts and src/gts/index.ts why the\nentry-addresses constant is duplicated rather than re-exported through\n@gears-frontx/react like THEME/LANGUAGE, replaces the %o it.each title\nwith the route name, and points the test header at 