un3395/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/belljun3395","id":102807742,"login":"belljun3395","node_id":"U_kgDOBiC4vg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/commits/2346116f7f0a0659a3cda65d856be817aeb3ad58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:26:19Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:26:19Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"message":"fix(tracer-web): 패널을 닫아도 잡이 끝난 것을 받는다\n\n패널을 닫으면 잡 조회가 꺼져 완료 알림이 와도 상태가 굳었고, 그 표시가\n버튼을 잠가 다시 열 길까지 막았다. 실행 중인 잡은 닫아도 계속 묻는다.\n접수한 잡을 곧바로 최신 자리에 앉혀 지난 결과가 비치지 않게 하고, 끝은\n상태 대신 잡의 id로 잰다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94afb4445b1fd07ba524c2872f474026b1e5fe04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/trees/94afb4445b1fd07ba524c2872f474026b1e5fe04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/commits/2346116f7f0a0659a3cda65d856be817aeb3ad58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102807742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/following{/othe