"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:37:35Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:37:35Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"message":"fix(tracer-web): 트레이스에서 고른 이벤트로 피드와 그래프가 따라간다\n\n숨은 레인의 이벤트를 고르면 아무 반응이 없어 그 레인을 다시 보인다.\n그래프는 고른 노드의 자리를 뒤늦게 알게 돼도 초점을 다시 맞춘다.\n고른 턴의 단추가 한 턴만 떼는 동작임을 말하고, 분리 표시에서 바로 되돌린다.\n분리 모달의 이름표가 한글에 맞는 자간으로 서고 구획 간격이 고르다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9542bf608df191882c4d211c593cb0f89fcd1c70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/trees/9542bf608df191882c4d211c593cb0f89fcd1c70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/commits/4753ac5d2df823ffcd6387a090bcacf57e6ba97a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102807742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/belljun3395","id":102807742,"login":"belljun3395","node_id":"U_kgDOBiC4vg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/commit/4753ac5d2df823ffcd6387a090bcacf57e6ba97a","node_id":"C_kwDOTo