","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T11:16:49Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T11:16:49Z","email":"195850@jnu.ac.kr","name":"belljun3395"},"message":"feat(tracer-web): 규칙 화면이 규칙과 생성 이력을 탭으로 구분한다\n\n생성 실행 카드가 규칙 목록 위에 섞여 규칙이 없는 화면도 실행 카드로 찼다.\n탭으로 둘을 구분하고 필터는 규칙 탭에만 남기며 이력 탭은 잘라내지 않은\n전체를 시각과 함께 보인다. 실행하는 요청을 지우면 실행기가 종결할 자리를\n잃어 관측과 궤적이 영원히 비므로 종료된 요청만 지우고 나머지는 409로 막는다.","tree":{"sha":"39c255b22716de6e08b0e0fa4073f4b76ce27a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/trees/39c255b22716de6e08b0e0fa4073f4b76ce27a35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/git/commits/c9e7bf2d45a06c1d92536e545bbd2d68bbcadc18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102807742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/belljun3395","id":102807742,"login":"belljun3395","node_id":"U_kgDOBiC4vg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belljun3395","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/agent-tracer/agent-tracer/commit/c9e7bf2d45a06c1d92536e545bbd2d68bbcadc18","node_id":"C_kwDOToIUx9oAKGM5ZTdiZjJkNDVhMDZjMWQ5MjUzNmU1NDViYmQyZDY4YmJjYWRj