te-config-environment-cleanup/tasks.md.\n\nChanges:\n- Created ADR-0011 (per-customer demo deployments) documenting config overlay pattern, short-lived branch policy, demo tier lifecycle, and feature flag approach\n- Amended ADR-0006 (graceful failure handling) with dated note clarifying graceful degradation is per-MFE only; whole-manifest substitution (FALLBACK_REMOTES) removed to prevent latent prod-loads-dev incidents\n- Updated CONTEXT.md to reflect manifest failure behavior change (retry then critical error; no cache fallback)\n- Verified glossary consistency for local/dev/demo terms per ADR-0011\n\nAll task groups (1-4) now complete for remote-config-environment-cleanup change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqf2OiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeTIQACtW/zMJR0jm5KxerlT/YCp1\n8Cd35FG3gxQ3EaX1zQ9D53+Y1gy1gm3MPkEY85jCFzap20qJ7Hfgbko1De3zphsG\nqK4EQhkaU3dNahfCXBE8Wr90VLp1R50+b3Vkmg3wd0Tzmq5yatNizf5iIuWLf+xd\nvlkyAlaMsdEeOxd72l0QBfR1UUUG+6Ec5xIHWq0ghrVMh3+cfPWUpVmGwUNluLQb\njT2d3HW1NLhVuJ9gO6LvUscO4fKrAb60YnBwCSHIDV/umLcu94CDBe7fDgSP5C4X\nsunfhuc9sZDJSCh1bfllVghbYGuCK+zcSX3Ete+MJtMAqUNCvvb4gkJEJf+AuFcx\nLDO8HaBv6f5z1jmtsQ9VqC158oLwLBtOFnyJkrzXkP5o2JQ7zY/I73AGNOboknuW\nYZ92YPEL3wADS9jEotfA1Sb3BC9LDyn28UM0QH+uM7pdOqdsdBP6IN/PsQGTHDUe\nTlKl6qP/ioU80USKyuAjqeNc/BbL5i0H0NmvB2y6Rt1oPpocDVB2R1E3SOwG65Ps\nKj8YYpfOFSPAfLmzABQ5Ak9Z+dRSYQm4Kn1Dy7axBdmnHpg/HlqGAXI4oD4pXLqD\nJ3Nfhm4pgDfzWHRaUgi3X78KEu+dshjVgzK+M/Fmee4iwIuxByjn2N927CzVF/pp\nBXOyzZCfP0ZPAsnX7jZM\n=8NlK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T18:51:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g