etch failure renders critical-error UI only\n\nChanges:\n- Deleted apps/shells/website/src/config/remotes.ts (FALLBACK_REMOTES)\n- Updated manifest.ts to reject on fetch failure instead of returning fallback\n- Updated manifest.test.ts to expect rejections\n- Updated runtime-config.ts to propagate fetch failures (no fallback)\n- Updated app-config.ts comment to remove FALLBACK_REMOTES reference\n- Deleted turbo/generators/templates/shell/src/config/remotes.ts\n- Updated shell generator templates to match (no fallback)\n- Added bootstrap-failure.integration.test.ts stub\n\n* test: fix runtime-config test and remove empty integration test stub\n\n- Updated runtime-config.test.ts to expect rejection when manifest fetch fails (TSB-1)\n- Removed bootstrap-failure.integration.test.ts (empty stub causing test suite error)\n- Test now validates manifest.load() rejects instead of falling back to FALLBACK_REMOTES\n\n* test: add schema validation failure test to improve branch coverage\n\n- Added test case for manifest response that fails schema validation\n- Covers the ''Manifest failed schema validation'' branch in manifest.ts:29\n- Should push branch coverage from 58.33% to above 59% threshold\n\n* test: fix unhandled promise rejections in manifest tests\n\n- Changed tests to catch promise rejections explicitly instead of using expect().rejects\n- Prevents ''Unhandled Rejection'' errors when using fake timers with async retries\n- Tests now verify Error instance and message instead of relying on .rejects.toThrow()\n- Fixes CI test failures caused by unhandled promise rejections","tree":{"sha":"626f2d79a16a2ae4d2e9ac7c642e15296880c024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/626f2d79a16a2ae4d2e9ac7c642e15296880c024"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/b41297a3842c6f6a479ed4f26f23968f0d0edc78","verification":{"payload":"tree 626f2d79a16a2ae4d2e9ac7c642e15296880c024\nparent 2c43226fd00fd835d92ff5e7e1387176640c07a