vironment-cleanup] (#92)\n\n* feat(config): implement task group 2 (config generator: local mode, root MFE, local override) [remote-config-environment-cleanup]\n\nImplements tasks 2.1–2.5 from openspec/changes/remote-config-environment-cleanup/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- CG-1: environment mode ''local'' replaces ''development'', old name rejected with guidance\n- CG-2: generator honors shell''s root MFE designation\n- CG-3: generator produces the local override manifest incl. dry-run\n\nChanges:\n- Added config-generator.test.ts with tests for local mode, development rejection, and root MFE designation\n- Updated config-generator.ts to reject ''development'' environment with guidance, support ''local'' mode with localhost URLs, and honor rootMfe designation\n- Updated types.ts ConfigGenerationOptions to add ''local'' environment and rootMfe parameter\n- Updated scripts/generate-config.ts to support --environment local, --root-mfe flag, auto-derive output path for local overrides, and improve CLI help\n- Updated docs/manifest-generator.md with local mode semantics, root MFE workflow, and local override documentation\n\nVerification evidence in PR_BODY.md at the worktree root.\n\n* test: add chrome MFE and validation tests to improve branch coverage\n\nAdds tests for:\n- Chrome MFE detection and placement\n- Schema validation\n\nBranch coverage: 73.68% → 77.89% (above 75% threshold)","tree":{"sha":"0a2df2f491d69001b979f12c1f074ce5831a3a4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/0a2df2f491d69001b979f12c1f074ce5831a3a4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/2c43226fd00fd835d92ff5e7e1387176640c07a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a2df2f491d69001b979f12c1f074ce5831a3a4d\nparent 697524f6e42a6f0dbff557e6e8d945f05ef14e0a\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1786719035 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786719035 +0200\n\nfeat(config): config generator - local mode, root MFE, local override (tasks 2.1–2.5) [remote-config-environment-cleanup] (#92)\n\n* feat(config): implement task group 2 (config generator: local mode, root MFE, local override) [remote-config-environment-cleanup]\n\nImplements tasks 2.1–2.5 from openspec/changes/remote-config-environment-cleanup/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- CG-1: environment mode ''local'' replaces ''development'', old name rejected with guidance\n- CG-2: generator honors shell''s root MFE designation\n- CG-3: generator produces the local override manifest incl. dry-run\n\nChanges:\n- Added config-generator.test.ts with tests for local mode, development rejection, and root MFE designation\n- Updated config-generator.ts to reject ''development'' environment with guidance, support ''local'' mode with localhost URLs, and honor rootMfe designation\n- Updated types.ts ConfigGenerationOptions to add ''local'' environment and rootMfe parameter\n- Updated scripts/generate-config.ts to support --environment local, --root-mfe flag, auto-derive output path for local overrides, and improve CLI help\n- Updated docs/manifest-generator.md with local mode semantics, root MFE workflow, and local override documentation\n\nVerification evidence in PR_BODY.md at the worktree root.\n\n* test: add chrome MFE and validation tests to improve branch coverage\n\nAdds tests for:\n- Chrome MFE detection and placement\n- Schema validation\n\nBranch coverage: 73.68% → 77.89% (above 75% threshold)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfys7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAliEQAEw9NjqzoKelLZLkbO0AzkAL\nAepUhGzagUnXyrNe773gxmcij6X6kknLdJq1wyJ7qmAtvkS8dxL1TAg4n7qEwf4/\npUfPSLLKz+nR0kfvaW332zvyTvQaPwdPjSqS5W4UMi0o4VN0vSbIfJEwjLEvYsYt\nV7rYW1HdHAM6Zh43g1tOandXVmcczIJuUlx0lfTqFHrD0zcl5ggXLDzFoed6PtAv\nFATkfGB2vwbZEDHwRRm1bZWTUEv70NiRnm7OetzKtEHnWf5AKFyTZPZjHr5ps5Oi\nsu/QtDh3N8wEUD7rviIK++0syes6NNXhYNE/9YH5BZboHcNq7hVPJvgjg4DwR378\nN5fSlpl8uduKCWEpjgQ740yy8hBeDnR7vW+aTn/nzYSUaaIiWXT3vBa2jJUTq