y returns mapped ports (test coverage verified)\n- REQ-005: Manifest generation from resolved map (docs, tests, integration verified)\n\nTask 2.1: Updated docs and glossary\n- README.md: Replaced ''alphabetical port allocation'' with ''canonical local port map''\n- openspec/specs/monorepo-discovery/spec.md: Updated requirements to reflect port map resolution\n- openspec/specs/config-generation/spec.md: Updated development URL port assignment description\n- CONTEXT.md: Local Port Map glossary entry already accurate\n\nTask 2.2: Verified spec test coverage\n- 51 tests passing in monorepo-tools package\n- All requirements (REQ-001 through REQ-005) have explicit test coverage\n- Tests verify: port map I/O, port availability, resolution logic, discovery, persistence, manifest generation\n\nTask 2.3: Validated shell boot integration\n- Verified getResolvedPort() usage in shell vite.config.ts\n- Created test-shell-boot.mjs demonstrating config generation from port map\n- Validated localhost URLs can be generated from .local-port-map.json\n- Shell integration with port map verified\n\nVerification evidence in PR_BODY.md at worktree root.","tree":{"sha":"dd92bb9684491a7063e380bb4ccd6143e7ac0f9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/dd92bb9684491a7063e380bb4ccd6143e7ac0f9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/cb890fdc48279e51b0ab9356dbdaba0c825e106b","verification":{"payload":"tree dd92bb9684491a7063e380bb4ccd6143e7ac0f9d\nparent 5bb133c1d2badddf57295b79aa7ea83e8293045f\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1786530740 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786530740 +0200\n\ndocs(dev): task group 2 - spec, docs, and regression coverage [local-port-map-for-mfe-development] (#87)\n\nImplements tasks 2.1-2.3 from openspec/changes/local-port-map-for-mfe-development/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- REQ-001: Canonical local port map as source of truth (docs, glossary, specs)\n- REQ-002: Preferred port resolution (test coverage verified)\n- REQ-003: Stable port reuse (test coverage verified)\n- REQ-004: Discovery returns mapped ports (test coverage verified)\n- REQ-005: Manifest generation from resolved map (docs, tests, integration verified)\n\nTask 2.1: Updated docs and glossary\n- README.md: Replaced ''alphabetical port allocation'' with ''canonical local port map''\n- openspec/specs/monorepo-discovery/spec.md: Updated requirements to reflect port map resolution\n- openspec/specs/config-generation/spec.md: Updated development URL port assignment description\n- CONTEXT.md: Local Port Map glossary entry already accurate\n\nTask 2.2: Verified spec test coverage\n- 51 tests passing in monorepo-tools package\n- All requirements (REQ-001 through REQ-005) have explicit test coverage\n- Tests verify: port map I/O, port availability, resolution logic, discovery, persistence, manifest generation\n\nTask 2.3: Validated shell boot integration\n- Verified getResolvedPort() usage in shell vite.config.ts\n- Created test-shell-boot.mjs demonstrating config generation from port map\n- Validated localhost URLs can be generated from .local-port-map.json\n- Shell integration with port map verified\n\nVerification evidence in PR_BODY.md at worktree root.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfEu0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9+cQAIGo09I6RDJw7UWUluL0eEz3\npRU6aGo81BcSrBCA+X/jnaqtKAjJhlWkgjIpBCM1rCd4/zgjQ5P4GPwCd+Mrkcnz\nXBOYtDBPKrLsT1NKoo1VRnpkW2P2qSvi9ltfs/7a6IlQ8QPcqaHB+yxKdHwixJlp\nmIfiaVybHut4EyEX/70MyFq6CIiD6jQhR/6YftaAPiCmNGKrlcePwZEVpM3rY3Gy\n/IJ5ojAXLoh44GzcDVV6UMvij7cTRYl0yAle+x3WylZ+oZ2YfuHfek1In9vTYw19\neCO3gZhTlaGK7IfEo/hoxTpxZRpw4iWXUsYvs274opNB8QrtUV8SyYpO/XnRagj4\nvN9/pp+mCB8q/gB1D10ZEz5iG66cAtn/ZiKiwZO/CTc1MBrWZPyyulPBlxQG4Mu0\ntXiHZgoPPBiODcCGpwfplw9ebCT6JD0K7t7E5rWWNvdpnBpu4c26zzWdkPnpm7rg\ndJfOyX/jO8V0sutECZTJADkg58y/oa2//6rEJldsY2rrye+WATst0K0/kYdN6qXf\nySI3ZCpsTj1yszISsNbhWUR1S8TqSL9ugn67sYHP9GYAoqK1D6s1jfP