//api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/5bb133c1d2badddf57295b79aa7ea83e8293045f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:19:41Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:19:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dev): canonical local port map for MFE development (#85)\n\n* docs(spec): add local port map OpenSpec change\n\nAdd OpenSpec change for canonical local port map that maintains\nstable development ports for shells and MFEs. Replaces implicit\nport assignment with explicit port resolution and reuse.\n\nKey capabilities:\n- Canonical local port map for all shells and MFEs\n- Automatic port conflict resolution with fallback\n- Stable port reuse across dev server restarts\n- Generated manifest URLs from resolved port map\n\nChange ID: local-port-map-for-mfe-development\nTask groups: 2 (canonical resolution, specs/docs/tests)\n\n* feat(dev): canonical local port map and resolution (tasks 1.1–1.5) [local-port-map-for-mfe-development] (#84)\n\n* feat(dev): implement canonical local port map and resolution (tasks 1.1–1.5)\n\nImplements tasks 1.1-1.5 from openspec/changes/local-port-map-for-mfe-development/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- REQ-001: System SHALL maintain a canonical local port map\n- REQ-002: System SHALL resolve occupied preferred ports to alternate ports\n- REQ-003: System SHALL keep resolved ports stable while available\n- REQ-004: Discovery SHALL resolve ports from canonical map\n- REQ-005: System SHALL generate local manifest URLs from resolved port map\n\nChanges:\n- Added port-map.ts with canonical port map persistence and resolution logic\n- Added comprehensive unit tests for port map (20 tests)\n- Updated discovery.ts to use port map for port resolution\n- Added discovery tests covering mapped ports and preferred port fallback (9 tests)\n- Added vite-port-helper.ts for Vite config integration\n- Updated shell and MFE vite configs to use resolved ports\n- Added mfe.port field to MFE package.json files for preferred ports\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude .local-port-map.json (local state)\n- Generated remotes.config.json now uses resolved port map URLs\n\nVerification evidence in REVIEW.md at the worktree root.\n\n* fix(lint): resolve lint errors from CI\n\n- Use ''vite-plus/test'' instead of ''vitest'' in test imports\n- Remove duplicate optimizeDeps key in mfe-widget vite.config.ts","tree":{"sha":"6dadc7949d59e302f7e5a9cd0f265f24b42100b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/6dadc7949d59e302f7e5a9cd0f265f24b42100b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/5bb133c1d2badddf57295b79aa7ea83e8293045f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6dadc7949d59e302f7e5a9cd0f265f24b42100b8\nparent 8fb1a903af9bbf51275c369746983c322b7943c5\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1786526381 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786526381 +0200\n\nfeat(dev): canonical local port map for MFE development (#85)\n\n* docs(spec): add local port map OpenSpec change\n\nAdd OpenSpec change for canonical local port map that maintains\nstable development ports for shells and MFEs. Replaces implicit\nport assignment with explicit port resolution and reuse.\n\nKey capabilities:\n- Canonical local port map for all shells and MFEs\n- Automatic port conflict resolution with fallback\n- Stable port reuse across dev server restarts\n- Generated manifest URLs from resolved port map\n\nChange ID: local-port-map-for-mfe-development\nTask groups: 2 (canonical resolution, specs/docs/tests)\n\n* feat(dev): canonical local port map and resolution (tasks 1.1–1.5) [local-port-map-for-mfe-development] (#84)\n\n* feat(dev): implement canonical local port map and resolution (tasks 1.1–1.5)\n\nImplements tasks 1.1-1.5 from openspec/changes/local-port-map-for-mfe-development/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- REQ-001: System SHALL maintain a canonical local port map\n- REQ-002: System SHALL resolve occupied preferred ports to alternate ports\n- REQ-003: System SHALL keep resolved ports stable while available\n- REQ-004: Discovery SHALL resolve ports from canonical map\n- REQ-005: System SHALL generate local manifest URLs from resolved port map\n\nChanges:\n- Added port-map.ts with canonical port map persistence and resolution logic\n- Added comprehensive unit tests for port map (20 tests)\n- Updated discovery.ts to use port map for port resolution\n- Added discovery tests covering mapped ports and preferred port fallback (9 tests)\n- Added vite-port-helper.ts for Vite config integration\n- Updated shell and MFE vite configs to use resolved ports\n- Added mfe.port field to MFE package.json files for preferred ports\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude .local-port-map.json (local state)\n- Generated remotes.config.json now uses resolved port map URLs\n\nVerification evidence in REVIEW.md at the worktree root.\n\n* fix(lint): resolve lint errors from CI\n\n- Use ''vite-plus/test'' instead of ''vitest'' in test imports\n- Remove duplicate optimizeDeps key in mfe-widget vite.config.ts","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAA