, critical-error,\n  auth-bridge setup, resilient config loaders\n- @mfe-runtime/test-utils: auth mocks, renderWithRouter, vitest preset\n\nExtended packages:\n- @mfe-runtime/auth: JWT helpers (decodeJWT, userFromToken, hasRequiredRoles)\n- @mfe-runtime/dynamic-loader: createMFELifecycle helper (ADR-0007)\n- @mfe-runtime/monorepo-tools: createMFEViteConfig + createShellViteConfig\n\nConsumers migrated: website shell, mfe-widget, mfe-landing-page\nGenerator templates updated to thin wrappers\n\n7 parallel-safe task groups, 2-wave execution plan\nopenspec validate: pass, isComplete: true","tree":{"sha":"f0661f075a20cf06b11e1f1973e65d287323baa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/f0661f075a20cf06b11e1f1973e65d287323baa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/e1bac8cdf23b57b4521aadee8771117556bd2cae","verification":{"payload":"tree f0661f075a20cf06b11e1f1973e65d287323baa0\nparent 3fdf28afccfa048ebec9f3cf0187e5287b171fda\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1786221678 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786221678 +0200\n\nfeat(openspec): add shared-boilerplate-packages change spec (#70)\n\nExtract ~390 LoC/shell and ~150 LoC/MFE of duplicated boilerplate into\nshared packages via a validated OpenSpec change.\n\nNew packages:\n- @mfe-runtime/shell-kit: runtime-config factory, slots, critical-error,\n  auth-bridge setup, resilient config loaders\n- @mfe-runtime/test-utils: auth mocks, renderWithRouter, vitest preset\n\nExtended packages:\n- @mfe-runtime/auth: JWT helpers (decodeJWT, userFromToken, hasRequiredRoles)\n- @mfe-runtime/dynamic-loader: createMFELifecycle helper (ADR-0007)\n- @mfe-runtime/monorepo-tools: createMFEViteConfig + createShellViteConfig\n\nConsumers migrated: website shell, mfe-widget, mfe-landing-page\nGenerator templates updated to thin wrappers\n\n7 parallel-safe task groups, 2-wave execution plan\nopenspec validate: pass, isComplete: true","r