rs/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/bf4a4fed68218580134568c6f0eb7cf24ba70462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T00:25:57Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T00:25:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gen): add shell generator (TG3) (#67)\n\n* feat(gen): add shell generator with thin caller workflows\n\nImplements Task Group 3: Shell generator\n\nTasks completed:\n- 3.1: Create shell template from website anatomy (thin-shell main.ts, slots, configs)\n- 3.2: Create caller workflow template matching deploy-website.yml\n- 3.3: Wire shell to cleanup-previews.yml shell fallback list\n- 3.4: Verify scaffolded shell (build ✅, bundle size ✅, workflow YAML ✅)\n\nShell generator features:\n- Scaffolds complete thin shell from template\n- Pre-populates remotes.config.{dev,prod}.json from discovered MFEs\n- Generates deploy-<name>.yml caller workflow\n- Wires shell to cleanup workflow (idempotent, alphabetically sorted)\n- Includes all shell-runtime infrastructure (auth, slots, manifest, critical-error)\n\nGenerated shell structure:\n- package.json with generate:config and check:size scripts\n- src/main.ts: thin-shell bootstrap entry\n- src/shell/: runtime-config, critical-error, auth-bridge, slots, manifest\n- public/app-config.json: app configuration\n- public/remotes.config.{dev,prod}.json: pre-populated from discovered MFEs\n- vite.config.ts, vitest.config.ts, tsconfig.json\n- index.html with shell templates\n\nGenerated workflow features:\n- Thin caller pattern (delegates to reusable deploy-shell.yml)\n- main + release-* + <name>-v* tag triggers\n- Path filters for shell source and shared packages\n- Channel extraction job (dev/release-<version>)\n- Proper inputs: shell-name, shell-path, package-name, tag-prefix\n\nVerification results (scratch shell):\n- ✅ Build passed (tsc + vite build)\n- ✅ Bundle size: 424/500 lines (76 lines headroom)\n- ✅ Workflow YAML valid\n- ✅ Remote configs pre-populated with 2 MFEs\n- ✅ Cleanup workflow updated\n\nWire-shell helper features:\n- discoverMFEsForShell(): scans apps/mfes/* for all MFEs\n- Extracts port from vite.config.ts\n- Generates dev configs with localhost URLs\n- Generates prod configs with blob URL patterns\n- Schema validation inherited from remote-config package\n\nTechnical notes:\n- Includes all TG1 + TG2 files (TG3 depends on both)\n- Shell templates copied from website and parameterized\n- Function names use {{ titleName }} (e.g., createScratchShellRuntimeConfig)\n- Tests not included (no test files in template)\n\nRelated: mfe-shell-scaffolding OpenSpec change (PR #64), TG1 (PR #65), TG2 (PR #66)\n\n* fix(test): use vite-plus/test instead of vitest\n\n* chore: regenerate app-config schema\n\nFix schema formatting to match CI expectations\n\n* chore: update pnpm-lock.yaml","tree":{"sha":"495baac84ecb9f5cef5885476097625a74f8f5a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/495baac84ecb9f5cef5885476097625a74f8f5a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/bf4a4fed68218580134568c6f0eb7cf24ba70462","verification":{"payload":"tree 495baac84ecb9f5cef5885476097625a74f8f5a8\n