verMFEsForShell(): scans apps/mfes/* for all MFEs\n- Extracts port from vite.config.ts\n- Generates dev configs with localhost URLs\n- Generates prod configs with blob URL patterns\n- Schema validation inherited from remote-config package\n\nTechnical notes:\n- Includes all TG1 + TG2 files (TG3 depends on both)\n- Shell templates copied from website and parameterized\n- Function names use {{ titleName }} (e.g., createScratchShellRuntimeConfig)\n- Tests not included (no test files in template)\n\nRelated: mfe-shell-scaffolding OpenSpec change (PR #64), TG1 (PR #65), TG2 (PR #66)\n\n* fix(test): use vite-plus/test instead of vitest\n\n* chore: regenerate app-config schema\n\nFix schema formatting to match CI expectations\n\n* chore: update pnpm-lock.yaml","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdneVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXfMQAC2jrCpSp77EiOY0ZwZm/woi\noFWBzzEi139Xlk33EyipPC1s4q7S3pu+cqI9xRD9aW7sICYqJP7Kgj+SHIOjqF/M\nHNnUsxmkHEUFJukoqJZqhelHdO7qlyVmv7uPQeX8OVGCDTqLofv5DH//j3UiJgsi\nNBaTsoIF2o/ynr6QT0rx8e8sESYs4yHCScuv9UvZfZzRsRMdWTc1nQMIXtQfzV5X\nXft1mK63rY26sIqfXCv1Xfx4rL66R0AQZ/GevwIjyD4boi81jYqJEDHgtoKL3n56\nJsHQnjdS41K3HMwkfd80Cd4HlFxrfkozgTJ2ju5QkYclMGC9Ce/kzVNEEdGHB/GF\njNnAVsFxApcZkGYdqpnDmzXrNT9GJJtY2JVYP1epNI0ro+SwLB1Uj5vMza6YUEuT\nRAQ14kP14OImPQkDyLOXOVjSteiqQ4Lqf1IlqoSeRwFkLmT0pfpmWcvToSSwI2kF\nv2e4fGQ69bPyT7qxKWFSXLFuLuvAAAyD5uf+fO7Wv7/uzUMoWXGXfK6aS3OwG+XJ\ncofRANZfu7bC0sYhWxgF0ljpKd7CS2EbdNadnjSC7fE7uvpNTGLlU4UDhkL3fN6w\nzHPiPn2S3MEqq3wxwLqLzCMswni04xSfFQK3A6so+KsOqrpTo058xB7eiSDqy6KU\nOEbg3YsL0yTBhc2DFbWA\n=U0Yb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T00:29:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/