 each target branch\n- Creates backport PR on success\n- Comments on source PR with manual instructions on conflict\n- Supports multiple backport targets (multiple labels)\n\nChanges to docs/runbooks/azure-blob-provisioning.md:\n- Add release channel path structure examples\n- Document Rule 3 lifecycle policy\n- Update exclusions list (floating dev, prod, active channels)\n- Clarify wildcard prefix usage\n\nNew file docs/release-process.md:\n- Complete release channel workflow guide\n- Branch cutting procedure with version bump discipline\n- Fix-on-main + backport rule\n- Backport automation usage\n- Shell redeploy after MFE backport note\n- Branch protection recommendations for release-*\n- Deployment paths reference table\n- Import map generation with channels\n- Troubleshooting guide\n\nRequirements:\n- REQ-5.1: azure-blob-storage-layout lifecycle requirement\n- REQ-5.2: backport-automation cherry-pick requirement\n- REQ-5.3: backport-automation conflict feedback requirement\n- REQ-5.4: Documentation requirements (runbook + release process)\n\nSpec: openspec/changes/release-channel-deployments/specs/azure-blob-storage-layout/spec.md\nSpec: openspec/changes/release-channel-deployments/specs/backport-automation/spec.md","tree":{"sha":"f2bcd8122545ad4080323a9cceb2266533f191b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/f2bcd8122545ad4080323a9cceb2266533f191b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/6ff62334852101f65bc9ec629cd283d885cb1670","verification":{"payload":"tree f2bcd8122545ad4080323a9cceb2266533f191b5\nparent 0cbd2ccc5348a560ac2c9866bf98f1ea12dd95c1\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1786108194 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786108194 +0200\n\nfeat(release): add lifecycle policy, backport automation, and docs (tasks 5.1-5.4) (#61)\n\nImplements release-channel-deployments Task Group 5:\n- Task 5.1: Lifecycle rule for release-* blobs (90 days)\n- Task 5.2: Backport automation workflow\n- Task 5.3: Conflict feedback on cherry-pick failures\n- Task 5.4: Update provisioning runbook and create release process doc\n\nChanges to scripts/azure/lifecycle-policy.json:\n- Add Rule 3: delete-release-channels-after-90-days\n- Wildcard prefix match: mfes-dev/*/release-, dev-shell/*/release-\n- Confirms existing pr-/sha- rules unchanged\n- Documents prod/floating exclusions\n\nNew file .github/workflows/backport.yml:\n- Triggers on merged PRs to main with backport labels\n- Extracts target branches from ''backport release-X.Y'' labels\n- Cherry-picks merge commit to each target branch\n- Creates backport PR on success\n- Comments on source PR with manual instructions on conflict\n- Supports multiple backport targets (multiple labels)\n\nChanges to docs/runbooks/azure-blob-provisioning.md:\n- Add release channel path structure examples\n- Document Rule 3 lifecycle policy\n- Update exclusions list (floating dev, prod, active channels)\n- Clarify wildcard prefix usage\n\nNew file docs/release-process.md:\n- Complete release channel workflow guide\n- Branch cutting procedure with version bump discipline\n- Fix-on-main + backport rule\n- Backport automation usage\n- Shell redeploy after MFE backport note\n- Branch protection recommendations for release-*\n- Deployment paths reference table\n- Import map generation with channels\n- Troubleshooting guide\n\nRequirements:\n- REQ-5.1: azure-blob-storage-layout lifecycle requirement\n- REQ-5.2: backport-automation cherry-pick requirement\n- REQ-5.3: backport-automation conflict feedback requirement\n- REQ-5.4: Documentation requirements (runbook + release process)\n\nSpec: openspec/changes/release-channel-deployments/specs/azure-blob-storage-layout/spec.md\nSpec: openspec/changes/release-channel-deployments/specs/backport-automation/spec.md","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqddkiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5YsQAE/4++6s3YTJy40OM9AzTEuI\nm6qCM8fAwkNmB7X91+H