ists() using fetch HEAD request\n- Update CLI to accept --channel parameter\n- Preserve existing behavior when no channel provided\n\nBehavior:\n- No channel: unchanged (localhost for dev, versioned for prod)\n- Channel provided + exists: use <mfe>/<channel>/remoteEntry.js\n- Channel provided + missing: fallback to <mfe>/dev/remoteEntry.js\n- Log warning when falling back to dev\n\nRequirements:\n- REQ-3.1: Channel-aware URL requirement\n- Scenario: Channel URL when build exists\n- Scenario: Dev fallback when build missing\n- Scenario: No channel = existing behavior\n\nSpec: openspec/changes/release-channel-deployments/specs/config-generation/spec.md","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdc9aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADYcQAGqmcSeH3Bgq3ledD7F+C09y\niOYCgmM7hjGdGEVjf+5eaHFMP2eAl8UjEjz5QElzSbzgjeS16MzEegecZfBAmi2b\nfna5zV/NbUxz4WHcCYVY0oU6O1Jzp9UOYgkO+Zs9Ms3Zb2wPQlOfqzndsz4jPyL3\n74Sw/QG58I01BZ0HKgc0DPpSjLfZzAbyNTGUWrxH35fMZJ9poEG1wfAVGzjNJAT0\nzDGSpAhCyhAhwUl54Jurpuxs87eKiO6P7oWBr32W75FAiqEECpBAm9GMV285TmwA\ndgwqnOzebS3N7GDSrePFKq0PDl1qtmEwzn3j8Ldl3BmGwaCMzaYwrq2PlUtkmJ/P\n4Bd8j5kLq/oFjnbqAwz5lF63hsDOARCm2cHhd9kA11ugeY+A//WdJqLTVpGI9Bp8\nvdFs6gnHlGGtItKdRNt/94h2hSzDGGMRG/6flqT0gZqSG7FOW4mz+D2lOp5Wubuy\n528OWqoLbXjJPMCWx1/v/7T0KMjwTQXcslHTr9DTT6hdPBIeh5Ui/DiibqC/Qa59\nUsIIcZk+Btcmwt1uKv25QuLy3G/jE/RyZ+OaHBvpbZ5Qy46M37zphGXgWItyqen5\njkJo/KjBw0+NrTFkPvJmLtxT3CGam+xpyURbKqE5yiVp2BHGbhg+b2Q9zNvrQfFa\naMIo6d/hqnD2Y3iZwXVm\n=EGU7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T00:05:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,