ession) [app-config-contract] (#44)\n\nImplements tasks 4.1–4.3 from openspec/changes/app-config-contract/tasks.md.\n\nRoadmap Updates:\n- Added section 2.3: Kubernetes Deploy-Time Config Validation (deferred design)\n- Documents Helm pre-install/pre-upgrade hook validation approach\n- Details initContainer gate, customer values schema, CI validation\n- Captures prerequisites and skills needed for future implementation\n- Updated section 2.2 note: references environment-configuration supersession\n\nSupersession Documentation:\n- Created openspec/changes/environment-configuration/SUPERSEDED.md\n- Documents what carried over: type-safe config, boot-time loading, public config\n- Documents what was dropped: hostname-based env detection, ConfigService singleton, ConfigProvider\n- Explains rationale for simplification (K8s deployment, multi-tenant, complexity)\n- Provides migration notes and references\n\nAll tasks complete - app-config-contract change fully implemented!","tree":{"sha":"21fc967027c5c34612681bc329f08d5e4cf68612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/21fc967027c5c34612681bc329f08d5e4cf68612"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/c8255e61ba79621b8349de6c7672c22a491c2bec","verification":{"payload":"tree 21fc967027c5c34612681bc329f08d5e4cf68612\nparent 7c5e6549fb10cd3aca1ef38e5c3990b9c921cdcc\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1785967954 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785967954 +0200\n\ndocs: implement task group 4 (roadmap and supersession) [app-config-contract] (#44)\n\nImplements tasks 4.1–4.3 from openspec/changes/app-config-contract/tasks.md.\n\nRoadmap Updates:\n- Added section 2.3: Kubernetes Deploy-Time Config Validation (deferred design)\n- Documents Helm pre-install/pre-upgrade hook validation approach\n- Details initContainer gate, customer values schema, CI validation\n- Captures prerequisites and skills needed for future implementation