s_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/7c5e6549fb10cd3aca1ef38e5c3990b9c921cdcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T21:51:54Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T21:51:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(shell): shell boot validation (tasks 2.1-2.5) [app-config-contract] (#42)\n\n* feat(shell): implement task group 2 (shell boot validation) [app-config-contract]\n\nImplements tasks 2.1–2.5 from openspec/changes/app-config-contract/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- SBV-1: Boot-time validation before runtime start\n- SBV-2: Mode-dependent failure handling (dev fallback vs prod error)\n- SBV-3: Served app config document is schema-valid\n- AAR-2: Schema.json bundled into shell dist\n\nCreated shell boot-time config loading with:\n- loadShellAppConfig() with mode-dependent error handling\n- DEV_FALLBACK_CONFIG for development resilience\n- Integration into main.ts bootstrap before runtime.start()\n- LoadError categorization (fetch/parse/validation) renders critical error\n- public/app-config.json with schema validation\n- Vite plugin to copy schema.json into dist\n\nTests: 9 new tests, all passing\n- Valid/invalid config scenarios\n- Dev fallback + prod hard-fail modes\n- Public config validation\n- Schema availability verification\n\nVerification evidence in REVIEW.md.\n\n* fix(shell): exclude test files from build, suppress unused param warning\n\n- Exclude **/*.test.ts and **/*.test.tsx from tsconfig build\n- Add void appConfig to suppress unused parameter warning (TODO tracked)\n\nFixes CI build failures on agent/app-config-contract-tg2-shell-boot-validation","tree":{"sha":"35086b61b4cbe609673ccc9ed009a40f5d962452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/35086b61b4cbe609673ccc9ed009a40f5d962452"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/7c5e6