errors\n- AAR-1: JSON Schema generation from Zod + ajv parity verification\n\nCreated @mfe-runtime/app-config package with:\n- Zod schema, inferred AppConfig type, schemaVersion constant\n- parseAppConfig() runtime validator with comprehensive error reporting\n- loadAppConfig() async fetcher with categorized error types\n- JSON Schema generation script via zod-to-json-schema\n- Comprehensive test suite: 19 tests, all passing\n- Zod↔ajv parity tests: identical validation outcomes\n\nVerification evidence in REVIEW.md at the worktree root.\n\n* fix(config): add DOM lib for fetch types, remove unused imports\n\n- Add ''DOM'' to tsconfig lib array for fetch/Response/AbortSignal types\n- Use ''as unknown as Response'' for mock objects to satisfy TS strict checks\n- Remove unused appConfigSchema and AppConfig imports from tests\n\nFixes CI type check failures on agent/app-config-contract-tg1-app-config-package","tree":{"sha":"98071fd35af58cc573272b104a78c7e16f31786b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/98071fd35af58cc573272b104a78c7e16f31786b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/8bbe319a48690fe9daec2115524b619849a508c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 98071fd35af58cc573272b104a78c7e16f31786b\nparent eb3f6fa68f6c0581ae0f98a2dd3dfc9bb6b0b502\nauthor alirazatss <158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com> 1785964914 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785964914 +0200\n\nfeat(config): app-config package (tasks 1.1-1.6) [app-config-contract] (#41)\n\n* feat(config): implement task group 1 (app-config package) [app-config-contract]\n\nImplements tasks 1.1–1.6 from openspec/changes/app-config-contract/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- ACS-1: Zod schema as single source of truth for app config\n- ACS-2: semver schemaVersion field with literal validation\n- ACS-3: Runtime parse helper reports all field errors\n- ACS-4: Async loader categorizes fetch/parse/validation errors\n- AAR-1: JSON Schema generation from Zod + ajv parity verification\n\nCreated @mfe-runtime/app-config package with:\n- Zod schema, inferred AppConfig type, schemaVersion constant\n- parseAppConfig() runtime validator with comprehensive error reporting\n- loadAppConfig() async fetcher with categorized error types\n- JSON Schema generation script via zod-to-json-schema\n- Comprehensive test suite: 19 tests, all passing\n- Zod↔ajv parity tests: identical validation outcomes\n\nVerification evidence in REVIEW.md at the worktree root.\n\n* fix(config): add DOM lib for fetch types, remove unused imports\n\n- Add ''DOM'' to tsconfig lib array for fetch/Response/AbortSignal types\n- Use ''as unknown as Response'' for mock objects to satisfy TS strict checks\n- Remove unused appConfigSchema and AppConfig imports from tests\n\nFixes CI type check failures on agent/app-config-contract-tg1-app-config-package","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqc6lyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFncQAHpDLmGAPYwBieYuDaXg/tQA\nTsNi+NKX41Ag7qicmQS3z53xSGD18/Y4ckKoCXxwSu7qh5M6UDWQgOd/AWbACw1N\ndc527K7+yM/03bM+UIMa+UnVubOzQMKJ2rRjpVeQ4Olsvh7IKw9JrZAFEqUFwXZ7\nhvf/RmP5OTP+p+4YMZBC1gGSmhRlLnunX8Cr8dG3/gesmf76NB4NwU6gcnobriWk\nXczSfWLjOeowlMPzGCeSHW+ml+cEoKlQ6BUPYuaR0eGgnEkryK0T9eXjPjo7gNFp\nHw0leA8tmRdPInMA3pawe4CIO8GPNXQ2uCfcptsIvN5hEPVjqcWX0/uhA5GdVJPO\nTxJZuQ2bOzevGRh3mkebIliXeEkfoz5rxJeC/CVJPNzt3bNIAUitRtp3Mfv44hMn\npuAL0cU0gL1gTHy+x/F9WDwsO+/byz8gYjFfdbmUm+6arxVVMivtrDB5fwmHhjz5\nkZLfbOP8qO19cvz+4jG5YAKCZSq4qWqjlkKzn5y3/fVTkLRX4qY9zemm7dWhsvRv\n55KFtXLryX7JvBy0qGAwjq96AoWUVi+ESTMyTgoFxXeTPnOn7ddPGJBy7AmSOECR\n40YRHnPZJq6bi5z6Gz+czbMUgGqzZRsTGZeeHMsM/P5+dvVQTygwnUEPRw6fnpHN\nDd9YNGigrIgyU24xfUgA\n=tM/G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T00:05:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/f