(canonical mfe dev pipeline) [dev-preview-deployments]\n\nImplements tasks 1.1–1.6 from openspec/changes/dev-preview-deployments/tasks.md.\n\nRequirements covered:\n- MDP-M1: Unified workflow (deploy-mfes-turbo.yml) is canonical; legacy workflow removed\n- MDP-A1: MFE dev deploy publishes immutable sha-<short-sha>/ artifact with immutable cache headers\n- MDP-A2: MFE dev deploy uploads build-info.json to both dev/ and sha-<short>/ paths\n- MDP-A3: MFE dev deploys serialize per MFE+environment via concurrency groups\n\nVerification evidence in PR_BODY.md and REVIEW.md at the worktree root.","tree":{"sha":"cf73d07e36761b0b0dbc91c5fbee251e167fecc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/cf73d07e36761b0b0dbc91c5fbee251e167fecc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/8128c828e8da86c6f91b5c133773c237e9a2b11b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catal