 change.\n\nCapabilities:\n- mfe-deployment-pipeline: immutable SHA paths, build metadata, concurrency\n- shell-deployment-pipeline: immutable SHA paths, build metadata, concurrency\n- pr-preview-deployments: PR-scoped previews, auto-generated config, cleanup\n- azure-blob-storage-layout: path families, lifecycle policies\n\nRequirements covered:\n- MDP-M1, MDP-A1, MDP-A2, MDP-A3 (MFE deployment pipeline)\n- SDP-A1, SDP-A2, SDP-A3 (Shell deployment pipeline)\n- PPD-1 through PPD-6 (PR preview deployments)\n- ABL-A1, ABL-A2 (Azure blob storage layout)\n\nTask groups: 5 groups (all parallel-safe, wave 1)","tree":{"sha":"677248ad35eb4e24518829e9fa928ab6810455ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/677248ad35eb4e24518829e9fa928ab6810455ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/4543f8db7610d71509fae75faf04628b0d9ca1a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aliraz