sers/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/d94c257544d5714231c301cd259f3739f86319af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:36:16Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:44:14Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"message":"docs(spec): update MFE deployment specs to reflect unified workflow\n\nUpdates OpenSpec documentation to align with the unified workflow implementation\n(PR #11, already merged).\n\nChanges to spec.md:\n- Added MDP-Requirement-8: Unified workflow that scales to any number of MFEs\n  - Scenario: New MFE deploys without workflow changes\n  - Scenario: Multiple MFEs deploy in parallel when shared packages change\n- Added MDP-Requirement-9: Automatic route discovery for config PR updates\n  - Scenario: Workflow discovers route automatically from remotes.config.prod.json\n- Updated all scenarios to reference unified workflow behavior instead of per-MFE workflows\n- Changed references from ''deploy-mfe-widget workflow'' to ''unified MFE deploy workflow''\n\nChanges to tasks.md:\n- Renamed task group 3: ''MFE deploy workflow'' → ''Unified MFE deploy workflow''\n- Updated ''Owns files'' section: deploy-mfes.yml (not per-MFE files)\n- Removed task 3.7 (duplicate workflow for mfe-landing-page - no longer needed)\n- Updated task 3.1: Dynamic MFE detection using git diff and matrix strategy\n- Updated task 3.2: Dynamic tag parsing extracting MFE name from pattern\n- Updated task 3.3: Matrix strategy for parallel deployment with fail-fast: false\n- Updated task 3.4-3.6: Use matrix.mfe and needs.detect-tagged-mfe.outputs variables\n- Updated task 3.6: Automatic route discovery from remotes.config.prod.json\n- Marked all tasks as completed [x] (workflow already merged)\n- Updated requirement coverage matrix:\n  - Added MDP-Requirement-8 (unified workflow) → 3.1, 3.2, 3.3\n  - Added MDP-Requirement-9 (route discovery) → 3.6\n  - Removed references to deleted task 3.7\n  - Updated task references for MDP-Requirement-1 through MDP-Requirement-7\n  - Updated ERC-Requirement-3 and ERC-Requirement-4 references\n\nRationale:\nThe unified workflow (deploy-mfes.yml) scales infinitely without per-MFE workflow\nduplication. This spec update documents that architectural change.\n\nRelated: PR #11 (merged)","tree":{"sha":"6689fec86077b5aea7ea69b952ce3134f3e6ffc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/6689fec86077b5aea7ea69b952ce3134f3e6ffc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/d94c257544d5714231c301cd259f3739f86319af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/d94c257544d5714231c301cd259f3739f86319af","node_id":"C_kwDOToLC6NoAKGQ5NGMyNTc1NDRkNTcxNDIzMWMzMDFjZDI1OWYzNzM5Zjg2MzE5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef","sha":"91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef"}],"sha":"d94c257544d5714231c301cd259f3739f86319af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/d94c257544d5714231c301cd259f3739f86319af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:14:52Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:28:14Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"message":"refactor(deploy): replace per-MFE workflows with unified scalable workflow\n\nReplaces separate workflows for each MFE with a single dynamic workflow that\nautomatically detects and deploys changed MFEs.\n\nChanges:\n- Deleted: .github/workflows/deploy-mfe-widget.yml (299 lines)\n- Deleted: .github/workflows/deploy-mfe-landing-page.yml (299 lines)\n- Created: .github/workflows/deploy-mfes.yml (367 lines)\n\nBenefits:\n- Scales to any number of MFEs without creating new workflow files\n- Single source of truth for MFE deployment logic\n- Automatically detects which MFEs changed on push to main\n- Deploys multiple MFEs in parallel using matrix strategy\n- Shared package changes (dynamic-loader, events) trigger all MFE deploys\n- Tag pattern ''mfe-<name>-v<semver>'' extracts MFE name dynamically\n\nDev deployment (push to main):\n- Detect changed files using git diff\n- Build matrix of changed MFEs\n- Deploy each MFE in parallel (fail-fast: false)\n- If shared packages changed, deploy ALL MFEs\n\nProd deployment (tag mfe-*-v*):\n- Extract MFE name and version from tag dynamically\n- Validate version matches package.json\n- Deploy versioned artifacts with immutable cache headers\n- Auto-discover route from remotes.config.prod.json\n- Open PR to update config (not auto-merged)\n\nExample tags:\n- mfe-widget-v1.2.0 → deploys mfe-widget\n- mfe-landing-page-v0.3.0 → deploys mfe-landing-page\n- mfe-new-feature-v1.0.0 → deploys mfe-new-feature (no workflow edit needed)\n\nRequirements coverage: MDP-Requirement-1 through MDP-Requirement-7 (unchanged)\n\nSee: docs/adr/0009-azure-blob-deployment-pipeline.md","tree":{"sha":"f7017e499b9631a8690f9e2fa4259e0419a2701b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/f7017e499b9631a8690f9e2fa4259e0419a2701b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef","node_id":"C_kwDOToLC6NoAKDkxMTEyOTcyZDRjOTVhMTQ3Y2YyMTdmNmUxOGYxNWEyM2ZkYzQzZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248","sha":"83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248"}],"sha":"91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/91112972d4c95a147cf217f6e18f15a23fdc43ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T14:23:59Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:08:26Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"message":"feat(deploy): implement task group 3 (mfe deploy workflow) [azure-blob-deployment-pipeline]\n\nImplements MDP-Requirement-1 through MDP-Requirement-7\n\nCreated GitHub Actions workflows for deploying MFE widget and landing-page\nto Azure Blob Storage with full dev/prod lifecycle support.\n\nWorkflows:\n- .github/workflows/deploy-mfe-widget.yml\n- .github/workflows/deploy-mfe-landing-page.yml\n\nDev deploys (on push to main):\n- Trigger on source changes under apps/mfes/<mfe-name>/**\n- Upload to mfes-dev/<mfe-name>/dev/ (floating pointer)\n- Set Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate\n- Authenticate via Azure OIDC (no client-secret)\n\nProd deploys (on version tag <mfe-name>-v*):\n- Validate tag version matches package.json\n- Refuse to overwrite existing version (fail if path exists)\n- Upload to mfes-prod/<mfe-name>/v<version>/ (immutable)\n- Set Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable\n- Open PR to update remotes.config.prod.json (not auto-merged)\n- Authenticate via Azure OIDC (no client-secret)\n\nSee: openspec/changes/azure-blob-deployment-pipeline/specs/mfe-deployment-pipeline/spec.md","tree":{"sha":"79f502394ea675541c46bda9ffe2249638e87001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/79f502394ea675541c46bda9ffe2249638e87001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248","node_id":"C_kwDOToLC6NoAKDgzZDg1ZWEwYTAyYmU1Y2UzZGEwMzBhOGM4ODlhMDFjNWQ2YTUyNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7","sha":"ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7"}],"sha":"83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/83d85ea0a02be5ce3da030a8c889a01c5d6a5248"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T14:28:22Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:08:13Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"message":"feat(deploy): implement task group 4 (shell deploy workflow) [azure-blob-deployment-pipeline]\n\nImplements SDP-Requirement-1 through SDP-Requirement-5\n\nCreated GitHub Actions workflow for deploying the website shell to Azure\nBlob Storage with full dev/prod lifecycle support.\n\nWorkflow: .github/workflows/deploy-website.yml\n\nDev deploys (on push to main):\n- Trigger on shell source or config changes\n- Build with DEPLOY_ENV=dev (bundles remotes.config.dev.json)\n- Upload to dev-shell container root\n- Set Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate\n- Authenticate via Azure OIDC (no client-secret)\n\nProd versioned deploys (on tag website-v*):\n- Validate tag version matches package.json\n- Build with DEPLOY_ENV=prod (bundles remotes.config.prod.json)\n- Refuse to overwrite existing version (fail if path exists)\n- Upload to $web/v<version>/ (immutable, Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000)\n- Additionally copy to $web/ root (overwrites, Cache-Control: public, max-age=300)\n- Static website serves from $web/ root\n- Authenticate via Azure OIDC (no client-secret)\n\nConfig-only redeploys (on remotes.config.prod.json merge to main):\n- Rebuild shell with updated config\n- Upload to $web/ root only (no versioned path created)\n- Existing versioned paths remain unchanged\n- Set Cache-Control: public, max-age=300\n\nSee: openspec/changes/azure-blob-deployment-pipeline/specs/shell-deployment-pipeline/spec.md","tree":{"sha":"f28d9aab0e26308fcbad43430072b77edf2539a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/f28d9aab0e26308fcbad43430072b77edf2539a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7","node_id":"C_kwDOToLC6NoAKGZmNWM1OTQ5NTFkMWM0NTFjODFiNWQ4ODNhMWQzZjIyYjJmMjU5Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commit/a9c163f727bf05ca13448b1b444316df54fa7b33","sha":"a9c163f727bf05ca13448b1b444316df54fa7b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/a9c163f727bf05ca13448b1b444316df54fa7b33"}],"sha":"ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/ff5c594951d1c451c81b5d883a1d3f22b2f259f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/a9c163f727bf05ca13448b1b444316df54fa7b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T14:32:22Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:08:00Z","email":"158475089+alirazatss@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alirazatss"},"message":"docs(deploy): implement task group 5 (documentation and ADR) [azure-blob-deployment-pipeline]\n\nCaptures deployment architecture decisions and updates project context.\n\nDocumentation:\n- docs/adr/0009-azure-blob-deployment-pipeline.md (new, 735 lines)\n- CONTEXT.md (updated section 7: MFE Deployment)\n\nADR-0009 documents decisions:\n- A1: Single storage account with container-based separation (MVP)\n- A2: Versioned MFE paths in prod (immutable)\n- A3: Floating pointers for dev (overwrite-on-push)\n- A4: Git tag-based prod releases\n- A5: Asymmetric shell hosting (static website vs raw blob)\n- A6: Container-scoped RBAC (env isolation)\n- A7: Raw blob URLs (CDN deferred to post-MVP)\n- A8: Workflow-enforced immutability (WORM deferred)\n\nTechnical debt named explicitly:\n1. CDN migration (A7) - custom domain, edge caching\n2. WORM immutability (A8) - Azure policy-based enforcement\n3. Per-env storage accounts (A1) - requires URL rewrites\n4. Dev shell static website (A5) - depends on per-env accounts\n\nCONTEXT.md changes:\n- Replaced illustrative AWS S3 snippet with actual Azure Blob deployment\n- References ADR-0009 for full architecture details\n- Documents dev/prod/config-only deploy flows\n\nCross-references:\n- ADR-0008 (version management) - complementary scope\n- Runbook (azure-blob-provisioning.md) - operational procedures\n\nSee: openspec/changes/azure-blob-deployment-pipeline/specs/*/spec.md","tree":{"sha":"12859d51f68b81ec1091e4ad4ed0ce5597fd379f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/12859d51f68b81ec1091e4ad4ed0ce5597fd379f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/a9c163f727bf05ca13448b1b444316df54fa7b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fa