,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/commits/9e72b0dc7fc4c9e24f581de5569639a65165d11d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T07:44:01Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T07:44:01Z","email":"ali.raza@tss.se","name":"Ali Alvi"},"message":"feat(test): implement complete testing infrastructure\n\nAdd comprehensive test infrastructure covering unit, integration, and E2E\ntesting for micro-frontend monorepo:\n\nUnit Testing (Vitest):\n- Configure test scripts for all packages with coverage enforcement\n- Add vitest.config.ts for packages missing configuration\n- Implement unit tests for dynamic-loader (config.ts, DynamicLoader.ts)\n- Implement validation tests for remote-config package\n- Set realistic coverage thresholds matching current state\n- Create coverage audit documentation for dynamic-loader\n\nIntegration Testing:\n- Add integration test suite with server orchestration\n- Implement test orchestrator script with health checks and cleanup\n- Create 12 integration tests covering manifest, lifecycle, and chunk loading\n- Add integration test fixtures and configuration\n\nE2E Testing (Playwright):\n- Add Playwright configuration with Chromium browser\n- Implement 28 E2E tests across 4 journey files (22 passing, 6 skipped)\n- Create test fixtures for authenticated/unauthenticated pages\n- Add auth stub server for realistic authentication testing\n- Configure console error enforcement and failure reporting\n- Skip cross-origin and auth redirect tests pending implementation\n\nCI/CD:\n- Add GitHub Actions workflow with 8 jobs and quality gates\n- Configure caching for pnpm, node_modules, and build artifacts\n- Add 7-day retention for test results and coverage reports\n- Integrate assertion scripts into CI pipeline\n\nQuality Gates:\n- assert-package-test-scripts.ts - verify all packages have test scripts\n- assert-no-arbitrary-sleeps.ts - enforce deterministic tests\n- assert-no-src-coverage-exclusions.ts - prevent coverage bypasses\n- merge-coverage.ts - merge coverage from multiple test layers\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add comprehensive TESTING.md guide (500+ lines)\n- Document test layers, stack, thresholds, and troubleshooting\n- Add TEST-GITIGNORE.md for test artifact patterns\n- Update .gitignore with test result patterns\n\nConfiguration:\n- Add test tasks to turbo.json (test, test:coverage, test:integration, test:e2e)\n- Add test:ci and test:integration commands to root package.json\n- Configure test:merge-coverage command for coverage aggregation\n- Set ready command to run full CI pipeline\n\nTest Coverage:\n- Unit tests: 210+ tests across 20 packages\n- Integration tests: 12 tests\n- E2E tests: 22 passing, 6 skipped for unimplemented features\n- Overall: 240+ tests providing comprehensive validation\n\nCloses complete-test-infrastructure change","tree":{"sha":"04da91010b49da80a8d3112559cedbb014cd3df7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/trees/04da91010b49da80a8d3112559cedbb014cd3df7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alirazatss/mfe-catalog/git/commits/9e72b0dc7fc4c9e24f581de5569639a65165d11d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158475089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alirazatss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alirazatss","id":158475089,"login":"alirazatss","node_id":"U_kgDOCXIjUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a