enu (ban ve 1440 co no) (PHA-1209).\n- InvestorWall: border -> border-b, theo individualStrokeWeights 0/0/1/0\n  cua tung o (PHA-1210).\n- ProjectsOnSale: mau trai tim #4B4B4B thay vi xam nhat.\n\nDo lai theo Figma 2326:3822: Top du an 1883 (ban ve 1877), nen toan quoc\n2922 (2916), chu dau tu 4043 (4040), dang mo ban 4577 (4575).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1ced9c2c9eebfb73416d89743a0e745224339eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/e1ced9c2c9eebfb73416d89743a0e745224339eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/2af32b5e5b4eceb721d7523cdea139981b3214b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/2af32b5e5b4eceb721d7523cdea139981b3214b4","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDJhZjMyYjVlNWI0ZWNlYjcyMWQ3NTIzY2RlYTEzOTk4MWIzMjE0YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/ea85cba1fcdcae54888f984b12e03080e831a99e","sha":"ea85cba1fcdcae54888f984b12e03080e831a99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/ea85cba1fcdcae54888f984b12e03080e831a99e"}],"sha":"2af32b5e5b4eceb721d7523cdea139981b3214b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/2af32b5e5b4eceb721d7523cdea139981b3214b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/ea85cba1fcdcae54888f984b12e03080e831a99e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T00:59:58Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T00:59:58Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(appsale): dung lai trang chu theo khung Figma 2331:5377 (PHA-1201)\n\nLam lai tu dau phan hinh cua trang chu, bam khung `Homepage-Option 2`\n(`2331:5377`) cua file `[MVL-Appsale] Khach hang`. Ban dung cu (PR #14)\nchi co bang ron + bieu mau; ban nay dung du 11 muc cua ban ve.\n\n## Cach lay so do\n\nMoi con so doc tu Figma REST API, khong doan tu anh chup: mau, co chu,\ncao dong, dem, khe, bo goc, do bong, va toa do tuyet doi cua tung node.\nNhip doc giua cac muc (90 · 150 · 194 · 206) cung la hieu toa do that.\n\nBa thu CSS khong tai lap duoc thi xuat san thanh anh tu chinh node Figma\n(da nuong `filters` va do nhoe): bang dau trang (8 lop chong nhau), nen\nbang \"toan quoc\", nen chan trang, hai bang CTA. Tong 37 tep webp, 2.0 MB.\n\n## Ranh gioi du lieu\n\n- CMS trang chu (PHA-1078): tieu de dau trang, bang ron 3 vung, 3 khoi bat/tat.\n- `/api/public/projects/`: *Top du an noi bat*, *Du an dang mo ban*, va so\n  du an theo tinh o muc *Du an tren toan quoc* (dem that, khong phai \"82\").\n- Ban ve: danh muc, tinh thanh, chu dau tu, dai cam ket, 2 bang CTA, chan trang.\n- *Tin tuc*: nguon 1.5 chua co ma nguon -> muc tu an o ban phat hanh.\n\nVi tri, khoang gia, dai nhan khuyen mai va tin tuc chi hien luc `next dev`\nqua cong `NODE_ENV` o `lib/home/design-preview.ts` — dung cach `fetchHomePage`\nda lam cho bang ron tu ngay dau. Ca `e16-homepage` gac cong do.\n\n## Kiem chung\n\n- Do lai bang Playwright o 1440px: moi moc y lech <= 6.5px so voi ban ve;\n  tong chieu cao 7584 vs 8061 (chenh lech la 3 thay vi 6 the \"dang mo ban\"\n  trong bo du lieu mau).\n- 98/98 ca e2e xanh. Them `/` vao E10 (vung cham), E11 (dung san o may chu\n  + the Open Graph) va E13 (chu mau ban ve); them E16 rieng cho trang chu.\n- `lint:colors` 39/40 — khong them ma mau tho nao (6 sac moi da thanh token).\n- Khong tran ngang o 390 / 768 / 1024 / 1440.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cb7a52b4207f2b7f611a8b4aa506044bb2d304d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/8cb7a52b4207f2b7f611a8b4aa506044bb2d304d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/ea85cba1fcdcae54888f984b12e03080e831a99e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/sta