eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3d09611d614a175c09a4926aa970bb10e69130d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:36:45Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:36:45Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"fix(appsale): dung lai package-lock cua appsale — npm ci dang do han (PHA-1168 / PR B)\n\nNang hon \"lock con sot lucide\": chay dung lenh Vercel dung, tren ban `dev`:\n\n  $ npm ci    # trong microservices/appsale\n  npm error `npm ci` can only install packages when your package.json and\n  npm error package-lock.json are in sync.\n  npm error Missing: @phosphor-icons/react@2.1.10 from lock file\n  npm error Missing: @playwright/test@1.62.1 from lock file\n\nLock hong HAI CHIEU: thua `lucide-react`, thieu ca Phosphor lan Playwright.\n`npm ci` khong cai lucide — no TU CHOI CHAY. Nen neu dat Vercel Root Directory =\n`microservices/appsale` nhu SA de xuat thi phat hanh do ngay o buoc cai, truoc ca\nbuoc dung.\n\n`@playwright/test` thieu tu PR #7 chu khong phai tu PR A: luc do chay\n`npm install --package-lock-only` o GOC workspace nen chi lock goc duoc dung lai.\nLock goc hien dung; chi lock long trong appsale sai.\n\nLuu y cho nguoi sau: chay `npm install --package-lock-only` NGAY TRONG\n`microservices/appsale` KHONG sua duoc — npm nhuong quyen cho goc workspace va\nde nguyen lock long. Phai dung lai o thu muc co lap roi chep vao.\n\nKiem chung sau khi sua: lucide 0 · phosphor 3 · playwright 5 muc; `npm ci` chay\nduoc, cai Phosphor + Playwright, khong cai lucide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21e7d409966f3689ec9f3d36fd32716cc9b2b21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/21e7d409966f3689ec9f3d36fd32716cc9b2b21b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/3d09611d614a175c09a4926aa970bb10e69130d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/3d09611d614a175c09a4926aa970bb10e69130d4","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDNkMDk2MTFkNjE0YTE3NWMwOWE0OTI2YWE5NzBiYjEwZTY5MTMwZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e","sha":"8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e"}],"sha":"3d09611d614a175c09a4926aa970bb10e69130d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3d09611d614a175c09a4926aa970bb10e69130d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T13:22:02Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:35:00Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"test(appsale): E14 chan nhap bieu tuong sai cong; Rotate3d -> Panorama (PHA-1168 / PR B)\n\nE14 — hai luat, deu kiem nguoc truoc khi chot\n1. Khong tep man nao nhap thang `@phosphor-icons/react`; phai qua `@/design/icons`.\n2. Chinh cong do phai dung entry `dist/ssr`.\n\nLy do can test chu khong phai loi dan: entry goc dung React context nen Server\nComponent do LUC DUNG (`createContext is not a function`), khong nổ luc go code —\nTypeScript van xanh, trinh soan thao van goi y dung ten. Nguoi thu 21 go theo\nthoi quen la loi quay lai nguyen ven.\n\nKiem nguoc ca hai: chen `import { Star } from ''@phosphor-icons/react''` vao mot tep\nman -> luat 1 do; doi cong ve entry goc -> luat 2 do, neu ro phai dung `dist/ssr`.\nGo ra thi xanh lai.\n\nRotate3d: Cube -> Panorama\nPO tra danh sach chinh thuc `@phosphor-icons/core@2.1.1`: `panorama.svg` co that.\nKhop thang khoi \"Tong quan 360\"; `cube` ve mot khoi hop, nguoi xem khong doc ra\n\"xem toan canh\". Da xac nhan `Panorama` co trong goi truoc khi doi.\n\nBo mot ma mau tu che\n`LeadFormCard` dung `from-[#7D0000]` — mau nay KHONG co trong ban ve, no di theo\ntu vo cua PHA-1078. Ban ve dung mot anh nen do trang tri\n(`minimal-abstract-red-liquid-gradient`) ma ta khong co tep. Thay bang nen do\nthuong hieu phang (mau do duoc), khong bia them mot sac do thu hai de gia lap\nchuyen sac.\n\n74/78 xanh (4 bo qua la E12 o cau hinh mobile).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3255b7762f71e94db49876a84d46c72e8500bace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/3255b7762f71e94db49876a84d46c72e8500bace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDhkNDZmODI2ZTViZmUwMDYwYjliZTViNzMzY2IyMjg3ZWMwODAzOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32","sha":"3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32"}],"sha":"8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/8d46f826e5bfe0060b9be5b733cb2287ec08039e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T13:00:02Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:35:00Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"test(appsale): E13 — chan chu mau cua ban ve lot ra man cong khai (PHA-1168 / PR B)\n\nLuat Epic 11 (`test-spec.md` 1.1): chu tren man cong khai phai truy duoc ve SRS,\nnoi dung CMS, hoac du lieu API.\n\nChan 5 chuoi do duoc o `2286:1902` tren 6 man cong khai. Hai chuoi cuoi moi la\nbay: \"We will notify the customer and issue a full refund\" va \"I have read and\naccept the Terms of Use\" DOC NHU noi dung san pham that trong ngu canh trang ban\nhang, nen nguoi dung theo loi chep het chu se giu lai ma khong thay gon.\n\nDa kiem nguoc, khong ship dua tren ly le: chen tam chuoi \"I have read and accept\nthe Terms of Use\" vao bieu mau khach -> E13 do dung 2 man co bieu mau, neu ro ten\nchuoi lot ra; go ra thi xanh lai.\n\nGhi ro gioi han ngay trong tep: 5 chuoi la KET QUA loc `2286:1902` o thoi diem\nnay, khong phai danh sach vinh vien. Ban ve moi ve thi loc lai moi chuoi khong\ndau tieng Viet — chot cung 5 dong thi ban ve sau lot tiep.\n\nCo chot chan chong xanh-gia: phai co chu de soi moi duoc ket luan.\n\n70/74 xanh (4 bo qua la E12 o cau hinh mobile).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e3627f73b9841eb3d043de17756280964d02b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/8e3627f73b9841eb3d043de17756280964d02b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDNkNWMyMmZhNTRiMTUxOTJmODgwOGIzNWJlMWQyZWM1OWM2YmViMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/05118c12432fb45d0a9816f37d94048525f7be1d","sha":"05118c12432fb45d0a9816f37d94048525f7be1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/05118c12432fb45d0a9816f37d94048525f7be1d"}],"sha":"3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3d5c22fa54b15192f8808b35be1d2ec59c6beb32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/05118c12432fb45d0a9816f37d94048525f7be1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:56:04Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:35:00Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(appsale): dung man chi tiet du an theo ban ve 2286:1902 (PHA-1168 / PR B)\n\nPR B doi muc tieu tu trang chu sang `/du-an/{slug}`: khung `Homepage-Option 1`\nthat ra la ban ve trang CHI TIET DU AN (du an LEGACY 89), khong phai trang chu.\nDay cung la man duy nhat hien co du ca ba: ban ve that, nghiep vu da merge,\ndu lieu da qua QA.\n\nSo do lay tu payload, khong doan\n- Khung noi dung 1360 (le 40 moi ben): cot chinh **899px**, cot phu **321px**.\n- Tieu de muc **28px/700**; rieng \"Mat bang du an\" mau do thuong hieu, con lai\n  mau den — dung nhu ban ve phan biet.\n- The phan khu **322x343**, bo goc 8, anh 322x275 tren thanh nhan 322x68 nen do.\n- The dau trang: nen trang, **bo goc 12**, xep doc cach 24, ten du an do 28px,\n  luoi o nhan-gia tri ngan boi duong ke doc 1px #D8D8D8.\n- Khoi bieu mau: rong 321, nen #F9F9F9, bo goc 8, nut gui #B32B2F bo 4.\n\nBieu mau khach: DUNG PHAN HINH, KHOA PHAN GUI — co y\n`POST /api/public/leads/` nam o PHA-1155, chua merge. Ba cach xu, chon cach ba:\nnoi tam vao endpoint khac (sai cho, du lieu khach roi vao noi khong ai gac);\nde nut bam duoc roi im lang khong lam gi (te nhat — khach go so dien thoai, tin\nla da gui, roi khong ai goi lai); hoac **khoa nut va noi ro vi sao**. Da ghi san\ntrong ma nguon cach go khoa khi PHA-1155 len.\n\nO nao khong co du lieu thi AN HAN\nBan ve co \"Quy mo du an\" va \"Khoang dien tich san pham\", nhung\n`/api/public/projects/{slug}/` khong tra hai truong do. Bay mot nhan bo trong\nthi nguoi xem tuong du an thieu thong tin, chu khong phai he thong chua co truong.\n\nBam theo quy uoc vua vao `dev`\nNhap bieu tuong qua `@/design/icons` (cong bieu tuong duy nhat, commit a1e2bfc)\nthay vi nhap thang `@phosphor-icons/react` — de lan doi bo sau chi sua mot tep.\n\nBon cam ket Muc 1 con nguyen: 58/62 xanh. Chay rieng E3/E6/E9/E10/E12 = 21 xanh.\nMuc `hidden` van khong ro mot con so gia nao tren man da dung lai.\n\nChua dung trang chu — cho chu workspace chot ban A hay ban B cua Option 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69320d1095baf466b63cd9c73180ac76756d8d72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/69320d1095baf466b63cd9c73180ac76756d8d72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/05118c12432fb45d0a9816f37d94048525f7be1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCk