/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/b135c01a7c8fe29924ff6cb577f857cbe437ca14","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKGIxMzVjMDFhN2M4ZmUyOTkyNGZmNmNiNTc3Zjg1N2NiZTQzN2NhMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2","sha":"8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/9e4f35619ab06973fde45f5aba1cdf103c5339e7","sha":"9e4f35619ab06973fde45f5aba1cdf103c5339e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/9e4f35619ab06973fde45f5aba1cdf103c5339e7"}],"sha":"b135c01a7c8fe29924ff6cb577f857cbe437ca14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/b135c01a7c8fe29924ff6cb577f857cbe437ca14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3ee9ab502e85b111bc687c5784b88e8c3b56b6cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:15:08Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T13:04:01Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"refactor(appsale): dung that he thiet ke, dat ten ba do tu che, canh ma mau troi nguoc (PHA-1168)\n\nBa muc SA ghi la \"phai bit truoc khi PR #7 merge\" (§2.1 §2.2 §2.3). PR #7 da merge vao\n`dev` truoc khi kip lam, nen tra no o day thay vi bo luon.\n\n§2.1 — he thiet ke dang la ma chet\n`Button` `Badge` `Card` `Input` khai xong nhung **0 noi goi**. Token khong ai dung thi\nthang sau lech voi ma nguon, va lan dap giao dien sau lai do lai tu dau.\n- `EventCard`: goc `<article>` -> `<Card as=\"article\">`; chip ten du an -> `<Badge\n  variant=\"square\">` (dung bien the xam co that trong ban ve, 5 luot).\n- `ProjectCard`: goc la `<Link>`, boc them mot `<div>` chi de goi duoc `<Card>` la doi\n  DOM — ma doi DOM thi phai kiem lai E11. Nen tach cong thuc lop ra thanh `cardClass()`\n  va dung o day. Component va cong thuc an chung mot nguon.\n- `EventStatusBadge` va `UnitStatusBadge` **giu nguyen**: ban ve khong co nhan nhieu mau\n  cho trang thai, ep vao bo 3 bien the la bia. Da ghi ro trong `TOKENS.md`.\n\nThay doi hinh anh la co y: bo goc 16px -> 8px (muc ap dao trong ban ve, 138 luot), vien\n`#e5e7eb` -> `line` `#D8D8D8`, bo bong mac dinh (ca ba khung chi co 5 luot do bong).\n\n§2.2 — hai dai do chay song song\nNgoai `#B32B2F` do duoc, ma nguon con `#8A1B1E` (9) `#7D0000` (6) `#E62A2A` (2) khong co\ntrong payload Figma. Dat ten thanh `brand-hover` `brand-deep` `brand-bright`, ghi ro\n**khong do duoc** ngay tai cho khai, ly do giu o `TOKENS.md` §\"Cho ban ve chua phu\".\nKhong anh xa ve `brand.strong` `#AF2323` vi sac do **nhat hon** `#B32B2F` — nut sang len\nkhi di chuot la nguoc quy uoc. Khong xoa vi ban ve tinh khong ve trang thai di chuot lan\ndai mau bang dau trang; xoa la doi giao dien ma khong ban ve nao bao phai doi.\n\n§2.3 — chua co gi chan token troi nguoc\n`npm run lint:colors` dem ma mau tho trong `src/components/**`, so voi moc no cu (40).\n**Canh bao, chua chan** — chan ngay thi moi PR deu do vi loi nguoi khac de lai, va luat\nkieu do thi nguoi ta tat luat chu khong sua ma. Do duoc: them mot `[#FF0000]` la no keu\ndung ten tep va so dong.\nKHONG cai ESLint cho viec nay: du an chua co ESLint, keo `eslint` + `eslint-config-next`\nve chi de dem ma mau la doi ca thu muc `node_modules` lay mot vong lap doc tep.\n\nRebase len `dev` sau khi PR #9 vao — go dung cai bay QA canh bao\n`#9` xoa `font-ui` khoi theme. Ban truoc cua nhanh nay khai `cardClass()` bang `font-ui`,\nnen ghep hai cai lai thi `cardClass()` nha ra mot lop KHONG con ton tai -> the roi ve\nphong ke thua, ma **build van xanh, test van xanh**. Da doi `cardClass()` sang `font-sans`\nkhi go dung o `ui/Card.tsx`; `Card` goi thang `cardClass()` nen chi con mot nguon lop.\nKhong tin build sach — do computed style tren the that o `/du-an`:\n  fontFamily = \"Inter, system-ui, sans-serif\"   (khong roi ve phong ke thua)\n  borderRadius = 8px · borderColor = rgb(216,216,216) = `line` #D8D8D8\n  tagName = A, parentElement = LI               (DOM giu nguyen, khong boc them div)\n\nKiem chung\n- `grep -r \"font-ui\" src` = **0**.\n- `npm run build` xanh, `tsc --noEmit` sach.\n- `npx playwright test`: 58 xanh / 4 bo qua (E12 o `mobile`, co y).\n- E10 + E11 chay lai **sau rebase**, ca hai cau hinh: 16/16 xanh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7626e1c2b7e8be6db5c6ba282df8d02c47c4fc12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/7626e1c2b7e8be6db5c6ba282df8d02c47c4fc12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/3ee9ab502e85b111bc687c5784b88e8c3b56b6cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/3ee9ab502e85b111bc687c5784b88e8c3b56b6cc","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDNlZTlhYjUwMmU4NWIxMTFiYzY4N2M1Nzg0Yjg4ZThjM2I1NmI2Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2","sha":"8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/8b504d42cedd40729d3922b0c524a7c8e694faa2"}],"sha":"3ee9ab502e85b111bc687c5784b88e8c3b56b6cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/3ee9ab502e85b111bc687c5784b88e8c3b56b6cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4"