ng94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/0932bf65a7a98f81bb1060ff4daa014b457eeedf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:01:24Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:33:44Z","email":"design@glinteco.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(cms-admin): implement project list and edit screens (PHA-1083)","tree":{"sha":"34e311765f13b945e3988ca29268ad46b988cfbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/34e311765f13b945e3988ca29268ad46b988cfbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/0932bf65a7a98f81bb1060ff4daa014b457eeedf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/0932bf65a7a98f81bb1060ff4daa014b457eeedf","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDA5MzJiZjY1YTdhOThmODFiYjEwNjBmZjRkYWEwMTRiNDU3ZWVlZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a","sha":"5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a"}],"sha":"0932bf65a7a98f81bb1060ff4daa014b457eeedf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/0932bf65a7a98f81bb1060ff4daa014b457eeedf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T11:17:37Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:33:44Z","email":"design@glinteco.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(cms-admin): dựng nền micro frontend cms_admin (PHA-1083)\n\nVòng 1 của PHA-1083: phần nền dùng chung cho mọi màn CMS sau (PHA-1078,\nPHA-1080 và 2 màn dự án ở vòng 2). Chưa dựng màn danh sách/biểu mẫu dự án.\n\nSửa lỗi chặn:\n- package.json gốc khai workspace `microservices/cms_frontend` trong khi thư\n  mục thật tên `cms_admin` -> npm install không link được.\n- Workspace gốc hoist react 18 (appsale/crm) còn cms_admin chạy react 19, hai\n  bản React cùng lúc -> \"Invalid hook call\", trắng trang. Thêm resolve.dedupe.\n- main.tsx render <Routes> mà không có Router bao ngoài -> chạy độc lập là vỡ.\n- host-app: tsc -b đang hỏng sẵn (React/location không dùng, thiếu khai báo\n  kiểu cho module federation).\n\nNền mới:\n- Tầng gọi API: axios + tự bóc phong bì {success,data,error}, gắn JWT, tự làm\n  mới access token một lượt duy nhất khi 401.\n- Chuẩn hoá lỗi drf-standardized-errors về ApiError {message, fieldErrors}.\n- Xác thực: đăng nhập ERP, khôi phục phiên, quyền theo /api/me/permissions/,\n  cầu nối phiên POST /api/cms/session/ để mở trang quản trị Wagtail.\n- Chặn route theo đăng nhập và theo mã quyền project_public.*.\n- Bộ dựng sẵn cho màn danh sách và biểu mẫu: DataTable, Pagination, Field,\n  TextInput, NumberInput, Select, Button, Alert, EmptyState, Spinner,\n  useListQuery, useDebouncedValue, useSubmit.\n- Điều hướng chạy đúng ở cả hai nơi: gốc `/` khi chạy độc lập và `/cms` khi\n  host-app nạp qua module federation (useMountBasePath + useCmsPath).\n\nNối vào host-app:\n- cms_admin phơi ra ''./CmsRoutes'' thay cho ''./AppSaleRoutes''.\n- host-app gắn ở route /cms/*, thêm mục CMS vào thanh bên.\n- micro-frontend.config.ts thêm app ''cms''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40f16d1055945f39ea99598015067c1ad41e24b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/40f16d1055945f39ea99598015067c1ad41e24b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDVlODcwMWFiMmIwNjU3MmVlNTJmY2M0NTY0MWM1ZGEwNjBhZTViNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/62b58cc008807bb83e2465b16f3f945ca5a5c938","sha":"62b58cc008807bb83e2465b16f3f945ca5a5c938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/62b58cc008807bb83e2465b16f3f945ca5a5c938"}],"sha":"5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/5e8701ab2b06572ee52fcc45641c5da060ae5b6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/a1e2bfccd258f7374b1c4a9de8cdebfa433dbe3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:09:25Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:09:25Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"refactor(appsale): mot cong bieu tuong duy nhat, mot khoa phong duy nhat (PHA-1168 / PR A)\n\nBa gach trong DOD cua SA ma ban truoc chua khep. Khep not truoc khi giao QA.\n\n`src/design/icons.ts` — cong duy nhat\n- 65 ten, 20 tep man hinh nay nhap tu day; **0** noi con nhap thang\n  `@phosphor-icons/react` ngoai chinh tep cong (grep chung minh trong mo ta PR).\n- Ly do khong phai cho gon: lan doi bo bieu tuong nay phai mo 20 tep. Lan sau chi\n  mo mot tep. Chinh viec vua lam la bang chung cho luat nay.\n- Chia ba nhom theo **muc chac chan**, khong phai theo cach dung:\n  12 **tu ban ve** (ten Phosphor doc duoc trong payload Figma — bat di bat dich),\n  21 **ten trung** (Phosphor co san dung ten, khong phai chon),\n  32 **tu anh xa** (ban ve khong co, ben nay chon — cai nao khong hien nhien co ly\n  do ghi ngay tai dong).\n- Ten goi giu nguyen ten thoi `lucide` nen 104 cho dung khong phai sua.\n\nPhong: bo bi danh `ui`, chi con `sans`\n- Ban truoc giu `fontFamily.ui` tro cung cho `sans` va goi do la co y. Sai: hai ten\n  cho mot phong la hai nguon su that — nguoi sau khong biet chon ten nao, va den luc\n  doi phong that thi sot mot cho la lech ca trang. 4 primitives doi sang `font-sans`.\n\nKiem chung — do, khong suy\n- `npm run build` xanh; bang tuyen **trung tung byte** voi truoc khi tach cong\n  (98.3 kB `/`, 114 kB `/appsale/cms/events/[id]/registrations`...). Cong tai xuat\n  khong lam phinh goi — do that vi day la lo ngai chinh cua kieu tep barrel.\n- `npx playwright test`: 58 xanh / 4 bo qua (E12 o `mobile`, co y) — dung bang truoc.\n- E10 + E11 chay rieng ca hai cau hinh: 16/16 xanh.\n- Bieu tuong that su dung ra sau khi doi cong: ma nguon `/du-an/mai-viet-riverside`\n  co 6 svg `viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"` (dac trung Phosphor), **0** svg `0 0 24 24`.\n  Khong kiem thi mot cong sai van build sach ma dung ra rong.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92ec8144f32a4a4fc4978ff8bc442820033893ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/92ec8144f32a4a4fc4978ff8bc442820033893ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/a1e2bfccd258f7374b1c4a9de8cdebfa433dbe3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/a1e2bfccd258f7374b1c4a9de8cdebfa433dbe3f","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKGExZTJiZmNjZDI1OGY3Mzc0YjFjNGE5ZGU4Y2RlYmZhNDMzZGJlM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/17d291b854732552714946ef3900eb455ba5819e","sha":"17d291b854732552714946ef3900eb455ba5819e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/17d291b854732552714946ef3900eb455ba5819e"}],"sha":"a1e2bfccd258f7374b1c4a9de8cdebfa433dbe3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/a1e2bfccd258f7374b1c4a9de8cdebfa433dbe3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/17d291b854732552714946ef3900eb455ba5819e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:01:28Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T12:01:28Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(appsale): doi phong sang Inter va bieu tuong sang Phosphor toan du an (PHA-1168 / PR A)\n\nChu workspace chot 20/08: dung dung phong va bo bieu tuong cua ban ve, dong bo\nca du an, gom ca trang chu lan cac man da merge.\n\nPhong\n- `fontFamily.sans` va `body` deu la Inter; go Plus Jakarta Sans khoi ma nguon\n  lan phan tai phong. Chi tai 4 muc dam 400/500/600/700 — dung bang nhung muc\n  ban ve dung, khong tai thua.\n- `fontFamily.ui` giu lai lam BI DANH tro cung mot noi, de `components/ui/` khai\n  ro y dinh thay vi dua vao mac dinh. Hai khoa cung gia tri la co y.\n\nBieu tuong: 65 icon, 20 tep\n- lucide-react -> @phosphor-icons/react, go han lucide khoi package.json.\n- Anh xa tung ten mot va **doi chieu voi danh sach export that** cua goi truoc\n  khi sua (1512 icon). Ba ten khong co doi ung truc tiep, chon theo ngu canh\n  dung: FileCheck -> SealCheck (man ky hop dong), FileEdit -> NotePencil (man\n  sua su kien), MessageSquare -> ChatCentered (man tro chuyen).\n- Dung BI DANH trong import (`Buildings as Building2`) nen ten goi trong JSX giu\n  nguyen — diff chi nam o dong import, khong rai khap tung cho dung.\n\nPhai dung entry `@phosphor-icons/react/dist/ssr`\n- Entry goc dung React context nen server component do ngay luc dung:\n  `TypeError: (0 , r.createContext) is not a function` o `/du-an/[slug]`.\n- Dung entry `ssr` cho ca server lan client component: ta khong dung\n  `IconContext`, nen mot entry duy nhat vua chay duoc vua khoi phai nho\n  cho nao dung loai nao.\n\nKiem chung — khong tin build sach\n- 58/62 xanh (4 bo qua la E12 o cau hinh mobile).\n- E10 la ca dang lo nhat: doi phong lam doi be rong chu, ma nhan/nut co theo noi\n  dung. Do sat kich thuoc that: be rong CO doi (\"Dang giu cho\" 123 -> 124px),\n  nhung khong o nao tut xuong duoi 24x24 vi chieu cao duoc ghim.\n- Kiem phong that su duoc ap: `document.fonts.check(''16px Inter'')` = true,\n  `getComputedStyle(body).fontFamily` = Inter.\n- Kiem bieu tuong that su dung ra: ma nguon tra ve co `viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"`\n  (dac trung Phosphor; lucide la `0 0 24 24`), 7 svg o trang chi tiet du an.\n  Khong kiem thi mot entry sai co the dung ra rong ma build van sach.\n\nChua dung bo cuc trang chu — do la PR B.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2664a370ca6291554fc40cb56405b3dd32318f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/b2664a370ca6291554fc40cb56405b3dd32318f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/17d291b854732552714946ef3900eb455ba5819e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}"