ow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/6a309e7fed29ae133b515c31cba2d1a19b565eb7","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDZhMzA5ZTdmZWQyOWFlMTMzYjUxNWMzMWNiYTJkMWExOWI1NjVlYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/d9dc7f2291d25355bb2e81f5bada2b778ded1c73","sha":"d9dc7f2291d25355bb2e81f5bada2b778ded1c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/d9dc7f2291d25355bb2e81f5bada2b778ded1c73"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6","sha":"855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6"}],"sha":"6a309e7fed29ae133b515c31cba2d1a19b565eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/6a309e7fed29ae133b515c31cba2d1a19b565eb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T07:36:23Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T07:36:23Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"build(crm): dung lai dist cho khop ma nguon sau khi doi cong 3005 -> 3003 (PHA-1154)\n\n`microservices/crm/dist/` CO commit trong repo (15 tep) — khac ca bon app con lai\n(`erp`, `host-app`, `cms_admin`, `appsale` deu ignore `dist`). Toi doi cong trong\n`crm/src/pages/AutoRoutingPage.tsx` nhung khong dung lai, nen ma nguon noi 3003\ncon thu that su duoc phuc vu cho federation van noi 3005 — sua dung cho nguoi doc\nnhin vao, sai o cho may chay.\n\nDa bo ban dung la lung trong cay lam viec (khong ro nguon goc, muc 13:33) roi dung\nlai sach tu `git checkout` + `npm run build`. Ban dung lai ra dung bo tep va dung\nhash nhu ban la lung do — build on dinh, khong phu thuoc may.\n\nKiem lai ban dung:\n- khong con chuoi `3005` nao trong `crm/dist/`;\n- so sanh chunk cu voi chunk moi: **dung mot dong** khac nhau, la dong `href` cong\n  3005 -> 3003. Khong co thay doi nao khac len theo.\n\nThay doi con lai chi la hash chunk moi lan sang `index.html` va `remoteEntry.js`.\n\nCau hoi lon hon — co nen commit `dist/` khong, va vi sao rieng `crm` khong co muc\n`dist` trong `.gitignore` trong khi ba app kia deu co — de SA quyet, khong xu o day.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6022d42d0a68ef1f6534c4b7ee31a6a8aea61799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/6022d42d0a68ef1f6534c4b7ee31a6a8aea61799"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDg1NWI5MWZmODZhNzM2MWJmNjliMGU3YmY2ZDRmYTY5YmFjMDcxZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050","sha":"6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050"}],"sha":"855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/855b91ff86a7361bf69b0e7bf6d4fa69bac071d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:54:57Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:54:57Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"test(appsale): E12 — rang loi noi sai may chu bang test (PHA-1154)\n\nDung hai may chu gia ghi lai duong dan that su nhan duoc, roi khang dinh CA HAI\nchieu: `/api/public/projects/*` + `/api/public/subdivisions/*` vao lõi ERP,\n`/api/cms/*` + `/api/public/events/*` vao App Sale, va khong loi goi nao lot\nsang may chu kia.\n\nVe phu dinh moi la ve bat duoc loi. Ve khang dinh mot minh van xanh khi ca hai\nbien cung tro ve mot noi.\n\nDa kiem nguoc: tai tao loi (doi `erpApiUrl()` -> `apiUrl()` trong\n`lib/public/http.ts`) thi E12 do dung hai ca, kem thong bao chi thang ten ham\nphai sua. Khoi phuc thi xanh lai. Mot ca kiem chua tung do bao gio thi khong\nchung minh duoc gi.\n\nDay la ca DUY NHAT dung may chu gia thay vi du lieu mau — da ghi ro ly do trong\ntep de nguoi sau khong \"don cho nhat quan\": cac ca khac ep hai bien vao cong\nchet nen khang dinh duoc NOI DUNG, nhung chinh vi vay chung mu voi DUONG DI.\n\nHai bay tu tim thay khi dung ca nay, deu la loi xanh-gia\n- `fullyParallel: true` chia bon ca ra bon worker, moi worker chay `beforeAll`\n  rieng -> bon may chu Next gianh cung mot cong, worker nao thua thi thu ve danh\n  sach rong va cac khang dinh phu dinh (`toEqual([])`) XANH VI KHONG CO DU LIEU.\n  Sua: `mode: ''default''` (gom mot worker, khong dung `''serial''` vi serial bo qua\n  cac ca sau khi mot ca hong, ma ca chan doan ro nhat lai nam cuoi). Them mot\n  chot chan: khang dinh co ghi duoc it nhat mot loi goi truoc khi ket luan\n  \"khong lot sang may chu kia\".\n- Hai tien trinh `next dev` cung ghi vao `.next` giam len phan bien dich cua\n  nhau, lam 9 ca KHAC do ngau nhien. Sua: `distDir` theo bien moi truong, ca E12\n  dung `.next-e2e-routing`. Mac dinh van la `.next`, ban phat hanh khong doi.\n\nChay lai 3 lan: 54 xanh, 4 bo qua (E12 chi chay o cau hinh chromium, khong nhan\ndoi vi no dung may chu rieng chu khong mo trinh duyet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebc0fb0a3078fd41b1c7aae706f816bcffcc7bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/ebc0fb0a3078fd41b1c7aae706f816bcffcc7bc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDZiMGU3Njc4OWUyOTI2MWVkMmU1YTk2YjUzNzk3ODcwZmE3YmUwNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b","sha":"94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b"}],"sha":"6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/6b0e76789e29261ed2e5a96b53797870fa7be050"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:28:02Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:28:02Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"chore(appsale): don not cong 3005, uu tien units_missing_direction cua may chu (PHA-1154)\n\nCong 3005 -> 3003 — nhung KHONG phai cho nao cung doi\n- `erp/.../AppSaleRemoteWrapper.tsx`: bo han so cong khoi chu \"dang ket noi\".\n  Thanh phan nay nhung iframe toi `VITE_APPSALE_REMOTE_URL`, mac dinh la ban tren\n  Vercel — ghi \"(Port 3005)\" sai ca hai duong, va doi thanh 3003 van sai o phan\n  lon truong hop vi dich den khong phai localhost.\n- `deploy-appsale-flow/microfrontend-spec.html`: day KHONG chi la tai lieu sinh ra\n  — muc 5 la lenh chay duoc (`npx next dev -p 3005`). Ai lam theo cung dung appsale\n  len dung cong cua cms_admin. Sua ca so cong lan lenh chay.\n- `host-app/.../AppSaleRemoteWrapper.tsx`: **giu nguyen 3005**, doi phan chu.\n  Thanh phan nay nap `import(''cms_admin/AppSaleRoutes'')` — remote cua cms_admin,\n  chay `vite --port 3005`. Doi sang 3003 la chi sai cong cho nguoi dang do loi.\n  Ten thanh phan la \"AppSale...\" nhung thu no nap la cms_admin; da doi chu hien ra\n  cho khop, va ghi chu canh bao de nguoi sau khong \"sua\" 3005 thanh 3003.\n\n`units_missing_direction`\n- Doc truong nay tu may chu khi co (SRS §3.5, them o PHA-1155), chua co thi suy ra.\n- **Dinh chinh ghi chu cu**: phep tru KHONG phai so xap xi. Ca hai ve deu chi dem\n  can con trong nen hieu dung bang so can con trong chua nhap huong. Ghi chu cu ghi\n  la lay `total_units` tru di, trong khi ma nguon lay `status_breakdown.available` —\n  ghi chu sai, ma nguon dung. Ly do that de dung so cua may chu la: (1) khong suy ra\n  con so hien cho khach tu hai con so khac, (2) so nay tinh cho ca phan khu, khong\n  theo bo loc dang bat.\n- Bo mau: `directions` cua The Rainbow truoc day khong khop chinh danh sach can cua\n  no (ghi east:2 trong khi chi 1 can east con trong). Sua lai cho khop.\n\nThem 4 ca E2E cho bo loc huong (an bo loc khi chua nhap huong, loc doi so dong,\ndong dem \"con N can chua co thong tin huong\", can chua nhap huong khong lot vao\nket qua loc). 50/50 xanh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"359a146b5c40eac8ab1294fc644e86b584064dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/359a146b5c40eac8ab1294fc644e86b584064dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKDk0ZTEyNjY3MDVlMDBkODM5MTQ4NjA4ZTA5ZWRiZmFiN2ZkMjI1OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8","sha":"debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8"}],"sha":"94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/94e1266705e00d839148608e09edbfab7fd2258b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:40:51Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:40:51Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"fix(appsale): tro trang du an vao lõi ERP sau khi rebase len dev (PHA-1154)\n\nRebase len `origin/dev` khong bao xung dot, nhung PHA-1080 (c0eee56) da tach\n`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` thanh hai bien va doi y nghia cua `apiUrl()`:\n\n  apiUrl()    -> may chu App Sale (Wagtail)  — /api/cms/*, /api/public/events/*\n  erpApiUrl() -> lõi ERP                     — /api/me/\n\nTrang du an cong khai doc `/api/public/projects/*` va `/api/public/subdivisions/*`,\nva hai duong dan nay nam o **lõi ERP** (`apps/realestate/public_urls.py` noi vao\n`urls.py` cua repo ERP; backend app-sale chi con `audit_logging`). Giu `apiUrl()`\nla moi luot goi di sang Wagtail cong 8001.\n\nCho nay hong lang le, khong co loi de lan: Wagtail bat duoc duong dan roi tra 404,\n`fetchPublicOrFixture` hieu 404 la \"chua xuat ban\" nen khong roi ve du lieu mau —\nman hinh ra trang 404 sach se, nhin nhu chua co du lieu.\n\n- `lib/public/http.ts` dung `erpApiUrl()`, ghi ro tien to `/api/public/` bac qua\n  hai may chu de nguoi sau khong noi nham lai.\n- `.env.example` ghi ro `NEXT_PUBLIC_ERP_API_BASE_URL` phu ca trang du an.\n- `playwright.config.ts` khai **ca hai** bien vao cong chet. Bo sot mot bien la\n  bo test lang le goi vao may chu that cua nguoi dang chay no.\n\nSua kem (PO chot): cong 3005 -> 3003 o hai cho con sot\n- `crm/src/pages/AutoRoutingPage.tsx` — lien ket sang bang hang appsale.\n- `appsale/src/app/appsale/dashboard/page.tsx` — nhan \"(Port 3005)\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7a9a643aca61672473273eea39dfb08b882d220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/e7a9a643aca61672473273eea39dfb08b882d220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8","node_id":"C_kwDOToR8fdoAKGRlYmVmZWU4Njg2YjU4NjQ4NTQxOTU2YTQ5MDNmMzVhZGU1MjRkZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commit/acbcf1e1cabf44a21772c0ec32f0b9d31c3c315a","sha":"acbcf1e1cabf44a21772c0ec32f0b9d31c3c315a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/acbcf1e1cabf44a21772c0ec32f0b9d31c3c315a"}],"sha":"debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/debefee8686b58648541956a4903f35ade524df8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/acbcf1e1cabf44a21772c0ec32f0b9d31c3c315a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T04:57:48Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T05:38:36Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(appsale): tang du lieu + phan tuyen SSR cho trang du an cong khai (PHA-1154)\n\nDung tang du lieu, phan tuyen va khung SSR cho S2-S6 cua phan cong khai\n(FSD 1.1 §3.1-§3.6), tren 7 endpoint da chay that o backend nhanh PHA-1088.\nDung lai `PublicSiteShell` va `lib/api.ts` cua PHA-1078, khong dung vo thu hai.\n\nTang du lieu (`src/lib/public/`)\n- `http.ts`: mo phong bi `{success,data,error}` cua ERP (0.1 FSD §3.2), doi 404\n  thanh `PublicNotFound`, va roi ve du lieu mau khi chay `next dev` — dung luat\n  cua `lib/home/api.ts`, ban phat hanh khong dung mau.\n- `errors.ts`: mot ham doc loi dung chung; bat theo `error.errors[0].code`,\n  khong bat theo cau chu.\n- `price.ts`: cong gac gia duy nhat cho ca ba man (§4.7).\n- `types.ts` bam theo serializer that, khong chi bam theo vi du trong FSD.\n\nMan hinh\n- `/du-an`, `/du-an/{slug}`, `/du-an/{slug}/ban-do`,\n  `/phan-khu/{slug}`, `/phan-khu/{slug}/bang-hang` — deu dung o may chu.\n- Thanh tab bam theo cuon (§4.11), thu vien dau trang chia tab (§4.12),\n  ban do toa do phan tram (§3.3), bo loc bang hang (§4.9).\n- Muc `hidden` khong ro mot con so gia nao, ke ca khoang gia va cot Gia.\n- An han bo loc huong khi `directions_available` rong (R4/Q20).\n- 404 khong nhac ten hay slug du an (§4.2).\n\nPlaywright — dung nen moi\n- `playwright.config.ts` (`baseURL` tu bien moi truong, chromium + mobile).\n- 4 ca khong phu thuoc hinh: E3 (an gia), E6 (trang thai §4.8),\n  E9 (404 khong ro ten), E11 (xem ma nguon trang co du chu + the Open Graph).\n- Test giao dien khong goi may chu that: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` tro vao\n  cong khong ai nghe de ep dung du lieu mau, ket qua khong doi theo CSDL.\n\nSua kem (PO chot, R7)\n- Ten workspace `cms_frontend` -> `cms_admin` (thu muc that).\n- Cong appsale 3005 -> 3003 o `micro-frontend.config.ts` va `LayoutWrapper`:\n  3005 la cong cua `cms_admin` va cung la cong `host-app` dang tro toi.\n- Them `/du-an`, `/phan-khu` vao danh sach duong dan cong khai cua\n  `LayoutWrapper` — thieu buoc nay thi trang cong khai bi boc trong khung\n  cong noi bo va trinh quet the xem truoc khong thay gi.\n\nKhong dung toi `next.config.mjs` phan `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d5279361110d0ed0d54627e441be50dfd0a8675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/2d5279361110d0ed0d54627e441be50dfd0a8675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/acbcf1e1cabf44a21772c0ec32f0b9d31c3c315a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}