tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/c0eee566e2a1c7b4269c172b32d1534d44e245ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T02:33:20Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T02:33:20Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"fix(appsale): tach bien goc URL cho loi ERP de /api/me/ goi dung dich (PHA-1080)\n\nCa FE dung chung mot bien NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL, nhung /api/me/ nam o\nloi ERP chu khong phai may chu App Sale — goi vao App Sale thi Wagtail bat\nduoc duong dan nay va tra 404, form dang ky cua CTV da dang nhap khong dien\nsan duoc ho so. Khach vang lai van dang ky binh thuong nen loi de lot test tay.\n\nThem NEXT_PUBLIC_ERP_API_BASE_URL + erpApiUrl() va dung cho dung mot cho la\n/api/me/. Cac loi goi con lai (/api/cms/*, /api/public/events/*) giu nguyen\nvi dang tro dung App Sale.\n\nThem .env.example ghi ro quy uoc cong o may ca nhan: ERP giu 8000, App Sale\nnhuong sang 8001 (theo backend/docs/setup-local.md va docker APP_PORT).","tree":{"sha":"45b18074cd55d2ddbfb9eb02c08475c84bbbbc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/45b18074cd55d2ddbfb9eb02c08475c84bbbbc3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/c0eee566e2a1c7b4269c172b32d1534d44e245ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pha