nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/commits/029ce6a4617224c84c87caacf4e0857cda335b0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:58:57Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:58:57Z","email":"172227952+phamhung94@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phamhung94"},"message":"feat(appsale): dung trang chu cong khai + 3 vung bang ron (PHA-1078)\n\nBo redirect(''/appsale/dashboard'') o src/app/page.tsx (loi chan B-4). Trang chu\ngio ai cung xem duoc; nguoi da dang nhap thay them loi tat vao khu lam viec\n(chot Q2), khong chuyen huong ai di dau.\n\nXep chong tren PHA-1080 (1.7 su kien) va dung lai ha tang cua nhanh do.\n\n- src/lib/home/{types,fixture,api}.ts: hop dong JSON theo FSD 3.3 §6.1.\n  Goi qua apiUrl() cua @/lib/api - khong khai them bien moi truong rieng.\n  Chua co may chu CMS: chay `next dev` -> du lieu mau de van dung duoc giao dien;\n  ban phat hanh -> KHONG dung du lieu mau, tranh bay bang ron gia tren moi truong that.\n- revalidate = 60 rang o cap route (khong chi o lenh goi): lan goi luc dung ban\n  phat hanh ma hong thi trang van tu dung lai, khong dung yen o trang thai loi.\n- BannerSlot: 3 vung hero/mid/sidebar. Vung rong -> khong dung the HTML nao\n  (DOD#9 / T-26). <picture> dung image_mobile khi co (T-27), khong co thi dung\n  image (T-28). width/height tren ca <source> lan <img> -> khong nhay bo cuc\n  (T-29). target_url rong -> <div> thay vi <a> (T-30). alt lay tu alt_text\n  (T-31). Anh hero dau tien eager + fetchPriority=high (LCP).\n- Giao dien KHONG so ngay, KHONG sap lai: may chu da loc han va sap thu tu\n  (FSD §4.1) -> dong ho may khach lech khong doi ket qua (T-19).\n- HomeBlocks: ton trong show_* + block_order. Ba nguon 1.1/1.5/1.7 chua co ma\n  nguon nen chua dung noi dung, va khong dung khung rong (T-32).\n- PublicSiteShell: tach khung trang cong khai dung chung cho trang chu (3.3) va\n  trang su kien (1.7), de hai trang khong troi thanh hai bo mat khac nhau.\n- LayoutWrapper: them khop dung duong dan cho ''/'' va ''/appsale''. Khop tien to\n  khong dung duoc o day vi /appsale/cms/events la man noi bo, van phai co khung cong.\n- micro-frontend.config.ts: them trang chu cong khai + loi vao cong quan tri noi\n  dung Wagtail (/appsale/cms-admin/, quyen content.view_cms, cau noi phien\n  /api/cms/session/).\n\nKhong dung man quan tri bang ron nao - Wagtail admin da la man do.","tree":{"sha":"c03e4b98a0fa09144edc8838b5d4b9e813b4065c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/trees/c03e4b98a0fa09144edc8838b5d4b9e813b4065c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hungmaix94/app-sale-micro-frontend/git/commits/029ce6a4617224c84c87caacf4e0857cda335b0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172227952?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamhung94","id":172227952,"login":"phamhung94","node_id":"U_kgDOCkP9cA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamhung94/repos","site_admin