board/groups), a two-pane group\nconversation view, narrower chat bubbles, centered/rounded modals with\nEscape-to-close, a 560px-capped onboarding flow, Enter-to-send in\ncoach/groups, and web hover feedback on the sidebar and Button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"120dfd22f9d778938548dcdceed7017f194ad51d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/120dfd22f9d778938548dcdceed7017f194ad51d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/29ea3e745803abf59738781e951fa9bde2d11280","verification":{"payload":"tree 120dfd22f9d778938548dcdceed7017f194ad51d\nparent fe3532f682aa59c9cf750fa3078ce6097e837a04\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789339034 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789339034 +0000\n\nAdapt the app for wide/desktop screens\n\nAdds a breakpoint system (mobile/tablet/desktop) that gates every new\nbehavior — mobile rendering (<768px) is untouched, only additive desktop\nbranches were introduced. Desktop gets: a persistent 240px sidebar\nreplacing the floating tab bar, adaptive grids (3-col recipes, 4-col\nbadges, 2-col recommended sessions/dashboard/groups), a two-pane group\nconversation view, narrower chat bubbles, centered/rounded modals with\nEscape-to-close, a 560px-capped onboarding flow, Enter-to-send in\ncoach/groups, and web hover feedback on the sidebar and Button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD5vDWdC\nBxCVwhn8C1tFEQTCQysSLdAdzqKh5/u+8Fc0rAsuVbHso9Pj7zAFuc7vtgneMjtiG3e6NRFVHpbi\nWwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T22:37:20Z"}},"co