Graph tags, manifest link, and\n  apple-mobile-web-app-* tags for iOS home-screen installs\n- Hide the camera-specific \"take a photo\" affordance on web (scanner\n  and skincare''s problem tab), since expo-image-picker''s\n  launchCameraAsync just falls back to the same file picker as the\n  gallery there; skincare''s problem tab swaps to the gallery picker\n  with an adjusted label/icon instead of only offering a camera button\n- Hide the profile''s Notifications section on web (a Supabase-stored\n  preference, not an actual push notification module)\n- Confirmed no other native-only API needs a web guard: expo-haptics\n  and expo-image-manipulator already ship web implementations, and\n  Share.share''s web rejection was already handled by an existing\n  try/catch","tree":{"sha":"e9b4d403d490a85a336607a9aa0ef16f6f019920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/e9b4d403d490a85a336607a9aa0ef16f6f019920"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/fe3532f682aa59c9cf750fa3078ce6097e837a04","verification":{"payload":"tree e9b4d403d490a85a336607a9aa0ef16f6f019920\nparent ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786089826 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786089826 +0000\n\nPrepare the app for web deployment on Vercel\n\n- Add vercel.json rewriting every route to index.html (SPA deep-link\n  refresh support)\n- Add public/manifest.json (PWA metadata, standalone display, #0a0d0c\n  theme) and 192/512px icons generated from assets/icon.png\n- Add public/index.html — the actual customization point for\n  web.output: \"single\" (an app/+html.tsx would have been silently\n  ignored, that mechanism only applies to output: \"static\"): sets the\n  page title, meta description, Open Graph tags, manifest link, and\n  apple-mobile-web-app-* tags for iOS home-screen installs\n- Hide the camera-specific \"take a photo\" affordance on web (scanner\n  and skincare''s problem tab), since expo-image-picker''s\n  launchCameraAsync just falls back to the same file picker as the\n  gallery there; skincare''s problem tab swaps to the gallery picker\n  with an adjusted label/icon instead of only offering a camera button\n- Hide the profile''s Notifications section on web (a Supabase-stored\n  preference, not an actual push notification module)\n- Confirmed no other native-only API needs a web guard: expo-haptics\n  and expo-image-manipulator already ship web implementations, and\n  Share.share''s web rejection was already handled by an existing\n  try/catch\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL1XXrn3\n+DQ4CtV9KNupV/i+Lb5ge+TzxkncLS1NHdn1zQS5KXk8mpj1rjr/chnMEGqAWE+DiRvtxrX2NtdL\n+Ak=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T08:04:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/fe3532f682aa59c9cf750fa3078ce6097e837a04","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGZlMzUzMmY2ODJhYTU5YzljZjc1MGZhMzA3OGNlNjA5N2U4MzdhMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a","sha":"ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a"}],"sha":"fe3532f682aa59c9cf750fa3078ce6097e837a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/fe3532f682aa59c9cf750fa3078ce6097e837a04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:51:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:51:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix coach image moderation JSON parsing, share JSON cleanup across all AI calls\n\n- Add extractJsonObject() to lib/anthropic.ts (strip markdown fence, then\n  extract the first {...} object via regex) and use it everywhere a JSON\n  reply is parsed: coach moderation, meal scanner, recipes, progress\n  analysis, skincare — replacing the fence-only stripJsonFences at each\n  call site\n- Rewrite moderateCoachImage: switch to FAST_MODEL, log the raw response\n  before parsing, strengthen the prompt (JSON only, no intro/markdown,\n  {\"approuve\": true|false, \"raison\"?}), and prefill the assistant turn\n  with \"{\" to force the response to start as JSON\n- moderateCoachImage now returns ''approved'' | ''rejected'' | ''check_failed''\n  instead of a boolean, so a real rejection and a broken/unparseable check\n  show distinct messages instead of both looking like \"inappropriate image\"\n- Raise the moderation call''s max_tokens from 20 to 60 so a \"raison\" string\n  can''t get truncated mid-token into invalid JSON","tree":{"sha":"d111e21029726530d6f8355fc9f1529aee0b7365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/d111e21029726530d6f8355fc9f1529aee0b7365"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a","verification":{"payload":"tree d111e21029726530d6f8355fc9f1529aee0b7365\nparent 1ffe58d8b58f6487f04631611c6f66ce8e1edbab\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786089098 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786089098 +0000\n\nFix coach image moderation JSON parsing, share JSON cleanup across all AI calls\n\n- Add extractJsonObject() to lib/anthropic.ts (strip markdown fence, then\n  extract the first {...} object via regex) and use it everywhere a JSON\n  reply is parsed: coach moderation, meal scanner, recipes, progress\n  analysis, skincare — replacing the fence-only stripJsonFences at each\n  call site\n- Rewrite moderateCoachImage: switch to FAST_MODEL, log the raw response\n  before parsing, strengthen the prompt (JSON only, no intro/markdown,\n  {\"approuve\": true|false, \"raison\"?}), and prefill the assistant turn\n  with \"{\" to force the response to start as JSON\n- moderateCoachImage now returns ''approved'' | ''rejected'' | ''check_failed''\n  instead of a boolean, so a real rejection and a broken/unparseable check\n  show distinct messages instead of both looking like \"inappropriate image\"\n- Raise the moderation call''s max_tokens from 20 to 60 so a \"raison\" string\n  can''t get truncated mid-token into invalid JSON\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCKfjLqN\nT6bAkWTVtYfOx5xd7TL/0P166Xu63MaA8D8JLPAJnFFwzJBJi0uitI8p5vQ7iTIOUoCVPBaGpCPv\nmAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T07:53:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/ffbfefdaa2dd5a5c1400d211cabde87d9580a65a","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGZmYmZlZmRhYTJkZDVhNWMxNDAwZDIxMWNhYmRlODdkOTU4MGE2NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/1ffe58d8b58f6487f04631611c6f66ce8e1edbab","sha":"1ffe58d8b58f6487f04631611c6f66ce8e1edbab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/1ffe58d8b58f6487f0463