ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:28:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:28:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add web search + image upload to the coach, add the Skincare feature\n\nCoach:\n- Add the web_search tool (max 3 uses) for product/price/retailer questions\n  only, per an explicit system-prompt rule set (exact name, price range,\n  French retailers, never supplements/medications/prescription treatments,\n  dermatologist referral for persistent skin issues)\n- Concatenate all text blocks in a response instead of reading content[0],\n  since a search-augmented reply mixes text with tool-result blocks\n- Show a distinct typing-indicator label while a likely product question is\n  in flight (heuristic — the non-streaming API has no live \"searching\" signal)\n- Add image attachments: paperclip picker, pre-send moderation check that\n  fails closed, upload to a new private coach-images bucket only once\n  accepted, 200px display in the user bubble\n\nSkincare (new feature):\n- lib/skincare.ts: evolution-comparison and problem-photo analysis against\n  skin_photos, with mandatory guardrails (no diagnosis or pathology names,\n  OTC cosmetics only, dermatologist-referral closing line, {\"erreur\"} for\n  non-skin/inappropriate photos)\n- app/skincare.tsx: \"Mon évolution\" (before/now frames, derived from the\n  oldest/newest evolution photo) and \"Analyser un problème\" (camera capture\n  + history) tabs\n- Wired into the + menu and into profil.tsx with an analyses-performed count","tree":{"sha":"b89c1f355f6fe183a9da2fba1d884d4c68c5febb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/b89c1f355f6fe183a9da2fba1d884d4c68c5febb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/1ffe58d8b58f6487f04631611c6f66ce8e1edbab","verification":{"payload":"tree b89c1f355f6fe183a9da2fba1d884d4c68c5febb\nparent 2423f1b6f4c1eb39d1d4d885f0cb3f65ee81c476\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786019331 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786019331 +0000\n\nAdd web search + image upload to the coach, add the Skincare feature\n\nCoach:\n- Add the web_search tool (max 3 uses) for product/price/retailer questions\n  only, per an explicit system-prompt rule set (exact name, price range,\n  French retailers, never supplements/medications/prescription treatments,\n  dermatologist referral for persistent skin issues)\n- Concatenate all text blocks in a response instead of reading content[0],\n  since a search-augmented reply mixes text with tool-result blocks\n- Show a distinct typing-indicator label while a likely product question is\n  in flight (heuristic — the non-streaming API has no live \"searching\" signal)\n- Add image attachments: paperclip picker, pre-send moderation check that\n  fails closed, upload to a new private coach-images bucket only once\n  accepted, 200px display in the user bubble\n\nSkincare (new feature):\n- lib/skincare.ts: evolution-comparison and problem-photo analysis against\n  skin_photos, with mandatory guardrails (no diagnosis or pathology names,\n  OTC cosmetics only, dermatologist-referral closing line, {\"erreur\"} for\n  non-skin/inappropriate photos)\n- app/skincare.tsx: \"Mon évolution\" (before/now frames, derived from the\n  oldest/newest evolution photo) and \"Analyser un problème\" (camera capture\n  + history) tabs\n- Wired into the + menu and into profil.tsx with an analyses-performed count\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJMMfpfd\nkK9FexZpf7oN+LQKEsENKimN1trLFgGvX/AXZZBS0fR7XZBVe00f1WkY7uyLMj0UzgD2aFCk0RJn\ngQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T12:29:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","ev