n logging, and progressive UI rendering as each batch lands\n- Shorten the system prompt and lower max_tokens on every recipe/fridge call\n- Strengthen the categorie_visuelle prompt with explicit examples and add a\n  title-keyword override that takes precedence over the AI''s own classification\n\nGroups:\n- Add avatar/banner upload (admin-only) to the group info screen, private-group\n  toggle, pending join-request review (accept/refuse), and long-press to\n  remove a member\n- Joining a private group by code now creates a join request instead of\n  adding the member directly\n- Show group avatar (list + conversation header) and banner (conversation\n  header), falling back to the initial when absent","tree":{"sha":"9d57ea51aeda2bf98c98ddc7d11d70fffe4313e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/9d57ea51aeda2bf98c98ddc7d11d70fffe4313e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/1ca6f29af98fe2aac9e57d5c284e854d90135965","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d57ea51aeda2bf98c98ddc7d11d70fffe4313e0\nparent d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786000650 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786000650 +0000\n\nSpeed up recipe generation, fix mismatched dish photos, add private groups with admin controls\n\nRecipes:\n- Split category generation into 2 parallel 3-recipe batches (was one 10-recipe\n  call) with a 45s AbortController timeout, one retry on network failure, call\n  duration logging, and progressive UI rendering as each batch lands\n- Shorten the system prompt and lower max_tokens on every recipe/fridge call\n- Strengthen the categorie_visuelle prompt with explicit examples and add a\n  title-keyword override that takes precedence over the AI''s own classification\n\nGroups:\n- Add avatar/banner upload (admin-only) to the group info screen, private-group\n  toggle, pending join-request review (accept/refuse), and long-press to\n  remove a member\n- Joining a private group by code now creates a join request instead of\n  adding the member directly\n- Show group avatar (list + conversation header) and banner (conversation\n  header), falling back to the initial when absent\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC9P1ipm\nWbJGlOLNJI8/fSjMWJWEXEDc0f2Kv/hiXSRp4EwiQS1MIYX0Zgu8CdJD3modKz3ID1cEjIEKNYFZ\nEQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T07:21:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/1ca6f29af98fe2aac9e57d5c284e854d90135965","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDFjYTZmMjlhZjk4ZmUyYWFjOWU1N2Q1YzI4NGU4NTRkOTAxMzU5NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","sha":"d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298"}],"sha":"1ca6f29af98fe2aac9e57d5c284e854d90135965","