"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/8ccebbdb976d021820c74a6a44751928893f3eb9","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDhjY2ViYmRiOTc2ZDAyMTgyMGM3NGE2YTQ0NzUxOTI4ODkzZjNlYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a","sha":"fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","sha":"d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298"}],"sha":"8ccebbdb976d021820c74a6a44751928893f3eb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/8ccebbdb976d021820c74a6a44751928893f3eb9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:25:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:25:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Reorganize dashboard, add adaptive hydration goal, refresh branding assets\n\n- Reorder dashboard sections (hydration moved up, BMI moved down)\n- Replace \"Boire 3,5L d''eau\" mission with a profile-objective mission,\n  and compute the hydration goal from weight + activity level\n- Show the app logo on the coach avatar instead of a \"C\" placeholder\n- Add exerciseImage() keyword matcher and use it in the workout tab\n  and session detail screen\n- Enlarge and center the dashboard logo/wordmark\n- Migrate app.json to the expo-splash-screen plugin for a centered,\n  properly sized splash logo\n- Add a language pill + picker to the welcome screen, backed by a\n  pending-locale AsyncStorage layer so pre-auth changes apply\n  immediately and seed the new account''s settings row","tree":{"sha":"5853139e0e941031e4455dfa8a5c51f4697cfea3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/5853139e0e941031e4455dfa8a5c51f4697cfea3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","verification":{"payload":"tree 5853139e0e941031e4455dfa8a5c51f4697cfea3\nparent cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785972336 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785972336 +0000\n\nReorganize dashboard, add adaptive hydration goal, refresh branding assets\n\n- Reorder dashboard sections (hydration moved up, BMI moved down)\n- Replace \"Boire 3,5L d''eau\" mission with a profile-objective mission,\n  and compute the hydration goal from weight + activity level\n- Show the app logo on the coach avatar instead of a \"C\" placeholder\n- Add exerciseImage() keyword matcher and use it in the workout tab\n  and session detail screen\n- Enlarge and center the dashboard logo/wordmark\n- Migrate app.json to the expo-splash-screen plugin for a centered,\n  properly sized splash logo\n- Add a language pill + picker to the welcome screen, backed by a\n  pending-locale AsyncStorage layer so pre-auth changes apply\n  immediately and seed the new account''s settings row\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCcVwRS8\ngGUZsjXcOTmZpxwbfizI3sDwtoxyr/WEmtR3RgI9MBxZnQ3McbhCjomU1Vxmtz3PRKuIy1NMcd0n\nNAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T23:25:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/d7f295b09d76efc7577983474b1fe4cade7e3298","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGQ3ZjI5NWIwOWQ3NmVmYzc1Nzc5ODM0NzRiMWZlNGNhZGU3ZTMyOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","sha":"cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161"}],"sha":"d7f295b09d76ef