iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGZjMmM3NjBlYzlmMmFiNjI3MTU0Mjk1NGY2ZjBiODdjNTA0YjNjMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/08e73782f53ccaa53c5eae6fd40c23b9ab1e569d","sha":"08e73782f53ccaa53c5eae6fd40c23b9ab1e569d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/08e73782f53ccaa53c5eae6fd40c23b9ab1e569d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","sha":"cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161"}],"sha":"fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/fc2c760ec9f2ab6271542954f6f0b87c504b3c2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:01:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:01:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix 5 bugs: tab bar overlap, weight chart empty state, missing hydration keys, subscription date, modal keyboard coverage\n\n1. constants/layout.ts centralizes TAB_BAR_HEIGHT/TAB_BAR_CLEARANCE (shared\n   with app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx, eliminating the drift where scanner.tsx had\n   quietly diverged to a wrong bar height). Applied as paddingBottom on every\n   scrollable tab screen''s content (index, coach, progression, workout,\n   meals, profil) so content never sits under the floating tab bar.\n\n2. Weight chart could show a false \"add at least two weigh-ins\" empty state\n   when logs existed but fell outside the default 30-day period. Auto-selects\n   the narrowest period that actually has >=2 points on load, without\n   overriding a period the user picks afterward. Added a dev-only console.log\n   of point counts for future debugging.\n\n3. Added missing progression.hydration.title/subtitle across all 6 locales\n   (HydrationSummaryCard was already referencing them). Swept every t()\n   call in the codebase against fr.ts''s key set to catch any other\n   silently-missing keys beyond what check-locale-keys.js''s cross-locale\n   comparison alone can see — found none beyond this one.\n\n4. Subscription renewal date was computed as today + 1 month, drifting every\n   time the profile screen was opened. Now anchored on profiles.created_at,\n   rolling forward one billing cycle at a time to the next upcoming renewal\n   (TODO comment marks this as a placeholder for RevenueCat''s real date).\n\n5. Seven modals with a text field (TextInputModal, CreateGroupModal,\n   DeleteAccountModal, ReferralCodeModal, EmailChangeModal, AddFoodModal,\n   EditMealModal) had no keyboard avoidance, so the keyboard could cover the\n   input. Wrapped each in KeyboardAvoidingView (padding/height) + ScrollView\n   with keyboardShouldPersistTaps=\"handled\".","tree":{"sha":"348c1e65368f1ce5159b4dcdcfab16997ead23b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/348c1e65368f1ce5159b4dcdcfab16997ead23b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","verification":{"payload":"tree 348c1e65368f1ce5159b4dcdcfab16997ead23b8\nparent 80c10f48a034f33e6be158ac5600f537f8028b3a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785970915 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785970915 +0000\n\nFix 5 bugs: tab bar overlap, weight chart empty state, missing hydration keys, subscription date, modal keyboard coverage\n\n1. constants/layout.ts centralizes TAB_BAR_HEIGHT/TAB_BAR_CLEARANCE (shared\n   with app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx, eliminating the drift where scanner.tsx had\n   quietly diverged to a wrong bar height). Applied as paddingBottom on every\n   scrollable tab screen''s content (index, coach, progression, workout,\n   meals, profil) so content never sits under the floating tab bar.\n\n2. Weight chart could show a false \"add at least two weigh-ins\" empty state\n   when logs existed but fell outside the default 30-day period. Auto-selects\n   the narrowest period that actually has >=2 points on load, without\n   overriding a period the user picks afterward. Added a dev-only console.log\n   of point counts for future debugging.\n\n3. Added missing progression.hydration.title/subtitle across all 6 locales\n   (HydrationSummaryCard was already referencing them). Swept every t()\n   call in the codebase against fr.ts''s key set to catch any other\n   silently-missing keys beyond what check-locale-keys.js''s cross-locale\n   comparison alone can see — found none beyond this one.\n\n4. Subscription renewal date was computed as today + 1 month, drifting every\n   time the profile screen was opened. Now anchored on profiles.created_at,\n   rolling forward one billing cycle at a time to the next upcoming renewal\n   (TODO comment marks this as a placeholder for RevenueCat''s real date).\n\n5. Seven modals with a text field (TextInputModal, CreateGroupModal,\n   DeleteAccountModal, ReferralCodeModal, EmailChangeModal, AddFoodModal,\n   EditMealModal) had no keyboard avoidance, so the keyboard could cover the\n   input. Wrapped each in KeyboardAvoidingView (padding/height) + ScrollView\n   with keyboardShouldPersistTaps=\"handled\".\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBU0ExHp\nQef9cu3Q0V4M8o57imFuTgO3Dy9FKXRxlIcHCcoFbOtWxiNv4oUau3k61niOuBV6kuxWQfpl7X/m\nfgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T23:02:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/cf74d558210f0524dcf6eda77b02e5922910b161","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGNmNzRkNTU4MjEwZjA1MjRkY2Y2ZWRhNzdiMDJlNTkyMjkxMGIxNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/80c10f48a034f33e6be158ac560