com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/378d6f59451db02cbf3fd61502ad43848d4ff929","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDM3OGQ2ZjU5NDUxZGIwMmNiZjNmZDYxNTAyYWQ0Mzg0OGQ0ZmY5Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/77b9ee8a16416c10681626b121f61ed11aacb634","sha":"77b9ee8a16416c10681626b121f61ed11aacb634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/77b9ee8a16416c10681626b121f61ed11aacb634"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8","sha":"867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8"}],"sha":"378d6f59451db02cbf3fd61502ad43848d4ff929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/378d6f59451db02cbf3fd61502ad43848d4ff929"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T18:51:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T18:51:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Remove react-native-reanimated from onboarding, rebuild with RN Animated\n\nReanimated v4 requires the react-native-worklets native module, which\nisn''t part of Expo Go regardless of version alignment — it crashed the\napp at startup with \"Exception in HostFunction\" as soon as reanimated\ninitialized. Abandoning reanimated entirely per the reported blocker.\n\nRewrote every onboarding animation (OnboardingLayout, OptionCard,\nBreatherScreen, NumericStepperScreen, ResultScreen, FinalScreen, and\nthe q/[step] screen transition) with React Native''s own Animated API,\nkeeping the same durations, easings, and effects. useNativeDriver:\ntrue wherever opacity/transform allows it; the progress bar''s width\nand the result screen''s counter stay JS-driven since they don''t\nqualify for the native driver (layout property / no style at all,\nrespectively) but are cheap enough not to matter. Color transitions\n(card and button backgrounds) switch instantly with the underlying\nstate instead of animating, since backgroundColor/color can''t use the\nnative driver either and JS-driving color interpolation across\nseveral elements isn''t worth the cost for a purely cosmetic effect.\n\nRemoved react-native-reanimated and react-native-worklets from\npackage.json. They kept reappearing in node_modules afterward because\nnpm auto-installs expo-router''s optional peer dependency on them —\nadded .npmrc (omit=optional) so a plain `npm install` actually leaves\nthem out. Verified via the exported bundle that no reachable code path\nrequires either package anymore.","tree":{"sha":"c57ab4f0cff369f5df1d727a077ab031a3e44e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/c57ab4f0cff369f5df1d727a077ab031a3e44e97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8","verification":{"payload":"tree c57ab4f0cff369f5df1d727a077ab031a3e44e97\nparent e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785955873 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785955873 +0000\n\nRemove react-native-reanimated from onboarding, rebuild with RN Animated\n\nReanimated v4 requires the react-native-worklets native module, which\nisn''t part of Expo Go regardless of version alignment — it crashed the\napp at startup with \"Exception in HostFunction\" as soon as reanimated\ninitialized. Abandoning reanimated entirely per the reported blocker.\n\nRewrote every onboarding animation (OnboardingLayout, OptionCard,\nBreatherScreen, NumericStepperScreen, ResultScreen, FinalScreen, and\nthe q/[step] screen transition) with React Native''s own Animated API,\nkeeping the same durations, easings, and effects. useNativeDriver:\ntrue wherever opacity/transform allows it; the progress bar''s width\nand the result screen''s counter stay JS-driven since they don''t\nqualify for the native driver (layout property / no style at all,\nrespectively) but are cheap enough not to matter. Color transitions\n(card and button backgrounds) switch instantly with the underlying\nstate instead of animating, since backgroundColor/color can''t use the\nnative driver either and JS-driving color interpolation across\nseveral elements isn''t worth the cost for a purely cosmetic effect.\n\nRemoved react-native-reanimated and react-native-worklets from\npackage.json. They kept reappearing in node_modules afterward because\nnpm auto-installs expo-router''s optional peer dependency on them —\nadded .npmrc (omit=optional) so a plain `npm install` actually leaves\nthem out. Verified via the exported bundle that no reachable code path\nrequires either package anymore.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCmWSVI/\nLajUnIPBfKjR62EqL3iCWO7suBtr3+Mc4ZMN+i/XIrZMl3mxyCuXeUKstONSA7GeqCvXpoHxiYLn\nbgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T18:51:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDg2N2M5ZTRiY2VkMzkyZTEyMzU0MDVjYTU4MTFmMmM3YjNlZjVjZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67","sha":"e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67"}],"sha":"867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/867c9e4bced392e1235405ca5811f2c7b3ef5cf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T18:30:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T18:30:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Pin react-native-worklets to Expo Go''s SDK 54 bundled version\n\nreact-native-reanimated v4 requires react-native-worklets as a peer\ndependency; npm''s auto-peer-install picked the newest satisfying\nversion (0.8.3) instead of the one actually baked into the Expo Go\nSDK 54 client (0.5.1, per expo''s bundledNativeModules.json). That\nnative/JS version mismatch crashed the app in Expo Go with an\n\"Exception in HostFunction\" as soon as reanimated loaded. Pinning\nreact-native-worklets to 0.5.1 resolves the mismatch; babel-preset-expo\nalready auto-detects and appends the worklets plugin last in the\nplugin list, so no babel.config.js is needed.","tree":{"sha":"ea7ba37b3a1c94b94357692d25dca714da9fe676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/ea7ba37b3a1c94b94357692d25dca714da9fe676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/e9543eedb8d7da270581c2ea787138a20cc27c67","verification":{"payload":"tree ea7ba37b3a1c94b94357692d25dca714da9fe676\nparent cf17f094f60b5f313ce349b3315bc69e728e7a7e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785954636 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785954636 +0000\n\nPin react-native-worklets to Expo Go''s SDK 54 bundled version\n\nreact-native-reanimated v4 requires react-native-worklets as a peer\ndependency; npm''s auto-peer-install picked the newest satisfying\nversion (0.8.3) instead of the one actually baked into the Expo Go\nSDK 54 client (0.5.1, per expo''s bundledNativeModules.json). That\nnative/JS version mismatch crashed the app in Expo Go with an\n\"Exception in HostFunction\" as soon as reanimated loaded. Pinning\nreact-native-worklets to 0.5.1 resolves the mismatch; babel-preset-expo\nalready auto-detects and appends the worklets plugin last in the\nplugin list, so no babel.config.js is needed.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAMcUlRi\n/ph+Fa8OjLsaQZmHajh8gyKk7TSwLOaKlIs8wrOQ9+LPGVe3Vika40TAKsozWJ4INybeLcrjpeaX\nGAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T18:30:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","