ps://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/b2c25a507e09f102f42eb14183f266b18e919cd4","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGIyYzI1YTUwN2UwOWYxMDJmNDJlYjE0MTgzZjI2NmIxOGU5MTljZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/0b2e60fc9bfa9743e03880d4e6c96952d6e733c3","sha":"0b2e60fc9bfa9743e03880d4e6c96952d6e733c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/0b2e60fc9bfa9743e03880d4e6c96952d6e733c3"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/b63c50518de9c8225c62f5d757fa588059cfbafe","sha":"b63c50518de9c8225c62f5d757fa588059cfbafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/b63c50518de9c8225c62f5d757fa588059cfbafe"}],"sha":"b2c25a507e09f102f42eb14183f266b18e919cd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/b2c25a507e09f102f42eb14183f266b18e919cd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/b63c50518de9c8225c62f5d757fa588059cfbafe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:36:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:36:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Document i18n and Groups features in README\n\nAdds \"Internationalisation (i18n)\" and \"Groupes\" sections documenting the\n6-language locale system (structure, placeholders, pluralization, the\n%{name} interpolation gotcha, constants-vs-stored-values rule) and the\nGroups feature (schema, RLS/is_group_member(), hooks, screen behavior,\nand the swipe-to-reply deviation — long-press menu instead, since no\nother interaction in the app uses a swipe gesture). Also notes known\nGroups gaps (no unblock UI, no report-review screen, no admin promotion)\nin \"Prochaines étapes\".\n\nVerification for this pass: npx tsc --noEmit clean, node\nscripts/check-locale-keys.js reports all 6 locales matching fr.ts exactly\n(839 keys), npx expo export --platform web succeeds, and a Playwright\nsmoke test against `expo start --web` confirms the app boots and renders\ncorrectly localized content with no console/React errors (only an\nexpected sandboxed-network image-load failure). Post-auth screens\n(language picker, Groups list/chat) require a live Supabase project this\nsandbox doesn''t have credentials for, so they weren''t exercised\ninteractively — only via typecheck/build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"e2df9238a0551dd3867c48e63934d06a45d5f004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/e2df9238a0551dd3867c48e63934d06a45d5f004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/b63c50518de9c8225c62f5d757fa588059cfbafe","verification":{"payload":"tree e2df9238a0551dd3867c48e63934d06a45d5f004\nparent a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936968 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936968 +0000\n\nDocument i18n and Groups features in README\n\nAdds \"Internationalisation (i18n)\" and \"Groupes\" sections documenting the\n6-language locale system (structure, placeholders, pluralization, the\n%{name} interpolation gotcha, constants-vs-stored-values rule) and the\nGroups feature (schema, RLS/is_group_member(), hooks, screen behavior,\nand the swipe-to-reply deviation — long-press menu instead, since no\nother interaction in the app uses a swipe gesture). Also notes known\nGroups gaps (no unblock UI, no report-review screen, no admin promotion)\nin \"Prochaines étapes\".\n\nVerification for this pass: npx tsc --noEmit clean, node\nscripts/check-locale-keys.js reports all 6 locales matching fr.ts exactly\n(839 keys), npx expo export --platform web succeeds, and a Playwright\nsmoke test against `expo start --web` confirms the app boots and renders\ncorrectly localized content with no console/React errors (only an\nexpected sandboxed-network image-load failure). Post-auth screens\n(language picker, Groups list/chat) require a live Supabase project this\nsandbox doesn''t have credentials for, so they weren''t exercised\ninteractively — only via typecheck/build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCnsaSRo\nbdTVhAz8G