s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:27:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:27:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Groups: wire into NavigationSheet + register routes\n\nUn-grays the \"Groupes\" card in the + menu (now routes to /groups instead\nof showing the \"coming soon\" alert) and registers /groups, /group/[id],\nand /group/[id]/info in app/_layout.tsx''s protected stack.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"f93db7ddc55bb5cba5e46ce9992c6b87e99c08ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/f93db7ddc55bb5cba5e46ce9992c6b87e99c08ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30","verification":{"payload":"tree f93db7ddc55bb5cba5e46ce9992c6b87e99c08ed\nparent e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936434 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936434 +0000\n\nGroups: wire into NavigationSheet + register routes\n\nUn-grays the \"Groupes\" card in the + menu (now routes to /groups instead\nof showing the \"coming soon\" alert) and registers /groups, /group/[id],\nand /group/[id]/info in app/_layout.tsx''s protected stack.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJJamph7\np/6k5So1jr8Wwo6Y/vFhDNFuBIr9GXjolYNUF+76lRYGvk6OefDZMHMnyJ7kj1iUPJ285tkuy/V/\n4wo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T13:27:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGE5ZDcyYWFlNzU5OGY0YmM3NzgzMzAzNjgyZWZhZjY3Mjg5YjRkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9","sha":"e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9"}],"sha":"a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/a9d72aae7598f4bc7783303682efaf67289b4d30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:26:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T13:26:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Groups: info screen + fix hardcoded French in lib/alert.ts\n\nAdds app/group/[id]/info.tsx: name/description, invite code with copy and\nshare, member list (avatar initial, role badge), admin-only remove-member\nand delete-group (double confirmation, matching the resetProgress pattern\nalready used in profil.tsx), block member (hides their messages locally\nvia the new hooks/useBlockedUsers.ts, wired into the conversation screen''s\nmessage filtering), leave group.\n\nAlso fixes a real i18n gap the earlier extraction pass missed: lib/alert.ts''s\nshowConfirm() hardcoded the cancel button as French \"Annuler\" — it''s a plain\nmodule with no useLocale() access, so no domain agent''s file list caught it.\nIt now takes cancelLabel as an explicit parameter (same pattern as\nmapAuthError/describeAnthropicError), and every call site across the app\npasses t(''common.cancel''). Also removed lib/foodScanner.ts''s compressImage()\nuntranslated-fallback default now that its one caller missing `t`\n(app/recipes.tsx''s fridge-photo flow) passes it directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"9b21f35e5dbb751829c478147ca9989973e2f18f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/9b21f35e5dbb751829c478147ca9989973e2f18f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b21f35e5dbb751829c478147ca9989973e2f18f\nparent 5f4fb2e2ba78d3d1842abf00e54d8c1e30cadf08\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936384 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785936384 +0000\n\nGroups: info screen + fix hardcoded French in lib/alert.ts\n\nAdds app/group/[id]/info.tsx: name/description, invite code with copy and\nshare, member list (avatar initial, role badge), admin-only remove-member\nand delete-group (double confirmation, matching the resetProgress pattern\nalready used in profil.tsx), block member (hides their messages locally\nvia the new hooks/useBlockedUsers.ts, wired into the conversation screen''s\nmessage filtering), leave group.\n\nAlso fixes a real i18n gap the earlier extraction pass missed: lib/alert.ts''s\nshowConfirm() hardcoded the cancel button as French \"Annuler\" — it''s a plain\nmodule with no useLocale() access, so no domain agent''s file list caught it.\nIt now takes cancelLabel as an explicit parameter (same pattern as\nmapAuthError/describeAnthropicError), and every call site across the app\npasses t(''common.cancel''). Also removed lib/foodScanner.ts''s compressImage()\nuntranslated-fallback default now that its one caller missing `t`\n(app/recipes.tsx''s fridge-photo flow) passes it directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOU5zsZV\nvUedwhsue6ZQjsYq/rZl2DEmBt3BT0ybGj2/evY4vbBjcn2eloaWYOkYnPhFUj7mNzdqm7L74U19\nIgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T13:26:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/e75eabdbf2546dc0ee4dec21c05fe0b6770768f9","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGU3NWVhYmRiZjI1NDZkYzBlZTRkZWMyMWMwNWZlMGI2NzcwNzY4Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/5f4fb2e2ba78d3d1842abf00e54d8c1e30cadf08","sha":"5f4fb2e2ba78d3d1842abf00e54d8c1e30cadf08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/5f4fb2e2ba78d3d1842abf00e54d8c1e30cadf08"}],"sha":