rcle, join/create buttons), group cards (avatar\ninitial, unread badge, last-message preview with author name), FAB, Join\nmodal (reuses TextInputModal), Create modal (two-step: form, then\ngenerated-code share screen reusing ReferralCard''s code-block pattern).\n\nDeletes components/ScreenPlaceholder.tsx — it was only used by the\nnow-implemented Groups placeholder and had gone completely unreferenced,\nincluding a leftover hardcoded French default string from before i18n.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJXLVnbi\nqsp/rfN/17f8QZIdKn6KQvf35RCm5G89c6bC9jCZHY7vP99/7PQgA0tnEH6meL9rZg8VWGvCedNq\nkQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T13:16:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/1035478c8239876a0b37dfb554aebf28057