 toggle\nreactions). All group-facing strings are wired through a new `groups`\nlocale domain, translated into all 6 languages and verified against fr.ts.\n\nSQL for groups/group_members/group_messages/message_reactions/\nmessage_reports/blocked_users (with RLS + a security-definer\nis_group_member() to avoid policy recursion) and the group-images storage\nbucket policies were provided separately for the user to run in Supabase —\nnot yet documented in README (pending final Groups verification pass).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"b21f1d2e67759adfc891736fd933763d9950f67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/b21f1d2e67759adfc891736fd933763d9950f67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/ff2e5254fde5556da8f8735eb4e11b62108eaeba","verification":{"payload":"tree b21f1d2e67759adfc891736fd933763d9950f67d\nparent 6e76b65dc7b9d4de7b228c82f052a420c2086996\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785935565 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785935565 +0000\n\nGroups: hooks + locale keys foundation\n\nAdds lib/groups.ts (invite code generation), hooks/useGroups.ts (list +\njoin/create), hooks/useGroupMessages.ts (realtime, paginated, optimistic\nsend/delete/report), hooks/useMessageReactions.ts (realtime toggle\nreactions). All group-facing strings are wired through a new `groups`\nlocale domain, translated into all 6 languages and verified against fr.ts.\n\nSQL for groups/group_members/group_messages/message_reactions/\nmessage_reports/blocked_users (with RLS + a security-definer\nis_group_member() to avoid policy recursion) and the group-images storage\nbucket policies were provided separately for the user to run in Supabase —\nnot yet documented in README (pending final Groups verification pass).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/