01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"4136122510fcf625d400eb9f030e884ef06fe89f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/4136122510fcf625d400eb9f030e884ef06fe89f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/c19e8f3c7e7848bbd618497265ec1b132b38ae9e","verification":{"payload":"tree 4136122510fcf625d400eb9f030e884ef06fe89f\nparent c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785916561 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785916561 +0000\n\ni18n: extract profile and badges strings\n\nFills the profile and badges domains in locales/fr.ts and rewires the\nprofile tab, badges screen, settings modals, tab bar, notifications, and\nlegal pages to call useLocale().t(...) instead of hardcoded French. Reuses\nthe existing common/errors keys for generic buttons and auth errors.\nSubscriptionCard/badges/meals date formatting now goes through\nlib/format.ts''s locale-aware formatters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEFpRpX7\n/JB26oLVD2YYfFCRg3iSnK1ZLrs6dSSJramgd27ZkOjw1VXMiwAIhrPmsRHF9WfCHyJf8nNvKt0H\nSQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T07:56:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/c19e8f3c7e7848bbd618497265ec1b132b38ae9e","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGMxOWU4ZjNjN2U3ODQ4YmJkNjE4NDk3MjY1ZWMxYjEzMmIzOGFlOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5","sha":"c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5"}],"sha":"c19e8f3c7e7848bbd618497265ec1b132b38ae9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/c19e8f3c7e7848bbd618497265ec1b132b38ae9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:48:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:48:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"i18n: extract onboarding, coach and scanner strings\n\nFills the onboarding, coach, and scanner domains in locales/fr.ts and\nrewires every onboarding screen/component, the coach and scanner tabs,\nand their supporting lib/hook files (lib/coach.ts, lib/foodScanner.ts,\nhooks/useCoachMessages.ts) to call useLocale().t(...) instead of hardcoded\nFrench. Anthropic system prompts in coach.ts/foodScanner.ts now append a\nlanguageInstruction() so replies come back in the user''s active language.\n\nAlso fixes TranslationSchema (locales/fr.ts): `as const` was giving every\nstring a literal type, so translated locale files were being type-checked\nagainst the exact French wording instead of just the key shape. Widened\nleaf types back to `string` while keeping the nested structure.\n\nTranslations for en/es/de/it/pt (still stubbed for these 3 domains) and\nextraction for dashboard/progression/recipes/profile/badges are in progress.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"b025d272f76af3433eaf84a07c376e820f4ce070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/b025d272f76af3433eaf84a07c376e820f4ce070"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5","verification":{"payload":"tree b025d272f76af3433eaf84a07c376e820f4ce070\nparent 2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785916096 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785916096 +0000\n\ni18n: extract onboarding, coach and scanner strings\n\nFills the onboarding, coach, and scanner domains in locales/fr.ts and\nrewires every onboarding screen/component, the coach and scanner tabs,\nand their supporting lib/hook files (lib/coach.ts, lib/foodScanner.ts,\nhooks/useCoachMessages.ts) to call useLocale().t(...) instead of hardcoded\nFrench. Anthropic system prompts in coach.ts/foodScanner.ts now append a\nlanguageInstruction() so replies come back in the user''s active language.\n\nAlso fixes TranslationSchema (locales/fr.ts): `as const` was giving every\nstring a literal type, so translated locale files were being type-checked\nagainst the exact French wording instead of just the key shape. Widened\nleaf types back to `string` while keeping the nested structure.\n\nTranslations for en/es/de/it/pt (still stubbed for these 3 domains) and\nextraction for dashboard/progression/recipes/profile/badges are in progress.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIJ7PoPi\n7s43zJlqb1IAuHoDJ8b6Y4BssGgbT79pIRZpKDraR5Z+K+JjturCSDNw8W74DEFOIYNbTav/+CXT\nvwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T07:48:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKGMzMGEwYjQ2NTBkNDhiY2Q2ZWU5ZDdlOTZiMTczNjQ5N2U4NWVmYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801","sha":"2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801"}],"sha":"c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/c30a0b4650d48bcd6ee9d7e96b1736497e85efa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:38:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:38:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add i18n infrastructure: locales, LocaleContext, device-locale detection\n\nSets up i18n-js + expo-localization for fr/en/es/de/it/pt support: reference\nlocale/schema files (common + errors domains populated, other 8 domains\nstubbed pending extraction), LocaleContext/useLocale wired above ThemeProvider,\nfirst-visit device-locale detection in useSettings, lib/format.ts for\nlocale-aware date/number/weight formatting, and scripts/check-locale-keys.js\nto verify key parity across locale files. Also threads a translate function\ninto lib/authErrors.ts and lib/anthropic.ts so their error messages become\nlocalizable, and adds a shared languageInstruction() helper so future\nAnthropic prompts can request a reply in the user''s active language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"446d5fffc8a08c109589f30324f2cd940ef0736f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/446d5fffc8a08c109589f30324f2cd940ef0736f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/2858b41138202f9150fc5c24ab458b669fb15801","verification":{"payload":"tree 446d5fffc8a08c109589f30324f2cd940ef0736f\nparent c5a91537043b1deb924ba782f9523bdf45f4c8db\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785915522 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785915522 +0000\n\nAdd i18n infrastructure: locales, LocaleContext, device-locale detection\n\nSets up i18n-js + expo-localization for fr/en/es/de/it/pt support: reference\nlocale/schema files (common + errors domains populated, other 8 domains\nstubbed pending extraction), LocaleContext/useLocale wired above ThemeProvider,\nfirst-visit device-locale detection in useSettings, lib/format.ts for\nlocale-aware date/number/weight formatting, and scripts/check-locale-keys.js\nto verify key parity across locale files. Also threads a translate function\ninto lib/authErrors.ts and lib/anthr