it":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:34:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:34:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add editable personal info to the profile screen\n\nAdds a \"Informations personnelles\" section (Prénom/Nom/Nom d''utilisateur/\nEmail) right after the profile header, backed by a new reusable\nTextInputModal (sync validation + async onSave errors, e.g. username\nuniqueness) and a dedicated EmailChangeModal (confirmation-required flow\nvia supabase.auth.updateUser). getDisplayName(profile, user) in the new\nconstants/profile.ts now prioritizes prenom > username > email everywhere\nthe app greets the user. Usernames are auto-generated at signup\n(lib/username.ts), mirroring the existing referral-code generator.","tree":{"sha":"69a23ab02515edde4a848e587c472e7fd026e590","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/69a23ab02515edde4a848e587c472e7fd026e590"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/c5a91537043b1deb924ba782f9523bdf45f4c8db","verification":{"payload":"tree 69a23ab02515edde4a848e587c472e7fd026e590\nparent 9f1da5420ace1e249f66a7f5b843848dbc95f514\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785893657 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785893657 +0000\n\nAdd editable personal info to the profile screen\n\nAdds a \"Informations personnelles\" section (Prénom/Nom/Nom d''utilisateur/\nEmail) right after the profile header, backed by a new reusable\nTextInputModal (sync validation + async onSave errors, e.g. username\nuniqueness) and a dedicated EmailChangeModal (confirmation-required flow\nvia supabase.auth.updateUser). getDisplayName(profile, user) in the new\nconstants/profile.ts now prioritizes prenom > username > email everywhere\nthe app greets the user. Usernames are auto-generated at signup\n(lib/username.ts), mirroring the existing referral-code generator.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----