near trend on weight_logs extrapolated\nto the target weight), expands the chart periods to 3j/7j/14j/30j/90j with\nperiod-aware axis label density, and adds calorie-average,\nweekly-energy and energy-expenditure cards (constants/energy.ts, Mifflin-St\nJeor BMR/TDEE, reused by computeCalorieTarget) plus a badges summary card,\nreordering the screen per spec.","tree":{"sha":"f126550989c2c8f4dc35310c013549e90605b59a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/f126550989c2c8f4dc35310c013549e90605b59a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/9f1da5420ace1e249f66a7f5b843848dbc95f514","verification":{"payload":"tree f126550989c2c8f4dc35310c013549e90605b59a\nparent f5d873816c2ef071619390a7dfe2ebdfd5fb813d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785892221 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785892221 +0000\n\nEnrich Progression screen with goal ETA, energy and badges cards\n\nAdds a goal-estimate card (14-day linear trend on weight_logs extrapolated\nto the target weight), expands the chart periods to 3j/7j/14j/30j/90j with\nperiod-aware axis label density, and adds calorie-average,\nweekly-energy and energy-expenditure cards (constants/energy.ts, Mifflin-St\nJeor BMR/TDEE, reused by computeCalorieTarget) plus a badges summary card,\nreordering the screen per spec.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF+jiXzu\npq+4YI61Ed2gIbftdMVsKrct8NUgwLWmeA3kypk8Qw2DWOqBe7s0dmaprRcMyO/icXHnUtSQUDNG\nzwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T01:10:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/oth