l segment-width/cursor-position math for a bounded [15, 40]\n  visual domain (obésité has no real upper bound, so it''s pinned to the\n  right edge past 40 rather than stretching the bar).\n- components/dashboard/BmiCard.tsx on the dashboard, right after\n  Hydratation: value, non-judgmental status line, animated cursor over a\n  4-segment classification bar, boundary labels, and a tap-to-open\n  BmiInfoModal detailing all four categories plus the \"not a substitute\n  for medical advice / doesn''t account for muscle mass\" disclaimer. Falls\n  back to a \"complete your profile\" prompt when profiles.taille is\n  missing.\n- components/progression/BmiSummaryCard.tsx: compact value/status/mini-bar\n  version for the Progression screen.\n\nNo new table: weight comes from the latest weight_logs row (falling back\nto profiles.poids_actuel — the same logic the dashboard already used for\n\"Poids actuel\"), height from profiles.taille.","tree":{"sha":"64a3085aa19dd96b8c8dfd266ccc19771e12db2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/64a3085aa19dd96b8c8dfd266ccc19771e12db2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/1410e534d8fd38b2f485e2c5748b7fdd65ee6db5","verification":{"payload":"tree 64a3085aa19dd96b8c8dfd266ccc19771e12db2e\nparent 7b457d9b04be55671da1cf79a1edc877ca0ecd84\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785877735 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785877735 +0000\n\nAdd BMI calculation\n\n- constants/bmi.ts: computeBmi/getBmiCategory (insuffisance pondérale,\n  corpulence normale, surpoids, obésité), a dedicated muted color per\n  category (distinct from colors.warning/danger, which stay reserved for\n  real alerts — only \"normale\" mirrors colors.accent), and the\n  proportional segment-width/cursor-position math for a bounded [15, 40]\n  visual domain (obésité has no real upper bound, so it''s pinned to the\n  right edge past 40 rather than stretching the bar).\n- components/dashboard/BmiCard.tsx on the dashboard, right after\n  Hydratation: value, non-judgmental status line, animated cursor over a\n  4-segment classification bar, boundary labels, and a tap-to-open\n  BmiInfoModal detailing all four categories plus the \"not a substitute\n  for medical advice / doesn''t account for muscle mass\" disclaimer. Falls\n  back to a \"complete your profile\" prompt when profiles.taille is\n  missing.\n- components/progression/BmiSummaryCard.tsx: compact value/status/mini-bar\n  version for the Progression screen.\n\nNo new table: weight comes from the latest weight_logs row (falling back\nto profiles.poids_actuel — the same logic the dashboard already used for\n\"Poids actuel\"), height from profiles.taille.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDBCl2/k\nP8q/ySmdBroT4aGXoJ5QERif46luEp+QSduNZGkYhBAZfI19OWuUZClJAL0PwGUgHYXZAsTB4sqI\nWQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T21:09:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_