ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/7b457d9b04be55671da1cf79a1edc877ca0ecd84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:57:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:57:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add hydration tracking\n\n- SQL: water_logs (append-only log — positive rows for adds, negative for\n  removes, day total = SUM) with RLS, plus\n  user_settings.objectif_eau_ml (default 2000ml), documented in README.\n- hooks/useWaterLogs.ts: today''s total and a zero-filled 30-day daily\n  history from one query, plus addWater/removeWater.\n- components/dashboard/HydrationCard.tsx on the dashboard, right after the\n  Journal alimentaire: icon + \"current / goal L\", a thick progress bar, a\n  row of glasses (250ml each, count follows the goal) that tap-to-set the\n  day''s total, two quick-add pills, and a long-press on the header to edit\n  the daily goal via NumberStepperModal (now supports an optional `max`,\n  used here for the 1000–5000ml range).\n- components/progression/HydrationSummaryCard.tsx on the Progression\n  screen: 7-day average + a mini bar per day.\n\nAll new UI reads exclusively from constants/theme.ts tokens, verified in\nboth dark and light mode.","tree":{"sha":"7b48958ed4fd3d9fdb05c5b8835ce2a48e0986bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/7b48958ed4fd3d9fdb05c5b8835ce2a48e0986bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/7b457d9b04be55671da1cf79a1edc877ca0ecd84","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b48958ed4fd3d9fdb05c5b8835ce2a48e0986bc\nparent 0f0b693f4b8b8e7d906e214a92568564c0c22c84\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785877039 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785877039 +0000\n\nAdd hydration tracking\n\n- SQL: water_logs (append-only log — positive rows for adds, negative for\n  removes, day total = SUM) with RLS, plus\n  user_settings.objectif_eau_ml (default 2000ml), documented in README.\n- hooks/useWaterLogs.ts: today''s total and a zero-filled 30-day daily\n  history from one query, plus addWater/removeWater.\n- components/dashboard/HydrationCard.tsx on the dashboard, right after the\n  Journal alimentaire: icon + \"current / goal L\", a thick progress bar, a\n  row of glasses (250ml each, count follows the goal) that tap-to-set the\n  day''s total, two quick-add pills, and a long-press on the header to edit\n  the daily goal via NumberStepperModal (now supports an optional `max`,\n  used here for the 1000–5000ml range).\n- components/progression/HydrationSummaryCard.tsx on the Progression\n  screen: 7-day average + a mini bar per day.\n\nAll new UI reads exclusively from constants/theme.ts tokens, verified in\nboth dark and light mode.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOACAie/\nSXEbWd9ZFnZ3gHl6OfiaRSZo+gC6YSrse0vwG0gpYlWRLxXGRia13fJqfsedpvyeNW9GTo24kbzu\ntwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T20:57:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.