llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/0f0b693f4b8b8e7d906e214a92568564c0c22c84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:34:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:34:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Restructure meal tracking around 4 meals (petit-déjeuner/déjeuner/dîner/collation)\n\n- SQL: meals.meal_type (check constraint) + meals.portion, documented in README\n  with both the fresh-install schema and an ALTER migration for existing setups.\n- hooks/useMeals.ts: groups meals by meal_type (mealsByType/totalsByType) and\n  exposes addMeal/updateMeal/deleteMeal/moveMeal CRUD helpers.\n- Dashboard''s \"Repas d''aujourd''hui\" section replaced by \"Journal alimentaire\":\n  4 stacked MealTypeCard (collapsible, remembers expanded state), each with a\n  food list, a \"+ Ajouter un aliment\" row, and long-press → edit\n  quantity/calories, move to another meal, or delete (with confirmation).\n  MealRow.tsx removed (fully superseded).\n- New app/journal.tsx: full day view with date navigation\n  (prev/next/Aujourd''hui), a calorie-ring + macros summary, the 4 detailed\n  meal cards, and a day total footer. Linked from the dashboard via\n  \"Voir le journal\".\n- Scanner and recipe-detail \"Ajouter à mes repas\" both gained a 4-pill meal\n  picker (MealTypePills), preselected from the time of day, before saving.\n- TextField gained an optional containerStyle prop for laying macro fields\n  out side by side in the manual add-food modal.\n\nAll new UI reads exclusively from constants/theme.ts tokens (no hardcoded\ncolors), verified in both dark and light mode.","tree":{"sha":"8dcd06b0d08c886dfa23177fdfc7d01711566d85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/8dcd06b0d08c886dfa23177fdfc7d01711566d85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/0f0b693f4b8b8e7d906e214a92568564c0c22c84","verification":{"payload":"tree 8dcd06b0d08c886dfa23177fdfc7d01711566d85\nparent 92f5b236bc39608e0f1a88688b4d4c94ddb9cb27\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785875695 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785875695 +0000\n\nRestructure meal tracking around 4 meals (petit-déjeuner/déjeuner/dîner/collation)\n\n- SQL: meals.meal_type (check constraint) + meals.portion, documented in README\n  with both the fresh-install schema and an ALTER migration for existing setups.\n- hooks/useMeals.ts: groups meals by meal_type (mealsByType/totalsByType) and\n  exposes addMeal/updateMeal/deleteMeal/moveMeal CRUD helpers.\n- Dashboard''s \"Repas d''aujourd''hui\" section replaced by \"Journal alimentaire\":\n  4 stacked MealTypeCard (collapsible, remembers expanded state), each with a\n  food list, a \"+ Ajouter un aliment\" row, and long-press → edit\n  quantity/calories, move to another meal, or delete (with confirmation).\n  MealRow.tsx removed (fully superseded).\n- New app/journal.tsx: full day view with date navigation\n  (prev/next/Aujourd''hui), a calorie-ring + macros summary, the 4 detailed\n  meal cards, and a day total footer. Linked from the dashboard via\n  \"Voir le journal\".\n- Scanner and recipe-detail \"Ajouter à mes repas\" both gained a 4-pill meal\n  picker (MealTypePills), preselected from the time of day, before saving.\n- TextField gained an optional containerStyle prop for laying macro fields\n  out side by side in the manual add-food modal.\n\nAll new UI reads exclusively from constants/theme.ts tokens (no hardcoded\ncolors), verified in both dark and light mode.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHBZU2ka\npuBR4vEoqyoyuzFdTlcWpIws4+VtuKlv56MYtKocOq0cF9NDmABXvQBTHAYd1jofN4SdfzkLxbWk\nPg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T20:35:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/0f0b693f4b8b8e7d906e214a92568564c0c22c84","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDBmMGI2OTNmNGI4YjhlN2Q5MDZlMjE0YTkyNTY4NTY0YzBjMjJjODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/92f5b236bc39608e0f1a88688b4d4c94ddb9cb27","sha":"92f5b236bc39608e0f1a88688b4d4c94ddb9cb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/92f5b236bc39608e0f1a88688b4d4c94ddb9cb27"}],"sha":"0f