14dd4655d46da91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/35654fc7400f227a1713a97514dd4655d46da91c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705","sha":"3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705"}],"sha":"561318196b96d4f66d0fc468a0292ae5969cc8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/561318196b96d4f66d0fc468a0292ae5969cc8d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:40:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:40:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Ajoute la page Recettes\n\nlib/recipes.ts réutilise lib/anthropic.ts (même pattern fetch brut que\nfoodScanner/progressAnalysis) pour generateSuggestions(profile) et\nanalyzeFridge(images, profile), avec un system prompt qui injecte\nobjectif/poids/restrictions/niveau d''activité et impose des étapes de\npréparation détaillées (2-3 phrases, températures, durées, techniques).\n\napp/recipes.tsx : 3 onglets en pilules (Suggestions, Mon frigo,\nFavoris). Suggestions génère 6 recettes au montage avec mise en cache\nAsyncStorage du jour ; Mon frigo permet jusqu''à 3 photos puis liste les\ningrédients détectés et 4 recettes avec ingrédients manquants ;\nFavoris liste saved_recipes avec suppression par appui long.\n\napp/recipe/[id].tsx : détail avec métadonnées, barres de macros,\ningrédients, étapes numérotées et ajout aux repas — la recette est\npassée en JSON via les params de route pour éviter un aller-retour\nréseau superflu quand elle est déjà en mémoire.\n\nLa carte \"Recettes\" du menu + n''est plus grisée.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"8020f1939e8ed60ce994d0a1a3f3201f24336819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/8020f1939e8ed60ce994d0a1a3f3201f24336819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705","verification":{"payload":"tree 8020f1939e8ed60ce994d0a1a3f3201f24336819\nparent d54cc8ea42536522a3a02525e0c5cd3c92b6bc42\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785688813 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785688813 +0000\n\nAjoute la page Recettes\n\nlib/recipes.ts réutilise lib/anthropic.ts (même pattern fetch brut que\nfoodScanner/progressAnalysis) pour generateSuggestions(profile) et\nanalyzeFridge(images, profile), avec un system prompt qui injecte\nobjectif/poids/restrictions/niveau d''activité et impose des étapes de\npréparation détaillées (2-3 phrases, températures, durées, techniques).\n\napp/recipes.tsx : 3 onglets en pilules (Suggestions, Mon frigo,\nFavoris). Suggestions génère 6 recettes au montage avec mise en cache\nAsyncStorage du jour ; Mon frigo permet jusqu''à 3 photos puis liste les\ningrédients détectés et 4 recettes avec ingrédients manquants ;\nFavoris liste saved_recipes avec suppression par appui long.\n\napp/recipe/[id].tsx : détail avec métadonnées, barres de macros,\ningrédients, étapes numérotées et ajout aux repas — la recette est\npassée en JSON via les params de route pour éviter un aller-retour\nréseau superflu quand elle est déjà en mémoire.\n\nLa carte \"Recettes\" du menu + n''est plus grisée.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBuPW6dO\nTLY9duPtmnULLcQ2v4NVtmQDIcmL2OTbR7sxMWB9kAM5AID6s6wJuY6ipg5+W6ds5PSktwCjtJ7P\nOgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T16:40:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/3e95d34347bd967d10947a87f08831459a476705","node_id