/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/0b613ff9cc2d572035267c92efe0294afa128563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T15:36:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T15:36:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Sert les images locales depuis le bucket public Supabase (contournement Expo Go)\n\nMalgré un metro.config.js correct, les JPEG locaux ne se chargent\ntoujours pas dans Expo Go. constants/images.ts ajoute appImage(name),\nqui pointe vers le bucket public app-images où les fichiers de\nassets/images/ ont été téléversés sous les mêmes noms. Tous les\nrequire(''assets/images/*'') sont remplacés par cet appel (welcome,\nplan, questionnaire, paywall, dashboard, séance, scanner, historique\ndes repas, Logo) ; AppImage reste inchangé, ImageSourcePropType\nacceptant aussi bien un module local qu''un objet { uri }. Les icônes\nréférencées par app.json (assets/ racine) ne sont pas concernées.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"b89d5291a9df3daa426d48d8dba812458b58d191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/b89d5291a9df3daa426d48d8dba812458b58d191"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/0b613ff9cc2d572035267c92efe0294afa128563","verification":{"payload":"tree b89d5291a9df3daa426d48d8dba812458b58d191\nparent 7ac91bf603c81d9c20b098000f2ccda2ff38ad1b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785685006 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785685006 +0000\n\nSert les images locales depuis le bucket public Supabase (contournement Expo Go)\n\nMalgré un metro.config.js correct, les JPEG locaux ne se chargent\ntoujours pas dans Expo Go. constants/images.ts ajoute appImage(name),\nqui pointe vers le bucket public app-images où les fichiers de\nassets/images/ ont été téléversés sous les mêmes noms. Tous les\nrequire(''assets/images/*'') sont remplacés par cet appel (welcome,\nplan, questionnaire, paywall, dashboard, séance, scanner, historique\ndes repas, Logo) ; AppImage reste inchangé, ImageSourcePropType\nacceptant aussi bien un module local qu''un objet { uri }. Les icônes\nréférencées par app.json (assets/ racine) ne sont pas concernées.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBzMMcgK\n6m3stOgcpTGNLwrxlJybibZ3SEjdbEWpz7CEnnMJzEqyM+9P8tWGPr1ZuDqY397Xv9vTRdnpstt0\nGQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T15:36:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi