ithub.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/7ac91bf603c81d9c20b098000f2ccda2ff38ad1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T15:12:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T15:12:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Sort le bouton + de la barre d''onglets, remet Coach en onglet\n\nLa pilule ne contient plus que 4 onglets (Accueil, Coach, Scanner,\nProfil) ; Progression, Séances et Repas passent en href: null et\nrejoignent la feuille du bouton +. Le bouton + n''est plus intégré ni\nprotubérant : c''est un cercle séparé à droite de la pilule (12px\nd''écart), de diamètre égal à la hauteur de la barre, aligné pile sur\nson sommet et sa ligne de base, avec la même ombre portée. La feuille\nde navigation échange Coach IA (devenu un onglet) contre Progression.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"a1bc19a9c6a460b7b7ba8e830b0e03c0d742a790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/a1bc19a9c6a460b7b7ba8e830b0e03c0d742a790"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/7ac91bf603c81d9c20b098000f2ccda2ff38ad1b","verification":{"payload":"tree a1bc19a9c6a460b7b7ba8e830b0e03c0d742a790\nparent 3bc2c68c05973c84c3d437ecaf29d6197c1d396e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785683545 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785683545 +0000\n\nSort le bouton + de la barre d''onglets, remet Coach en o