{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/ca225b82b9b406954ae58a643c1c0a982a1bcb9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:20:41Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:20:41Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix silent Storage upload failures by uploading ArrayBuffers, not Blobs\n\nSupabase Storage doesn''t reliably handle File/Blob/local-URI bodies on\nReact Native — uploads could report success while leaving the object\nmissing or empty in the bucket, which is why newly added progress\nphotos rendered as a black frame with no visible error.\n\n- Add lib/storageUpload.ts (uploadBase64Image): the one path every\n  image upload in the app must use from now on. Decodes a base64\n  string to an ArrayBuffer (base64-arraybuffer''s decode()) and uploads\n  that instead of a Blob, logs the upload result unconditionally\n  (console.log with the path on success, console.error with the full\n  error otherwise), then re-verifies the object is actually listable\n  in the bucket via storage.list() before reporting success back to\n  the caller.\n- hooks/useProgressPhotos.ts and hooks/useAvatar.ts both now request\n  base64 output from expo-image-manipulator''s saveAsync() and route\n  the upload through uploadBase64Image. Neither hook writes its\n  database row (progress_photos insert/update, profiles.avatar_path)\n  until the file is confirmed present — a \"successful\" upload that\n  turns out to be a ghost object no longer leaves a row pointing at\n  nothing.\n- addPhoto/uploadAvatar now return { ok, error? } instead of a bare\n  boolean, and their screens (progression.tsx, profil.tsx) show the\n  specific French error message in the failure alert instead of a\n  generic one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"4a0bef9a8f55844f5a1b5be9816d61c9a4cb461b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/4a0bef9a8f55844f5a1b5be9816d61c9a4cb461b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/ca225b82b9b406954ae58a643c1c0a982a1bcb9d","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a0bef9a8f55844f5a1b5be9816d61c9a4cb461b\nparent f60106b44ccf044c3b2b13d23b58cb4651e2f4a4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785604841 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785604841 +0000\n\nFix silent Storage upload failures by uploading ArrayBuffers, not Blobs\n\nSupabase Storage doesn''t reliably handle File/Blob/local-URI bodies on\nReact Native — uploads could report success while leaving the object\nmissing or empty in the bucket, which is why newly added progress\nphotos rendered as a black frame with no visible error.\n\n- Add lib/storageUpload.ts (uploadBase64Image): the one path every\n  image upload in the app must use from now on. Decodes a base64\n  string to an ArrayBuffer (base64-arraybuffer''s decode()) and uploads\n  that instead of a Blob, logs the upload result unconditionally\n  (console.log with the path on success, console.error with the full\n  error otherwise), then re-verifies the object is actually listable\n  in the bucket via storage.list() before reporting success back to\n  the caller.\n- hooks/useProgressPhotos.ts and hooks/useAvatar.ts both now request\n  base64 output from expo-image-manipulator''s saveAsync() and route\n  the upload through uploadBase64Image. Neither hook writes its\n  database row (progress_photos insert/update, profiles.avatar_path)\n  until the file is confirmed present — a \"successful\" upload that\n  turns out to be a ghost object no longer leaves a row pointing at\n  nothing.\n- addPhoto/uploadAvatar now return { ok, error? } instead of a bare\n  boolean, and their screens (progression.tsx, profil.tsx) show the\n  specific French error message in the failure alert instead of a\n  generic one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOmnALmZ\n9cpBguTFYKWXpCZLKBFKvVf2zkeFs6Pq+9hMY4SxDV/izhzdoUm45kZbBmiPGFLulyUxzz84d130\npQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T17:20:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{