3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/f60106b44ccf044c3b2b13d23b58cb4651e2f4a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:01:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:01:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add tab bar labels, profile photo upload, and a workout tab\n\n- Show a 10px label under each tab icon (\"Accueil\", \"Coach\", \"Séance\",\n  \"Scanner\", \"Progression\", \"Profil\"); active tab colors the icon and\n  label accent green instead of filling the icon in a circle, and the\n  floating bar grows a few px to fit the extra line.\n- Make the profile avatar tappable: pick a photo via expo-image-picker,\n  compress it (512px, quality 0.7) and upload to the new private\n  `avatars` bucket under `{user_id}/avatar.jpg`, saving the path on the\n  new `profiles.avatar_path` column. Displays via a signed URL with a\n  camera badge on the circle; long-press offers to remove it. Upload,\n  delete, and image-load failures are all logged with console.error,\n  and account deletion now also clears the stored avatar object.\n- Add a \"Séance\" tab (between Coach and Scanner) showing the day''s\n  recommended session — derived from the profile''s goal (muscle-group\n  focus), training location (excludes gym-only sessions for \"Maison\"),\n  and weekly frequency (how often the pick rotates) — its exercise\n  list, a \"Commencer\" CTA that reuses the workout/session/[id] flow,\n  and a read-only view of this week''s completed sessions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"d72c95d58419331eb81c125da48b0f6f45634fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/d72c95d58419331eb81c125da48b0f6f45634fb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/f60106b44ccf044c3b2b13d23b58cb4651e2f4a4","verification":{"payload":"tree d72c95d58419331eb81c125da48b0f6f45634fb7\nparent f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785603714 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785603714 +0000\n\nAdd tab bar labels, profile photo upload, and a workout tab\n\n- Show a 10px label under each tab icon (\"Accueil\", \"Coach\", \"Séance\",\n  \"Scanner\", \"Progression\", \"Profil\"); active tab colors the icon and\n  label accent green instead of filling the icon in a circle, and the\n  floating bar grows a few px to fit the extra line.\n- Make the profile avatar tappable: pick a photo via expo-image-picker,\n  compress it (512px, quality 0.7) and upload to the new private\n  `avatars` bucket under `{user_id}/avatar.jpg`, saving the path on the\n  new `profiles.avatar_path` column. Displays via a signed URL with a\n  camera badge on the circle; long-press offers to remove it. Upload,\n  delete, and image-load failures are all logged with console.error,\n  and account deletion now also clears the stored avatar object.\n- Add a \"Séance\" tab (between Coach and Scanner) showing the day''s\n  recommended session — derived from the profile''s goal (muscle-group\n  focus), training location (excludes gym-only sessions for \"Maison\"),\n  and weekly frequency (how often the pick rotates) — its exercise\n  list, a \"Commencer\" CTA that reuses the workout/session/[id] flow,\n  and a read-only view of this week''s completed sessions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Sessi