2Q1MTZhN2E0ZTdhOWYyZTE1NzcxZjBkNjUxNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/0ea339c3f92b6e43104e9ffa5c478053b751c401","sha":"0ea339c3f92b6e43104e9ffa5c478053b751c401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/0ea339c3f92b6e43104e9ffa5c478053b751c401"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427","sha":"f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427"}],"sha":"ef1ee56bc13cd516a7a4e7a9f2e15771f0d65145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/ef1ee56bc13cd516a7a4e7a9f2e15771f0d65145"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:42:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:42:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix five dashboard/progression/workout bugs\n\n- Show the \"GLOWUP AI\" wordmark at the top of the dashboard, above the\n  greeting header.\n- Log signed-URL and upload errors in useProgressPhotos (previously\n  swallowed), add onError logging to every progress photo <Image>, and\n  raise the signed URL TTL from 1h to 24h so a backgrounded screen\n  doesn''t show a black frame after it expires.\n- Derive the dashboard''s \"Poids actuel\"/\"Écart restant\" stats from the\n  latest weight_logs entry (falling back to profiles.poids_actuel),\n  matching the logic already used in progression.tsx, instead of the\n  stale profile field. Refresh weight logs and meals via useFocusEffect\n  so returning to the dashboard tab always shows current data.\n- Add a refetch to useMeals so the scanned-meals list can be reloaded\n  on focus instead of only on user/date change.\n- Implement the live workout session flow (workout/session/[id].tsx):\n  per-exercise set counter, rest timer with +/-15s adjustment, overall\n  progress bar, previous/next navigation between exercises, and a\n  \"Terminer\" action that marks the day''s workout mission complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"2e7a4193b414fd3a5350fb35bd0bb5932a64d894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/2e7a4193b414fd3a5350fb35bd0bb5932a64d894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/f376f04bd943420e21794be6f9c87baaaaf5e427","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e7a4193b414fd3a5350fb35bd0bb5932a64d894\nparent 3fb902565dfc0054ee161b196897c81005c3e6a3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785602562 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785602562 +0000\n\nFix five dashboard/progression/workout bugs\n\n- Show the \"GLOWUP AI\" wordmark at the top of the dashboard, above the\n  greeting header.\n- Log signed-URL and upload errors in useProgressPhotos (previously\n  swallowed), add onError logging to every progress photo <Image>, and\n  raise the signed URL TTL from 1h to 24h so a backgrounded screen\n  doesn''t show a black frame after it expires.\n- Derive the dashboard''s \"Poids actuel\"/\"Écart restant\" stats from the\n  latest weight_logs entry (falling back to profiles.poids_actuel),\n  matching the logic already used in progression.tsx, instead of the\n  stale profile field. Refresh weight logs and meals via useFocusEffect\n  so returning to the dashboard tab always shows current data.\n- Add a refetch to useMeals so the scanned-meals list can be reloaded\n  on focus instead of only on user/date change.\n- Implement the live workout session flow (workout/session/[id].tsx):\n  per-exercise set counter, rest timer with +/-15s adjustment, overall\n  progress bar, previous/next navigation between exercises, and a\n  \"Terminer\" action that marks the day''s workout mission complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOaiw+8Y\ndg7E0I5li7QJJGkDDfCCO/9fZlrpNm4e8v3BWb95VkHiwxVuqRHtnXTOqo1bNOSI89d8ywEicaW4\nxAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T16:42:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl