ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/3fb902565dfc0054ee161b196897c81005c3e6a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:11:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:11:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Merge settings into the profil tab, complete subscription management\n\napp/settings.tsx is gone — every section it had (referral card, goals,\naccount, notifications, preferences, about, danger zone) now lives\ndirectly in (tabs)/profil.tsx, reached without a separate screen or gear\nicon. Removed the settings Stack.Screen from app/_layout.tsx and confirmed\nno remaining links to /settings.\n\n- New header (components/profil/ProfileHeader.tsx): avatar initial,\n  email, Premium/Gratuit badge, and three stats (program day, kg lost\n  since the onboarding weight, mission streak) read from the profile,\n  weight_logs, and daily_missions.\n- New \"Mon abonnement\" section (components/profil/SubscriptionCard.tsx),\n  right after the header: plan + renewal date + links to the native\n  store subscription settings when subscribed (values are placeholders\n  — // TODO: read them from RevenueCat), or a Premium upsell card linking\n  to the paywall when not.\n- New \"Mes données\" section: exports every one of the user''s rows as JSON\n  via Share.share(), and a double-confirmed \"Réinitialiser ma progression\"\n  that clears weight_logs/daily_missions/meals/progress_photos (and their\n  Storage files) while keeping the account itself.\n- useWeightLogs and useMissionStreak now expose refetch() so the header''s\n  stats update immediately after a progress reset instead of going stale\n  until the next mount.\n\nAll components/settings/* and their hooks are unchanged and reused as-is.","tree":{"sha":"6122d14ddd0bd5f2e1dc9bd9a1541ff5e972cff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/6122d14ddd0bd5f2e1dc9bd9a1541ff5e972cff8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/3fb902565dfc0054ee161b196897c81005c3e6a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6122d14ddd0bd5f2e1dc9bd9a1541ff5e972cff8\nparent 597c7cdf51da87a4544634d527d8e84799933d9b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785586265 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785586265 +0000\n\nMerge settings into the profil tab, complete subscription management\n\napp/settings.tsx is gone — every section it had (referral card, goals,\naccount, notifications, preferences, about, danger zone) now lives\ndirectly in (tabs)/profil.tsx, reached without a separate screen or gear\nicon. Removed the settings Stack.Screen from app/_layout.tsx and confirmed\nno remaining links to /settings.\n\n- New header (components/profil/ProfileHeader.tsx): avatar initial,\n  email, Premium/Gratuit badge, and three stats (program day, kg lost\n  since the onboarding weight, mission streak) read from the profile,\n  weight_logs, and daily_missions.\n- New \"Mon abonnement\" section (components/profil/SubscriptionCard.tsx),\n  right after the header: plan + renewal date + links to the native\n  store subscription settings when subscribed (values are placeholders\n  — // TODO: read them from RevenueCat), or a Premium upsell card linking\n  to the paywall when not.\n- New \"Mes données\" section: exports every one of the 