g","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/97127ea595fa9fb3ccebcb30d8adfc8f6b910644","sha":"97127ea595fa9fb3ccebcb30d8adfc8f6b910644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/97127ea595fa9fb3ccebcb30d8adfc8f6b910644"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/e622145bd834773360a1cc567b58c63330ca129c","sha":"e622145bd834773360a1cc567b58c63330ca129c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e622145bd834773360a1cc567b58c63330ca129c"}],"sha":"476a8ccdc0dcb57d0fd60c1ceaff8d2e0d6afbf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/476a8ccdc0dcb57d0fd60c1ceaff8d2e0d6afbf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/e622145bd834773360a1cc567b58c63330ca129c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T08:46:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T08:46:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Build the settings screen: referrals, account, notifications prefs, danger zone\n\napp/settings.tsx is a root screen (declared in app/_layout.tsx, reached from\na gear icon on profil.tsx) with seven sections: referral card, goals,\naccount, notifications, preferences, about, and a danger zone.\n\n- ProfileProvider moved from (tabs)/_layout.tsx up to app/_layout.tsx so\n  useProfile() works on this sibling screen too.\n- components/ui/NumberStepperModal.tsx is the progression screen''s\n  keyboard-free weight stepper, extracted into a shared, parameterized\n  component; WeightEntryModal is now a thin wrapper around it with an\n  unchanged external API.\n- hooks/useSettings.ts (user_settings, optimistic writes, default row on\n  first read) and hooks/useReferral.ts (referral count + code redemption)\n  follow the same shape as useWeightLogs/useDailyMissions.\n- lib/referral.ts generates an 8-char referral code from the email at\n  signup, checking uniqueness before writing it.\n- deleteAccount() (AuthContext) wipes the user''s rows across every table\n  plus their progress-photos Storage objects, then signs out — deleting\n  the actual Supabase Auth user needs a service_role key this client\n  doesn''t have, same caveat as the profiles-only delete it replaces.\n\nSQL for user_settings, referrals, and the profiles.code_parrainage /\nparraine_par columns is in the README''s \"Écran Paramètres\" section.","tree":{"sha":"37b91b4ca68395484d8e65be0e3d090d3f62a292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/37b91b4ca68395484d8e65be0e3d090d3f62a292"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/e622145bd834773360a1cc567b58c63330ca129c","verification":{"payload":"tree 37b91b4ca68395484d8e65be0e3d090d3f62a292\nparent 8c3d67e0fc7367b0e0bea9fad68b5e9d6f4da591\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785573986 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785573986 +0000\n\nBuild the settings screen: referrals, account, notifications prefs, danger zone\n\napp/settings.tsx is a root screen (declared in app/_layout.tsx, reached from\na gear icon on profil.tsx) with seven sections: referral card, goals,\naccount, notifications, preferences, about, and a danger zone.\n\n- ProfileProvider moved from (tabs)/_layout.tsx up to app/_layout.tsx so\n  useProfile() works on this sibling screen too.\n- components/ui/NumberStepperModal.tsx is the progression screen''s\n  keyboard-free weight stepper, extracted into a shared, parameterized\n  component; WeightEntryModal is now a thin wrapper around it with an\n  unchanged external API.\n- hooks/useSettings.ts (user_settings, optimistic writes, default row on\n  first read) and hooks/useReferral.ts (referral count + code redemption)\n  follow the same shape as useWeightLogs/useDailyMissions.\n- lib/referral.ts generates an 8-char referral code from the email at\n  signup, checking uniqueness before writing it.\n- deleteAccount() (AuthContext) wipes the user''s rows across every table\n  plus their progress-photos Storage objects, then signs out — deleting\n  the actual Supabase Auth user needs a service_role key this client\n  doesn''t have, same caveat as the profiles-only delete it replaces.\n\nSQL for user_settings, referrals, and the profiles.code_parrainage /\nparraine_par columns is in the README''s \"Écran Paramètres\" section.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO0M0DvZ\nmrLCT5OuiXaRViugrBiYieyCrt7Pqo/g4IWNz7OFWNJJ7nwCjHlwEQ1EUM4Qp5Keklya2BVp4/jn\nAQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T08:46:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{