vatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/8c3d67e0fc7367b0e0bea9fad68b5e9d6f4da591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:57:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:57:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix progression screen: keyboard-free weight entry, trend arrows, streak legend, real photos\n\n- WeightEntryModal is now a pure stepper (±0.1 tap, hold-to-repeat,\n  ±0.5/±1 quick pills) — the old TextInput never surfaced a working\n  keyboard on this build, so it''s gone entirely.\n- WeightCard shows two comparison lines (since last weigh-in, since\n  start) with a direction arrow whose color flips based on the user''s\n  goal (loss vs muscle gain). Added colors.warning since the card''s lime\n  background makes a literal green arrow invisible.\n- StreakGrid gets an explainer line, a full/partial/none legend, an\n  \"X / 30 jours actifs\" counter, and a long-press tooltip with the\n  per-day mission count (useMissionStreak now also exposes countsByDate).\n- Progress photos are fully implemented: hooks/useProgressPhotos.ts\n  compresses (expo-image-manipulator) and uploads to a private\n  `progress-photos` Storage bucket keyed by {user_id}/{date}.jpg,\n  upserts `progress_photos`, and signs URLs for display since the bucket\n  is private. PhotosCard renders a single photo, or a before/after\n  comparator with a tappable thumbnail strip and long-press delete once\n  there are two or more.\n\nSQL for `progress_photos` + the storage bucket policies is in the\nREADME''s \"Écran Progression\" section.","tree":{"sha":"1daf888459e006870eca28f8f35444c29a396898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/1daf888459e006870eca28f8f35444c29a396898"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/8c3d67e0fc7367b0e0bea9fad68b5e9d6f4da591","verification":{"payload":"tree 1daf888459e006870eca28f8f35444c29a396898\nparent 5dec75d55a4686742de9ff2661f0872ba30014a8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785571039 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785571039 +0000\n\nFix progression screen: keyboard-free weight entry, trend arrows, streak legend, real photos\n\n- WeightEntryModal is now a pure stepper (±0.1 tap, hold-to-repeat,\n  ±0.5/±1 quick pills) — the old TextInput never surfaced a working\n  keyboard on this build, so it''s gone entirely.\n- WeightCard shows two comparison lines (since last weigh-in, since\n  start) with a direction arrow whose color flips based on the user''s\n  goal (loss vs muscle gain). Added colors.warning since the card''s lime\n  background makes a literal green arrow invisible.\n- StreakGrid gets an explainer line, a full/partial/none legend, an\n  \"X / 30 jours actifs\" counter, and a long-press tooltip with the\n  per-day mission count (useMissionStreak now also exposes countsByDate).\n- Progress photos are fully implemented: hooks/useProgressPhotos.ts\n  compresses (expo-image-manipulator) and uploads to a private\n  `progress-photos` Storage bucket keyed by {user_id}/{date}.jpg,\n  upserts `progress_photos`, and signs URLs for display since the bucket\n  is private. PhotosCard renders a single photo, or a before/after\n  comparator with a tappable thumbnail strip and long-press delete once\n  there are two or more.\n\nSQL for `progress_photos` + the storage bucket policies is in the\nREADME''s \"Écran Progression\" section.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ7xNrLr\nHPx5X2C8s6VBokRKFdhNVe4EDab6dEiq5eHpwS9Fnx2+k8y4Fzy9fgjzXeO6XyTUiPnftAQS0wHX\ntgg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T07:57:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/8c3d67e0fc7367b0e0bea9fad68b5e9d6f4da591","node_id":"C_kwDOToj_ZdoAKDhjM2Q2N2UwZmM3MzY3YjBlMGJlYTlmYWQ2OGI1ZTlkNmY0ZGE1OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ASKO647/glop-ai/commit/5dec75d55a4686742de9ff2661f0872ba30014a8","sha":"5dec75d55a4686742de9ff2661f0872ba30014a8","u