ithub.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/5dec75d55a4686742de9ff2661f0872ba30014a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:23:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:23:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Build the progression screen: weight tracking, evolution chart, streaks\n\nhooks/useWeightLogs.ts (modeled on useDailyMissions) reads weight_logs\nhistory and overwrites today''s entry on save. hooks/useMissionStreak.ts is\na read-only 30-day view of daily_missions for the streak grid, kept\nseparate from useDailyMissions since this screen must never create\nmission rows as a side effect of being viewed.\n\napp/(tabs)/progression.tsx stacks the current-weight card (+ bottom-sheet\nentry modal), a hand-drawn react-native-svg evolution chart with a\n7j/30j/90j period switch and a dashed goal line, a 4-tile stats grid, a\n30-day regularity grid, and a not-yet-implemented photos placeholder.","tree":{"sha":"9fa2403c9702e6aeb53798451c8382d2029663b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/9fa2403c9702e6aeb53798451c8382d2029663b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/5dec75d55a4686742de9ff2661f0872ba30014a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fa2403c9702e6aeb53798451c8382d2029663b9\nparent 8ee3b3420581bf29a3aa6d0878b1bd5d1e15bb8d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785569019 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785569019 +0000\n\nBuild the progression screen: weight tracking, evolution chart, streaks\n\nhooks/useWeightLogs.ts (modeled on useDailyMissions) reads weight_logs\nhistory and overwrites today''s entry on save. hooks/useMissionStreak.ts is\na read-only 30-day view of daily_missions for the streak grid, kept\nseparate from useDailyMissions since this screen must never create\nmission rows as a side effect of being viewed.\n\napp/(tabs)/progression.tsx stacks the current-weight card (+ bottom-shee