oreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T06:59:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Build the meal scanner: photo capture, Anthropic vision analysis, macro tracking\n\nlib/foodScanner.ts compresses photos with expo-image-manipulator (max\n1024px, JPEG q0.5) and analyzes them via raw fetch to Claude vision,\nfollowing the same no-SDK pattern as lib/coach.ts. app/(tabs)/scanner.tsx\nwires expo-image-picker (camera + gallery, with permission prompts) through\nidle/analyzing/result/error states, and saves accepted meals to the meals\ntable before redirecting to the dashboard.","tree":{"sha":"e776639605a3cefc2b941a2e088b3ef44c1c2a77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/e776639605a3cefc2b941a2e088b3ef44c1c2a77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/8ee3b3420581bf29a3aa6d0878b1bd5d1e15bb8d","verification":{"payload":"tree e776639605a3cefc2b941a2e088b3ef44c1c2a77\nparent 06d6b1a24afed911f80a3450cfa31048f929fe03\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785567553 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785567553 +0000\n\nBuild the meal scanner: photo capture, Anthropic vision analysis, macro tracking\n\nlib/foodScanner.ts compresses photos with expo-image-manipulator (max\n1024px, JPEG q0.5) and analyzes them via raw fetch to Claude vision,\nfollowing the same no-SDK pattern as lib/coach.ts. app/(tabs)/scanner.tsx\nwires expo-image-picker (camera + gallery, with permission prompts) through\nidle/analyzing/result/error states, and saves accepted meals to the meals\ntable before redirecting to the dashboard.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEUKkm2D\nmtxcPwffLPJRZQS3ttshZgh5I20LRqoY2z3gF1tvSdJZQmhms7qkZwWpk7VxT9hYsJWiXMCQD3Mb\nig8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verifie