sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/commits/ce69aa542c704c547edec35d93af6466c60f4a61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T22:13:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T22:13:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Zero-state dashboard data + interactive week strip for past days\n\nAudited the calorie/macro/meals data path for hardcoded demo values —\nfound none; useTodayMeals already read live from Supabase and defaulted\nto 0 when meals was empty. Renamed it to useMeals(userId, date) as part\nof making the week strip interactive, which is where an actual gap was:\nthe hook only ever queried \"today,\" so there was no way to view a past\nday''s real (possibly empty) totals.\n\n- useMeals and useDailyMissions now take a `date` param. Mission history\n  (used for the week strip''s completed/missed dots and the streak) stays\n  anchored to the real today regardless of which date is being viewed.\n  Missions are only auto-created for today — a past day that was never\n  opened shows \"Aucune mission enregistrée ce jour-là\" instead of\n  retroactively inserting rows.\n- WeekStrip is now tappable: today or any past day selects that date\n  (dashboard reloads missions/meals/calories/macros for it); future days\n  are disabled with reduced opacity. Selected day gets the accent-filled\n  circle; today gets a thin accent ring when it isn''t the active\n  selection.\n- New PastDateBanner (\"Tu consultes le [date]\" + \"Revenir à\n  aujourd''hui\") shows whenever the viewed date isn''t today.\n- MissionCard gained a `disabled` prop so past-day cards render\n  read-only without being visually mistaken for \"completed\";\n  incrementMission also refuses to mutate a non-today date as a\n  server-side-logic guard.\n\nVerified via browser: today''s real data, a populated past day, an\nunopened past day (0 kcal, 0g/Xg macros, empty-meals state, \"Aucune\nmission...\"), future-day taps doing nothing, and the reset link — all\nbehave correctly with no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li","tree":{"sha":"b68cd03cce459b7987c6396a685c0f644f494cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/trees/b68cd03cce459b7987c6396a685c0f644f494cba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ASKO647/glop-ai/git/commits/ce69aa542c704c547edec35d93af6466c60f4a61","verification":{"payload":"tree b68cd03cce459b7987c6396a685c0f644f494cba\nparent e4009fea36c14e48408e1fcb40e35ad34e2563f3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785535997 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785535997 +0000\n\nZero-state dashboard data + interactive week strip for past days\n\nAudited the calorie/macro/meals data path for hardcoded demo values —\nfound none; useTodayMeals already read live from Supabase and defaulted\nto 0 when meals was empty. Renamed it to useMeals(userId, date) as part\nof making the week strip interactive, which is where an actual gap was:\nthe hook only ever queried \"today,\" so there was no way to view a past\nday''s real (possibly empty) totals.\n\n- useMeals and useDailyMissions now take a `date` param. Mission history\n  (used for the week strip''s completed/missed dots and the streak) stays\n  anchored to the real today regardless of which date is being viewed.\n  Missions are only auto-created for today — a past day that was never\n  opened shows \"Aucune mission enregistrée ce jour-là\" instead of\n  retroactively inserting rows.\n- WeekStrip is now tappable: today or any past day selects that date\n  (dashboard reloads missions/meals/calories/macros for it); future days\n  are disabled with reduced opacity. Selected day gets the accent-filled\n  circle; today gets a thin accent ring when it isn''t the active\n  selection.\n- New PastDateBanner (\"Tu consultes le [date]\" + \"Revenir à\n  aujourd''hui\") shows whenever the viewed date isn''t today.\n- MissionCard gained a `disabled` prop so past-day cards render\n  read-only without being visually mistaken for \"completed\";\n  incrementMission also refuses to mutate a non-today date as a\n  server-side-logic guard.\n\nVerified via browser: today''s real data, a populated past day, an\nunopened past day (0 kcal, 0g/Xg macros, empty-meals state, \"Aucune\nmission...\"), future-day taps doing nothing, and the reset link — all\nbehave correctly with no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LvCRYw2iKcBLvspwPHJ5Li\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPJgPoVg\nge7v+obxxlPgp9v935qFP1/sXX8LzIt5L9M7dnHhEnR5nB6tgaZL3mj1o8W4pR4NCo71j9YSSJSi\nAA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T22:13:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https