e-online/micro-deploy/commit/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df","sha":"9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df"}],"sha":"c5c0f83a452f31874eba594ea07f35e6b57fd042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/c5c0f83a452f31874eba594ea07f35e6b57fd042"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T22:11:33Z","email":"savvanisspiros@gmail.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T22:11:33Z","email":"savvanisspiros@gmail.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"The pool''s subscription named 4146, and nothing listens there\n\n`pool/src/env.ts` defaults `PORT` to 4146 and the README says 4146, so a row\nwritten from the code says 4146. The estate sets `PORT=4000` and the Service\npublishes 4000->4000, measured on the cluster just now:\n\n  pool  p4000 4000->4000 · p3334 3334->3334 · p3333 3333->3333\n\nSo the row as merged would have produced a subscription that looks configured\nand delivers into a closed port — the same failure micro-org#543 spent a day on,\nreached by a different route. Caught before the deploy rather than after,\nbecause the port was checked against the Service rather than against the\nservice''s own default.\n\nThe header now says to name the SERVICE''s port and not the process''s default,\nand names pool as the one row where the two differ, so the next person writing a\nrow from a repo does not repeat it.\n`check-erasure-subscriptions-live.py` POSTs every URL in this file from inside\nthe cluster and is what would otherwise have found it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"d46850573aa937691593d89bc758c174ad2d3c99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/d46850573aa937691593d89bc758c174ad2d3c99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKDliZWE2ZWRiOGY5ODM2ZDA5M2I0ZDlhMGQ4NTYzMjMzZmUyYWYyZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/991d074ee92e25e33d5f65739d76d58960012e3c","sha":"991d074ee92e25e33d5f65739d76d58960012e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/991d074ee92e25e33d5f65739d76d58960012e3c"}],"sha":"9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/9bea6edb8f9836d093b4d9a0d8563233fe2af2df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/savvaniss","id":4446752,"login":"savvaniss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY3NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":