thub.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/289810a33e88cf0659e58433629ea6e78aebeed6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/de5e922299052d28853a7b18c6dd86af3047d9eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:10:26Z","email":"savvanisspiros@gmail.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:10:26Z","email":"savvanisspiros@gmail.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"register studio for erasure\n\nIts handler is micro-agora#17. The URL is the SQUARE''S path, not one of studio''s\nown — studio has no `POST /v1/events` and the merged process fans out from\nagora''s, on the condition `MOUNTED_EVENT_PATHS` states: one estate-wide\n`OUTBOX_SIGNING_SECRET`, several modules subscribing to the same topic.\n\n`action` is `delete` with nothing retained. The row that looks financial —\n`credit_accounts` — is a spending CAP, not a balance: nobody is owed the unspent\nremainder and no ledger entry references it.\n\nSix services failing `check-erasure-register.py` become five.\n\nmicro-org#534.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"194b10a9705724720bdec84a51ad44d1d7384683","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/194b10a9705724720bdec84a51ad44d1d7384683"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/de5e922299052d28853a7b18c6dd86af3047d9eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/de5e922299052d28853a7b18c6dd86af3047d9eb","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGRlNWU5MjIyOTkwNTJkMjg4NTNhN2IxOGM2ZGQ4NmFmMzA0N2Q5ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/5fa0e5825198b38a17b828568ccdb650312f9919","sha":"5f