,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/cfc05467810564905d4afcae5ce734dfc646ecac","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGNmYzA1NDY3ODEwNTY0OTA1ZDRhZmNhZTVjZTczNGRmYzY0NmVjYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50","sha":"8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c","sha":"abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c"}],"sha":"cfc05467810564905d4afcae5ce734dfc646ecac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/cfc05467810564905d4afcae5ce734dfc646ecac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T22:33:33Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T22:33:33Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"alerts: watch backup_destination_free_bytes, which nothing has ever read\n\nThe gauge has been exported by the runner since it was written, beside\n`backup_destination_fs_errors`, and no rule in this file has ever looked at it.\nThat is the third metric this week found published, correct and unwatched —\nafter the conformance timestamp and the miner-key artefact — and the cheapest of\nthe three to close.\n\nIT MATTERS MORE NOW THAN IT DID. The destination is `/` on the k3s VM, and `/`\nis also where rancher.io/local-path puts every PersistentVolume. Measured\n2026-09-02: 24 GB of PVCs and 30 GB of backup sets on one 194 GB filesystem,\n59.7 GiB free. The disk filling does not merely stop the next backup — it stops\nPostgres writing, which is the estate.\n\nTwo rules, because \"how much is left\" and \"how long\" are different questions.\n\nThe floor is 20 GiB and not a percentage: a percentage of a disk somebody may\nresize silently changes meaning, and this is arithmetic anybody can check — 43\nsets occupy 30 GB, so a set is roughly 0.7 GB and 20 GiB is about twenty-eight\nmore, four weeks at one a night.\n\nThe second is predict_linear over 6h projecting 48h. A runaway consumer can\ncross 194 GB in a day and would trip the floor with hours to spare rather than\nweeks; six hours of history so one nightly set does not look like a trend, and\ntwo days of runway because that is the shortest window in which somebody can act.\n\nNo absent() companion on either, for the reason the fs-errors rule gives: the\ngauge is absent only when the runner is, and BackupNeverRun already says so.\n\npromtool check rules: SUCCESS, 40 rules. Against the live series: the floor does\nnot fire (59.7 GiB free, correct) and predict_linear projects 56.5 GiB at 48h.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"6861ed947843090fdb0acfc3eb171dc2eeb655a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/6861ed947843090fdb0acfc3eb171dc2eeb655a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGFiYmY0MWExOWViZmEzYzgwMTc4YjI5MTE0MGY3N2M3OTQwZTE1MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50","sha":"8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/8feb97c8363be76d5c530e6bc380756859600e50"}],"sha":"abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/abbf41a19ebfa3c80178b291140f77c7940e151c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/savvaniss","id":4446752,"login":"savvaniss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY3NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/starre