3d8b8241fbe7d58a4f9d724f6b6467ddd63425c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/c3d8b8241fbe7d58a4f9d724f6b6467ddd63425c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/0a0e746fa7f5b339b58dcbd8c9def23eb3b458b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:27:37Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:27:37Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"conformance runner: fsGroup, or the pod cannot read the secret it is given\n\nA Secret volume''s files are owned root:root; the image runs as uid 1000; mode\n0400 therefore gave the process a directory it could LIST and files it could not\nopen. The harness reported exactly what it should have —\n\n  base ''micro'' records a live estate, and its secret file could not be read:\n      /estate/secrets\n\n— which reads as a MISSING secret rather than a permissions one, and would have\nsent the next reader to estate-bootstrap.sh. Measured on job\nconformance-runner-manual-285238, 2026-09-01, not reasoned about.\n\nkubelet chowns the volume to , so 0440 is readable by this process and\nby nothing else that might later share the pod. Not 0444, which any uid could\nread.\n\nAlso logs the image reference on every replay, substituted with the digest by\nthe apply script, so a Job''s own output names what produced it — the log line\nsaid ''image unrecorded'' on the run above.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"6208fff0196eaa6fce5a0e44ae5a49386c6f7bdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/6208fff0196eaa6fce5a0e44ae5a49386c6f7bdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/0a0e746fa7f5b339b58dcbd8c9def23eb3b458b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/0a0e746fa7f5b339b58dcbd8c9def23eb3b458b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKDBhMGU3NDZmYTdmNWIzMzliNThkY2JkOGM5ZGVmMjNlYjNiNDU4YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/24bd2289c07518cba6b8e00ef63286299b21b605","sha":"24bd2289c07518cba6b8e00ef63286299b21b605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/24bd2289c07518cba6b8e00ef63286299b21b605"}],"sha":"0a0e746fa7f5b339b58dcbd8c9def23eb3b458b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/0a0e746fa7f5b339b58dcbd8c9def23eb3b458b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/savvaniss","id":4446752,"login":"savvaniss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY3NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/24bd2289c07518cba6b8e00ef63286299b21b605/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:16:22Z","email":"savvaniss@yahoo.gr","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_