l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/be6563133647245c11e40f9c30f8bffe902e3ee5","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGJlNjU2MzEzMzY0NzI0NWMxMWU0MGY5YzMwZjhiZmZlOTAyZTNlZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/4a44c113787006a326e55b91530f86d94ddf30dd","sha":"4a44c113787006a326e55b91530f86d94ddf30dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/4a44c113787006a326e55b91530f86d94ddf30dd"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad","sha":"2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad"}],"sha":"be6563133647245c11e40f9c30f8bffe902e3ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/be6563133647245c11e40f9c30f8bffe902e3ee5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:53:29Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:53:29Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"derive-grants: read the live copy, and keep the grant per service\n\n`derive-grants --check` has been red since the service merge with six problems,\nand every one of them was this script reading a file twice under a path nothing\nrecognises.\n\nTwenty services now live at `agora/src/<name>/` — three of them two levels down,\n`agora/src/activity/notify` — with their checkouts still in place. This walked\nthe estate directory, so it read each of them in both places and reported the\nmodule copy as `agora/src/billing/ledger.ts`. Five of the six failures were\nentries in `grant-gaps.json` keyed `billing/src/ledger.ts` that no longer\nmatched a file.\n\nA GRANT IS PER SERVICE AND STAYS PER SERVICE. The compose block still names\n`billing`, `community` and the rest, because identity mints per service identity\nand the merge changed the process, not who is asking. So an absorbed service is\nread from the LIVE copy — the one the pod runs — and reported under its ORIGINAL\npath, which is what every gap entry and every message a person reads is keyed on.\n\n`hub-api` is `agora/src/hub` and `admin-api` is `agora/src/admin`: the repository\nname carries a suffix the module directory does not. That is tried as well as\nthe exact name, never instead of it, and the copy test still has to agree.\nWithout it those two services'' outbound scopes were attributed to `agora`\nitself — a grant widening dressed up as a derivation, and the one difference\nthis change had to close before the compose block matched.\n\nTwo rounds, and the second is not an optimisation: a single round finds\n`activity/src/notify` first and points notify at a checkout that is itself\nskipped, leaving notify read from nowhere.\n\nThe proof is that the compose block is BYTE-IDENTICAL: the derivation now\nreproduces exactly what it derived before the merge.\n\n  derive-grants: ok — compose matches the estate (20 services, 23 distinct\n  scopes, 7 declared gap(s), 7 module(s) declaring they need none)\n\nThe sixth failure was real and is fixed in micro-agora: `agora/src/mint/module.ts`\nlost the `RPC_SCOPES = NO_SCOPES_REQUIRED` declaration that stood beside the same\nJSON-RPC clients in `mint/src/index.ts:191`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"70ccd2545ff589e84dbd2a5e30276f88df30bc7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/70ccd2545ff589e84dbd2a5e30276f88df30bc7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKDJhYzEwMTk2MjVjZTk2MWNkYjZiMzUxODllZTYxMmI3YzNhOGYyYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/148fe752e04678a1466c2e76e32f5847dc3c4cce","sha":"148fe752e04678a1466c2e76e32f5847dc3c4cce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/148fe752e04678a1466c2e76e32f5847dc3c4cce"}],"sha":"2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/2ac1019625ce961cdb6b35189ee612b7c3a8f2ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/savvaniss","id":4446752,"login":"savvaniss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY3NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.