CQlaCvQnAnLBrDqc4F+PI\nd2ZnTm+8QLero3X0APgx+cAYqm6UTy1UlREXXlYFazW0g729ItjVz7xaFVxCOcth\nZGC+iir1+d8hTxSpIaPzJ+CVDISFH7/PRCYeWQbCMbnmxk51KAwEfde91K6x2IXc\nVC4dq5vRqS3asW2OJSuvFU5foomobMhVABuKhBNjFfMTR8K1K5MD4IkwEUEZd/0f\nxrXoWRTCEMoCLl9HER9p\n=wiPR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T17:12:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/d4cda77a370e2bd9232b3950b6cb6d74c10b6e84","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGQ0Y2RhNzdhMzcwZTJiZDkyMzJiMzk1MGI2Y2I2ZDc0YzEwYjZlODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468","sha":"6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e","sha":"08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e"}],"sha":"d4cda77a370e2bd9232b3950b6cb6d74c10b6e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/d4cda77a370e2bd9232b3950b6cb6d74c10b6e84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T17:09:30Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T17:09:30Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"feat(alerts): fire when a reconciliation sweep STOPS, not only when it drifts\n\nmicro-org#533. Every reconciliation series describes the last run, and\nnone of them can describe the absence of runs: a gauge holds its last\nvalue, so when the sweep stops they freeze at whatever they last said and\na week-old healthy zero is indistinguishable from a fresh one.\n\nThat is not hypothetical. Testnet reconciliation stopped on 2026-08-25\nwhen the consolidation merged the two per-network ledger deployments and\nthe surviving one kept a single-valued LEDGER_RECONCILE_NETWORK. Seven\ndays, two assets frozen, and LedgerReconciliationDrift could not fire —\na sweep that never runs publishes no drift to compare.\n\nLedgerReconciliationStale reads `time() - <last run timestamp>`, which\nmakes staleness a value rather than an absence, so not being written is\nitself the signal. Same reasoning as BackupAgeExceeded. 3600s against a\n900s job is four missed runs, so one slow pass cannot page; it stays a\nticket because the consequence already pages via AssetWithdrawalsFrozen.\n\nLedgerReconciliationDrift''s join becomes `on (asset, network)`. Both\nseries gained a network label when one process began sweeping both, and a\njoin on asset alone would match mainnet''s drift against testnet''s\nobserved flag — a many-to-many match, which Prometheus refuses, so the\nrule would stop evaluating rather than quietly mismatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qrn6FFp59sqq2bgnq6qz2E","tree":{"sha":"a7ff8739a3476f35496334672432380dbf8fa5c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/a7ff8739a3476f35496334672432380dbf8fa5c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKDA4MDcwZTZkMzI2YzE4YjQyNzkwYTlmZWI5ZGMwNjZhMDQxODE3MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468","sha":"6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/6d44d1fde6ec4c72ea21f2ffc6f0094b168e9468"}],"sha":"08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/08070e6d326c18b42790a9feb9dc066a0418172e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/savvaniss","id":4446752,"login":"savvaniss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY3NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savvaniss/repos","site_ad