66c120cdfc"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/27754861f338d0858b72080ec641247e910ce98d","sha":"27754861f338d0858b72080ec641247e910ce98d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/27754861f338d0858b72080ec641247e910ce98d"}],"sha":"68c5d124b582ef360b718621eb5558d824637718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/68c5d124b582ef360b718621eb5558d824637718"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/27754861f338d0858b72080ec641247e910ce98d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:42:56Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:42:56Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"fix(gateway): pay and vault leaked /metrics to the internet\n\ncf-deny-nimbus-metrics closed identity''s /metrics after 298 lines of its\nPrometheus output were found reachable from any browser. pay.<apex>\n(wallet) and vault.<apex> (custody) are whole-host routers with no path\ncondition and had the same hole — and custody is the estate''s\nhighest-value service: its /metrics names the signing purposes and\nrefusal gates.\n\nSame mechanism as nimbus: a priority-700 Host && Path(/metrics) router\ncarrying cf-deny-public (loopback-only), which the whole-host router at\n500 cannot outrank. Path not PathPrefix, so the export ceremony''s\n/v1/... routes are untouched.\n\nThe checker was BLIND to the vault host before this — it only scans\nshared hosts, and vault had no API term. Adding the deny made it visible,\nso vault now has a NOT_CHECKED entry recording both the refusal and the\nKNOWN GAP it does not close: the catch-all still serves /v1/sign and the\nadmin mint routes to the internet behind bearer auth alone. Narrowing\nthat is M5e step 1; this entry is the place that say