14d3b11","sha":"5ef34d056b02e7e3c1666d6cd18aa3dbe14d3b11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/5ef34d056b02e7e3c1666d6cd18aa3dbe14d3b11"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/50b0e751118c5dc401f697d0d5b7f3e4cfa56167","sha":"50b0e751118c5dc401f697d0d5b7f3e4cfa56167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/50b0e751118c5dc401f697d0d5b7f3e4cfa56167"}],"sha":"9d8b0136e46a81c4eab813251d3bc9a1bf0bee4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/9d8b0136e46a81c4eab813251d3bc9a1bf0bee4a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/50b0e751118c5dc401f697d0d5b7f3e4cfa56167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:16:38Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:16:38Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"docs: telemetry plane and migrate Jobs assessed; the one real remainder\n\nTelemetry is not a consolidation candidate: six pods, measured at 17\nmilli-cores between them, and they are six distinct upstream binaries\nrather than this estate''s own over-separation. The only way to reduce\nthe count is to delete a capability.\n\nThe 28 migrate Jobs stay 28 — they run in parallel because no migrator\ndepends on another, and one Job would serialise them.\n\nWhat does remain is real: four repositories whose code runs inside\nanother pod are still full deployables, bumped every release and\nbuilding images no pod runs, in a 52-entry manifest describing an estate\nof 31 Deployments. Tracked separately because derived ports are\npositional in deployableRepos(), so removing the rows would renumber\nevery port beneath them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"acf55802af855e0cb573e17aec15