s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/96e3e9229b68d80b3b74d9ed9afba093100e444f","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKDk2ZTNlOTIyOWI2OGQ4MGIzYjc0ZDllZDlhZmJhMDkzMTAwZTQ0NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1","sha":"56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d","sha":"e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d"}],"sha":"96e3e9229b68d80b3b74d9ed9afba093100e444f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/96e3e9229b68d80b3b74d9ed9afba093100e444f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T08:08:53Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T08:08:53Z","email":"spyridon-efstathios.savvanis.ext@daiichisankyo.com","name":"Savvanis Spyros"},"message":"fix(verify): the frontend checks, after twenty bundles became one pod\n\n36 failures on a healthy estate, down to the 2 that are real.\n\ncf_image_revision: a bundle has no Deployment any more, so the image\n  label lookup returned empty, web_release_for fell through to the\n  literal `estate`, and every surface was accused of serving a STALE\n  ARTEFACT while serving exactly the right one. Now reads the\n  `copy-<bundle>` initContainer in the `web` pod — still that bundle''s\n  own digest-pinned image, still its own revision label, so the\n  stale-artefact check loses nothing.\n\nweb_surface: a bundle with no Service of its own resolved to the empty\n  string, making `base` the literal `http://` and every probe a curl\n  connect failure — GET / returned 000, fourteen times. Now resolves\n  through `web`, and sends the Host header the dispatcher keys the five\n  own-hostname bundles on.\n\nWEB_APEX/WEB_SUFFIX/SITE_HOST hoisted above their first caller. Under\n  `set -u` an unbound reference does not degrade, it ENDS THE SCRIPT\n  mid-run with everything after it unreported — which reads at a glance\n  like the checks passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a5503cb10b46672e853a75ece5ef99e1dbd1822","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/trees/9a5503cb10b46672e853a75ece5ef99e1dbd1822"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/git/commits/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d","node_id":"C_kwDOTokGJNoAKGU1MmU0OTFiOTVlYWFjODNmMDQxMTZhNGU0OGFmZjliNjRiYTIwOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commit/56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1","sha":"56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/56b7e73154c393baa7669acfc73431e601bbcca1"}],"sha":"e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudsforge-online/micro-deploy/commits/e52e491b95eaac83f04116a4e48aff9b64ba208d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4446752?v=4"