},"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T06:41:25Z","committedDate":"2026-07-31T06:41:25Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"warden857@zohomail.com","name":"bruce75"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:59:36.167Z","repositoryId":1317952952,"sha":"298f73d6cc7d9690f5aa702632115e9825e85b56"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"warden857@zohomail.com","name":"bruce75"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T05:05:46Z","committedDate":"2026-07-31T05:05:46Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"warden857@zohomail.com","name":"bruce75"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:59:36.167Z","repositoryId":1317952952,"sha":"399405309a44cf3fd6533d458a63b38c5f313bde"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:59:36.167Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wangding75/opendray-oneshot/commits/f40c35bba3cf411cb67a7121a184a2028ae32e4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:52:10Z","email":"warden857@zohomail.com","name":"bruce75"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:52:10Z","email":"warden857@zohomail.com","name":"bruce75"},"message":"fix(oneshot): finalize execution policy snapshots\n\n- Expand PermissionMode to support all Claude CLI values (acceptEdits, plan, bypassPermissions)\n- Add PolicyDefaultsProvider interface for adapters to supply default execution policy\n- Implement DefaultPolicy() on ClaudeAdapter, CodexAdapter, ShellAdapter\n- Add PolicyResolver to DispatchService — resolve policy defaults at creation time\n- Add ResolvePolicy to Registry — merge adapter defaults with explicit user values\n- Persist policy column in insertTask/scanTask (PostgreSQL)\n- Persist policy column in insertRun/scanRun (PostgreSQL)\n- Remove config fallback from ClaudeAdapter — reads only from snapshot\n- Remove config fallback from CodexAdapter — reads only from snapshot\n- Add Model and Policy to CanonicalCreatePayloadSHA256 for idempotency\n- Empty policy snapshot fails closed in Claude adapter\n- Fix gofmt, staticcheck, unused (marshalPolicy) lint issues\n- Update all tests to ref