 non-React bibles to full depth, add React 19.2 coverage\n\nEvery non-React bible was previously a 144-2528 word stub (vs. React''s\n10,131 words across 14 files). Expanded each to the same 15-folder,\n1:1-with-syllabus-sections structure and depth as the React bible:\n\nRedux Toolkit, Webpack, Web Vitals, Next.js, TypeScript, JavaScript,\nVite, Jest & RTL, Playwright, TanStack Query, Storybook, Framer Motion,\nFrontend Architecture (the deliberately decisions/tradeoffs-focused one).\n\nAlso added docs/react/09-react-19-2-additions (useEffectEvent, Activity,\ncache) and updated syllabus/react_bible_syllabus.txt to match. All 14\nbibles are now complete and build-verified; docs/index.md''s \"every\nconcept across all 14 Bibles\" claim is accurate for the first time.\n\nEach bible was build-verified individually as it was completed (see\n.claude/memory/005 through 014).","tree":{"sha":"c40af2bf9dabe46eefca44173b115325c38b0f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/git/trees/c40af2bf9dabe46eefca44173b115325c38b0f30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/git/commits/95c9bf371c400706d350d4bc5434ae330d835d93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102772549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sairamg8","id":102772549,"login":"sairamg8","node_id":"U_kgDOBiAvRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/commit/95c9bf371c400706d350d4bc5434ae330d835d93","node_id":"C_kwDOTo-mENoAKDk1YzliZjM3MWM0MDA3MDZkMzUwZDRiYzU0MzRhZTMzMGQ4MzVkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/commit/ba2d4788c378c01291ee7dd4b451c5904a8bcdaf","sha":"ba2d4788c378c01291ee7dd4b451c5904a8bcdaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/commits/ba2d4788c378c01291ee7dd4b451c5904a8bcdaf"}],"sha":"95c9bf371c400706d350d4bc5434ae330d835d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/commits/95c9bf371c400706d350d4bc5434ae330d835d93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102772549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sairamg8","id":102772549,"login":"sairamg8","node_id":"U_kgDOBiAvRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/commits/ba2d4788c378c01291ee7dd4b451c5904a8bcdaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T03:22:08Z","email":"sairamgudiputi8@gmail.com","name":"sairamgudiputi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T03:22:08Z","email":"sairamgudiputi8@gmail.com","name":"sairamgudiputi"},"message":"fix: broken links, duplicate folder numbering, MDX crashes, missing React DOM APIs\n\n- docs/index.md: fixed homepage table links pointing at filenames that\n  didn''t match what was actually written (e.g. stale Next.js link).\n- docusaurus.config.ts: removed two dangling /syllabus-overview nav/footer\n  links (no such page exists), fixed favicon path to the real static asset,\n  fixed a category link that pointed at a non-existent generated landing\n  page for a single-doc directory.\n- docs/react: renamed the duplicate 06-id-accessibility-debug folder to\n  08 (freeing the collision with 06-server-components-and-actions).\n- Fixed 3 MDX parse crashes: LaTeX-style pseudo-math ($$...$$) in\n  03-use-reducer.md and 01-use-memo-and-use-callback.md was being parsed\n  as JSX expressions referencing undefined variables; replaced with plain\n  code text. A backslash-escaped backtick in a vite doc closed its code\n  span early, leaking a live MDX expression - fixed with a double-backtick\n  delimiter.\n- Authored the 6 React DOM APIs with zero prior coverage (createPortal,\n  flushSync, renderToString, renderToStaticMarkup, preloadModule,\n  preinitModule) into 07-react-dom-apis, matching the established format.","tree":{"sha":"58bf7128b38d79084fe891e1874ca000e78d93ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/git/trees/58bf7128b38d79084fe891e1874ca000e78d93ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sairamg8/frontendbible.github.io/git/commits/ba2d4788c378c01291ee7dd4b451c5904a8bcdaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102772549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sairamg8/events{/privacy}","foll