wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/2580e0630b32888b9a6ff5832018ced4541ec1e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:47:34Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:47:34Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"feat(platform): Ivy cluster is live — k3s + Portainer on the Ivy Bridge\n\nThe migration toolkit goes real:\n- scripts/ivy (key-auth ssh runner) + scripts/ivy-push (tar-over-ssh;\n  Ivy''s snap-shimmed scp/rsync have confined fs views and can''t see real\n  home paths — shell pipe is the reliable road). Config in gitignored\n  .ivy.env: user + IP only, no secrets.\n- platform/ivy/portainer.yaml — hand-rolled Portainer CE manifest\n  (namespace, cluster-admin SA, PVC, NodePort 30000/30776). LAN-only by\n  design: the control panel never gets a tunnel.\n\nIvy (smartech): Ubuntu 24.04.5 LTS, gigabit wired, swappiness 60→10,\nk3s v1.36 Ready, system pods green, Portainer 1/1 Running at\nhttps://192.168.86.23:30000. Next: admin password (Portainer''s init\nwindow), cloudflared tunnel (founder auth), MinIO + LUKS data LV,\nthen the maker canary.","tree":{"sha":"77d2bb343e1ab455f4cfb83ea7261fa4a814da54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/77d2bb343e1ab455f4cfb83ea7261fa4a814da54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/2580e0630b32888b9a6ff5832018ced4541ec1e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/2580e0630b32888b9a6ff5832018ced4541ec1e4","node_id":"C_kwDOTo-zvdoAKDI1ODBlMDYzMGIzMjg4OGI5YTZmZjU4MzIwMThjZWQ0NTQxZWMxZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/23fda5e3f3a0a94e6d37bd67873691f488ba04eb","sha":"23fda5e3f3a0a94e6d37bd67873691f488ba04eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/23fda5e3f3a0a94e6d37bd67873691f488ba04eb"}],"sha":"2580e0630b32888b9a6ff5832018ced4541ec1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-a