tscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/4df84f3c7c0e5f7d0a9ce78db1dcb60507119939/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:08:30Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:08:30Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"feat(square): store webhook route + purchase ledger + item contract\n\nThe register''s phone line (docs/PRD-square-didit.md):\n\n- store_purchases table (migration 20261005000001): EVERY order recorded —\n  incl. $0 Silver pass-through for the record (Silver is the ground, not a\n  grant; entitlement_grants.tier CHECK rightly refuses it).\n  UNIQUE(order_id, sku) = idempotency that doesn''t trust the webhook layer.\n- utils/square-webhook.ts (pure): Square HMAC (URL+timestamp, base64,\n  constant-time, 300s freshness) + the ITEM_LIBRARY contract — 11 SKUs:\n  memberships 30d/50-150-500 tokens, trials 7d/30-90-300 (pro-rated),\n  token bundles, gift sets. CSV tracked for provenance.\n- POST /api/webhooks/square: verify sig → webhook_events dedupe → fetch\n  order (Square API, production token) → buyer email → club account →\n  entitlement + token grants per contract → manifest membership mirror.\n  Unmatched buyers and gift sets: recorded + LOUD logs for owner-tools,\n  never silently dropped.\n- 6 contract tests; suite 58 → 64. lint 0/0 → prettier → build green.\n\nEnv: SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN + SQUARE_WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_KEY (+ optional\nSQUARE_WEBHOOK_URL override; defaults to the registered production\nendpoint). CF WAF skip for /api/webhooks/* still required before live\npurchases flow.","tree":{"sha":"699d4937095ada9b5b05193256531192314ffb26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/699d4937095ada9b5b05193256531192314ffb26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/4df84f3c7c0e5f7d0a9ce78db1dcb605