ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/5bcaa59b010d841d1772da8e2d497fb32d3c8813/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:01:20Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:01:20Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"feat(onboarding): front-door state machine + Didit webhook verifier (pure, tested)\n\nFirst pieces of docs/PRD-onboarding.md (founder flow: consent → verify →\nmembership → club):\n\n- utils/onboarding-schema.ts — onboardingStep(): the funnel IS the gate;\n  stops at the first closed door (a verified bot without consent still\n  stands outside). STEP_ROUTE sends each waiting step where it needs to\n  go; membership routes to the Square store.\n- utils/onboarding.ts — DB half: consents (all four of Brutus''s),\n  profiles.verified_at, and ANY membership record (subscription incl. the\n  $0 Silver pass-through, entitlement grant, or unexpired guest pass;\n  legacy Stripe rows count — they''re records).\n- utils/didit-webhook.ts — pure signature verification per Didit docs:\n  X-Signature-V2 canonical JSON (recursive key sort, Unicode preserved),\n  raw-bytes fallback, 300s freshness, constant-time compare; the\n  deprecated envelope-only mode is REFUSED (never trust an unauthenticated\n  verdict). Clock injected → fully testable.\n- 6 tests: gate order, routes, canonicalization, v2 round-trip + tamper,\n  raw + wrong-secret, stale/missing headers. Suite 52 → 58.\n- PRDs: onboarding flow + Square/Didit pivot (Stripe out after 3 days —\n  their loss; gate function means no false pretenses at any step).\n\nNot yet wired into pages — zero behavior change. Next: Didit session\ncreate in /verify, the webhook route, and the gate on club entries.","tree":{"sha":"3701406ff3b6af29e471056b7ecc99a1c12cb784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/3701406ff3b6af29e471056b7ecc99a1c12cb784"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/5bcaa59b010d841d1772da8e2d497fb32d3c8813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartsc