94f0b19429ffa82461104551"}],"sha":"e4a15e73449e62fa7f7483fed99e7e782c8e01da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/e4a15e73449e62fa7f7483fed99e7e782c8e01da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/856f3b750961b8e894f0b19429ffa82461104551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T03:20:17Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T03:20:17Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"security: is_test_member → guard schema; audit-definers script + declared API allowlist\n\nThe 60-warning advisor list, resolved by doctrine (founder''s menu):\n- AUDIT: every warned DEFINER already has search_path pinned + postgres\n  owner — the hygiene column of the menu was already met.\n- GENUINE FIX: is_test_member() — zero RPC call sites, one RLS policy\n  consumer — moved to non-exposed ''guard'' schema (migration 20261004000001).\n  Both its warnings (0028 anon + 0029 auth) clear; the privacy gate stays\n  enforced because policies bind by OID. Verified: anon profiles read works,\n  /rest/v1/rpc/is_test_member is gone (404).\n- DECLARED SURFACE: the remaining 58 member-facing RPCs are intentional —\n  now machine-enforced: config/definer-api.json lists them,\n  scripts/audit-definers.mjs fails on any callable DEFINER not allowlisted,\n  unpinned, or non-postgres-owned. Run after every Supabase upgrade (the\n  10-03 upgrade re-granted anon on taskbar_state — drift is now caught by\n  script, not memory).\n\nlint 0/0 → prettier → lint 0/0 → 52/52 tests → build green.","tree":{"sha":"a7345a80e42b71dc255158a5e03b267aa52ccf54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/a7345a80e42b71dc255158a5e03b267aa52ccf54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/856f3b750961b8e894f0b19429ffa82461104551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/856f3b750961b8e894f0b19429ffa82461104551","node_id":"C_kwDOTo-zvdoAKDg1NmYzYjc1MDk2MWI4ZTg5NGYwYjE5NDI5ZmZhODI0NjExMDQ1NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/1896d42171a9154bec40ae5cd0864a1d7ace236a","sha":"1896d42171a9154bec40ae5cd0864a1d7ace236a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/1896d42171a9154bec40ae5cd0864a1d7ace236a"}],"sha":"856f3b750961b8e894f0b19429ffa82461104551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/856f3b750961b8e894f0b19429ffa82461104551"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/1896d42171a9154bec40ae5cd0864a1d7ace236a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:10:13Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T02:10:13Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"feat(manifest): membership section — four doors mirrored, live-tier overlay, upgrade repair\n\nSecond domino per docs/PRD-user-manifest.md build order:\n\n- utils/membership-manifest.ts — syncMembershipToManifest(admin, userId):\n  current_tier() (the single authority: subscriptions + entitlements +\n  guest passes) + verified_at + active guest-pass expiry → manifest.\n  admin client INJECTED (consumed by admin.ts itself — importing\n  supabaseAdmin back would recreate the module-eval cycle).\n- wired at all four state-change doors: applyVerificationResult,\n  manageSubscriptionStatusChange (admin.ts), grantComplimentaryMembership,\n  sendGuestPassByEmail (account actions). Best-effort mirrors; enforcement\n  always votes through current_tier() live.\n- read door overlays the LIVE tier on membership displays — guest passes\n  expire silently, so the mirror is the view, the RPC is the truth.\n- scripts/backfill-manifest-membership.mjs — merge-safe seeding.\n- UPGRADE REPAIR: the engine update silently re-granted anon EXECUTE on\n  taskbar_state(); migration 20261003000001 re-revokes. Post-upgrade\n  invariant recorded: anon-exec DEFINERs = exactly is_test_member.\n  Audited all 30 functions lacking authenticated EXECUTE — every app call\n  site uses supabaseAdmin; all service-only by design.\n- BACKFILL HARDENING: a transient download failure was treated as ''no\n  manifest'' and silently overwrote a live document (Scott''s profile\n  section, restored by re-run). Both scripts now: 404 → skeleton, any\n  other error → SKIP, never overwrite.\n\nmembershipToSection test (standard→silver, unknown→door tier).\n165-rule lint 0/0 → prettier → lint 0/0 → 52/52 tests → build green.","tree":{"sha":"b5eac7a307a71dd57d97f2cd3e464f216f2c96c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/b5eac7a307a71dd57d97f2cd3e464f216f2c96c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repo