 fits (pearl ≠ opal — no fake stand-ins); emoji chip remains\n  the catalog''s own declared symbol in those cases. Five assignments are\n  judgment calls flagged for founder review — flip any line.\n- BioCard: membership corner = tier badge icon floating above the frame;\n  earned corner = mapped badge art (emoji chip fallback). Coat-check passes\n  the badge slug through the card props.\n\nlint 0/0 → pretty → lint 0/0 → 51/51 → build green.","tree":{"sha":"74e9779ea6488f6ac1870bd2169220536f0fae6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/74e9779ea6488f6ac1870bd2169220536f0fae6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/2d13668a5eeebb82b290eaa2495f7899334e1820","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/2d13668a5eeebb82b290eaa2495f7899334e1820","node_id":"C_kwDOTo-zvdoAKDJkMTM2NjhhNWVl