ocs/PRD-user-manifest.md build order):\n- utils/profile-manifest.ts — syncProfileToManifest(userId): reads\n  profiles + photos, maps via the shared pure profileToSection, topPuts\n  the profile section. Best-effort mirror: a sync failure logs, never\n  fails the member''s save (table write already succeeded; backfill repairs).\n- wired into all four profile write seams: updateProfile, uploadProfilePhoto,\n  deleteProfilePhoto (now resolves the user for its sync), setPrimaryPhoto.\n- utils/top-schema.ts — pure profileToSection (shared by live sync AND the\n  backfill script: one mapping, zero drift). Privacy-first defaults:\n  show-flags off, age/height/location null until the form grows them.\n  Photos: primary first, ≤8, pathless dropped, first survivor becomes\n  primary if none flagged.\n- scripts/backfill-manifest-profile.mjs — merge-safe seeding for all members\n  or --user <email-prefix>; updates the master directory in the same pass.\n- coat-check: card composes manifest-first with table fallback (strangler\n  pattern — tables keep feeding queries/joins while the manifest becomes\n  the canonical member view).\n- +2 mapping tests; one caught docstring/impl drift on photo order —\n  implementation fixed to match the spec, not the test weakened.\n\nlint 0/0 → prettier → lint 0/0 → 51/51 tests → build green.","tree":{"sha":"f42705a770651d69408592a1daf62ecf0a82bfd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/f42705a770651d69408592a1daf62ecf0a82bfd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/f10d82db9dda4b83a152cc23f36d5736c1978c28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/