b.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/3e6db8d0313dc1cb23e5f2bf0e0ba776ce405585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:16:54Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:16:54Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"chore(db): retire dead horn_gift migration; reconcile migration tracker\n\nThe gift-shop horn is implemented as direct-action buttons (GiftShop.tsx →\nblowHorn/blowHornFull) that deduct tokens and post to chat — they never\nreference gift_catalog. horn_gift.sql was a redundant, never-applied attempt\nto ALSO make the horn a catalog gift; its kind=''gesture'' violated the\ngift_catalog check constraint so it was DOA on write. Deleting it (the horn\nitself works — the rate-limit table + regex were restored in 20261001000002).\n\nAlso marked create_quest_avatars_bucket resolved in supabase_migrations\n(created Sept 17, intentionally dropped Oct 1 via 20261001000001). migrate-\nhosted now reports ''No pending migrations'' — tracker and folder reconciled.","tree":{"sha":"142bec0cb9614e809131ab113baf4fb1f398d8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/142bec0cb9614e809131ab113baf4fb1f398d8f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/3e6db8d0313dc1cb23e5f2bf0e0ba776ce405585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","ev