ott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commits/d30b963e5947b5aebc1423a433bf32607a3e9d27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:46:13Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:46:13Z","email":"ss.helixsphereai@gmail.com","name":"smartscott-LLC"},"message":"feat(top): THE TOP — manifest control plane, v1 substrate + sub-address doors\n\nThe pyramid apex, per docs/PRD-user-manifest.md (founder architecture):\nTHE TOP → USER MANIFEST → SUB-ADDRESSES → DATA.\n\n- utils/top-schema.ts — pure geometry (no I/O, no clock, no network):\n  v1 types, seven section validators, uuid cross-check, 30d/60 match +\n  30d event window trims, v0→v1 upgrade, sub-address resolution,\n  master-directory entries. Fully unit-tested.\n- utils/top.ts — the router over member manifests: topGet(subaddresses),\n  topPut(section), addMatch/addEvent appenders, saveAvatar (folds the\n  maker''s v0 contract into v1 model+assets), TTL cache, _master.json\n  directory hidden behind the interface (graduates to RPC/KV later\n  without any consumer noticing — the seam is the design).\n- Read door GET /api/avatar/{userId}: sub-address projections\n  (?fields=profile.displayName,membership.tier,…) with privacy gating AT\n  THE APEX — age/height/location only when show-flags allow; card-safe\n  allowlist; edge-cached.\n- Save door POST /api/avatar/save: session-gated, v0 contract → v1.\n- Coat check reads through the TOP now; utils/user-manifest.ts (v0) retired.\n- 11 geometry tests; suite 38 → 49 pass.\n- AGENTS.md nextjs-agent-rules block committed (next dev re-adds it).\n\nPipeline clean: lint 0/0 → prettier → lint 0/0 → build green → dev-run\nsmoke (read door 404-no-manifest, illegal sub-address rejected, save door\nsession-gated). NOT pushed — local validation until launch per founder rule.","tree":{"sha":"65dfa9713d1d108d9af40e0fa259b2d8b15e0fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/65dfa9713d1d108d9af40e0fa259b2d8b15e0fa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/d30b963e5947b5aebc1423a433bf32607a3e9d27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/commit/d30b963e5947b5aebc1423a433bf32607a3e9d27","node_id":"C_kw