ate user-manifests bucket, 30s TTL read cache, and the\n  master manifest (_master.json) indexing every member''s manifest path —\n  the pointer-chain the vector-DB phase graduates from\n- POST /api/avatar/save — the single write door: session-gated, validates,\n  writes the user object, then updates the master index\n- GET /api/avatar/{userId} — card-safe public read (name/model/stage/\n  snapshot/displayBadge only), edge-cached s-maxage=60 + SWR 300\n\nBio Card (founder visual doctrine, first surface = coat check):\n- components/ui/Cards/BioCard.tsx — baseball card with click-to-flip\n  collectible back (heart/gold by gender), photo in frame, Fascinate/gold\n  section labels, Rancho/pink body, Damion/cyan stats row, avatar slot\n  floating bottom-right (text pads against it, borders pass beneath),\n  membership badge top-left + chosen earned badge top-right, both above\n  the frame for depth\n- coat-check page composes it from profile + primary photo + current_tier\n  + badges + own manifest (age from self-readable birthday); no manifest\n  yet = card renders complete without the avatar slot (no placeholders)\n\nLive smoke: manifest + master write/read round-trip through the bucket,\ncleaned up. lint 0/0, build green, 38 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"0b63423d33dc6835d2de99d91fa252a4b801c108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/0b63423d33dc6835d2de99d91fa252a4b801c108"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/7a2c9a2bad3e239d66f01b1b015de4741cdd3f62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com