ts went nowhere.\nSeparately, bump_rate_limit''s key regex never learned the horn:/swipes:\nfamilies shipped after 20260912000000.\n\nMigration 20261001000002 recreates both tables (rate_limits reverse-engineered\nfrom the deployed function bodies; RLS on, service/definer access only) and\nreplaces bump_rate_limit with the widened allowlist\nagent|report|matchmaker|l3|horn|swipes. types_db.ts regenerated.\n\nLive smoke: horn cooldown true->false works; taskbar_state returns real data\nfor a Diamond member; announcement insert/read round-trips. lint 0/0, build\ngreen, 38 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"335849caad4e9a65d17ceece120ab70557b8bbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/trees/335849caad4e9a65d17ceece120ab70557b8bbed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartscott-LLC/cheeky-app/git/commits/e3de04b81ae1191439bf030e5a8227194d6210bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262931007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smartscott-LLC","id":262931007,"login":"smartscott-LLC","node_id":"U_kgDOD6wCPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smartscott-LLC","user_view_type":"public"},"htm