@gmail.com","name":"sanjai0305"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T10:01:00Z","email":"sanjai0940r@gmail.com","name":"sanjai0305"},"message":"feat: Implement mandatory Agent KYC flow inside Agent Portal\n\nBackend:\n- Add dob, mobile, mobileVerified, gstNo, companyLogo, agentPhoto, and kycStatus enum to Agent model\n- Include KYC fields in Agent projection select within protectAgent middleware\n- Implement checkAgentKYC middleware to protect trip creation and publishing routes\n- Create GET /profile, PUT /profile/update, send/verify OTP (Gmail & Mobile), and upload logo/photo routes in agentRoutes.js\n- Enable updating kycStatus to APPROVED in updateAgent admin controller\n\nFrontend:\n- Add KYC fields to Agent type interface\n- Implement CompleteProfile.tsx page with 5-step wizard and verification OTP inputs\n- Register /complete-profile route in App.tsx\n- Update ProtectedRoute to redirect KYC-incomplete agents to /complete-profile\n- Update Dashboard.tsx and Trips.tsx profile completion checks and warning banner navigation","tree":{"sha":"70be631f1884f2987baa827516d9fd35249711df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/git/trees/70be631f1884f2987baa827516d9fd35249711df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/git/commits/8bffe9db58445166a336b4b597176df712ace22e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/commit/8bffe9db58445166a336b4b597176df712ace22e","node_id":"C_kwDOTpfIEdoAKDhiZmZlOWRiNTg0NDUxNjZhMzM2YjRiNTk3MTc2ZGY3MTJhY2UyMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/commit/608c8d6440d891d9d767bf1aab39dd30f70f7cf9","sha":"608c8d6440d891d9d767bf1aab39dd30f70f7cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/commits/608c8d6440d891d9d767bf1aab39dd30f70f7cf9"}],"sha":"8bffe9db58445166a336b4b597176df712ace22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/commits/8bffe9db58445166a336b4b597176df712ace22e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/commits/608c8d6440d891d9d767bf1aab39dd30f70f7cf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T08:36:54Z","email":"sanjai0940r@gmail.com","name":"sanjai0305"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T08:36:54Z","email":"sanjai0940r@gmail.com","name":"sanjai0305"},"message":"feat: Real-time seat reservation, passenger metadata, UPI payment, QR ticket generation\n\nBackend:\n- Add models/Passenger.js with QR payload, per-seat passenger metadata\n- Add models/SeatBooking.js with Redis lock correlation, auto-heal expired reservations\n- Add routes/seatRoutes.js: GET seat map, POST reserve/release/confirm, GET ticket\n- Update routes/bookingRoutes.js: add GET /ticket/:bookingId endpoint + Passenger import\n- Update server.js: register /api/seats, add join_trip_seats Socket.IO room\n- Update utils/api.js: export getSocketUrl for WebSocket connection\n\nFrontend:\n- Add components/trip/SeatLayoutModal.jsx: premium Volvo bus layout, gender colours, live Socket.IO sync\n- Add components/trip/PassengerFormModal.jsx: per-seat multi-step passenger form\n- Add components/trip/UPIPaymentModal.jsx: QR + GPay/PhonePe/Paytm/BHIM deeplinks + polling\n- Add components/trip/TicketModal.jsx: QR boarding pass, PDF/PNG download\n- Update pages/TripDetails.jsx: rewire booking flow seat_select->passenger_form->upi_payment->ticket","tree":{"sha":"e46e187a154299e215394f583e02301558de9014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/git/trees/e46e187a154299e215394f583e02301558de9014"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjai0305/live-traveloop-project/git/commits/608c8d6440d891d9d767bf1aab39dd30f70f7cf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"commit