45Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T21:54:45Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"chore: bump to 0.7.5 and re-run Galata against the round-3 fixes\n\nThe 9/9 Galata green on record was against a 0.7.4 build that predated\nthe round-3 widget changes, making it stale evidence for a ship claim.\nmake install runs increment_version, so 0.7.5 is the cost of a truthful\nre-test.\n\nAll 9 flows pass on the rebuilt extension, including the three that\nexercise _render''s rewritten focus capture and restore: row-click\nterminal reuse, the Manage Sessions popup, and branch fork.\n\nyarn.lock also carries an incidental resolver bump of the transitive\nbaseline-browser-mapping 2.11.9 -> 2.11.10.","tree":{"sha":"258f2bac8696f27335279d5144a696f28723eb55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/trees/258f2bac8696f27335279d5144a696f28723eb55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/commits/e342fea2c611e9a14a3a9c06d4fae012ea95ffde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false