ode_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commits/de8acc67e5ddf09f5461a7844937dfcf0d90232a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:45:00Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T07:45:00Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: close five defects found by round-3 adversarial review\n\nAll five trace to remedies applied in round 2 - the review protocol''s\n\"remedies generate review surface\" warning made concrete.\n\n- guard the mouseleave flush on _contextMenu.isAttached, mirroring the poll\n  tick. Opening a Lumino menu at the cursor fires mouseleave with no pointer\n  movement, so the deferred tick rebuilt the rows the menu was acting on\n- bound the hover deferral to a single tick. A cursor parked over the sidebar\n  never fires mouseleave, so the list froze for as long as the user typed in\n  the terminal; the comment above it claimed the opposite\n- restore focus for section headers, not only rows. The header button''s own\n  click handler calls _render(), so collapsing a section dropped focus to\n  <body> on every toggle. Both focusables now key on [data-row-key]\n- self-catch the cleanup success refresh. It shared a try block with the POST,\n  so a failed refresh rewrote \"Removed N parallel sessions.\" as \"Cleanup\n  failed\" for an operation that had succeeded\n- self-catch the _deleteBranches refresh. A throw inside finally overrides the\n  try''s return, so a successful delete whose refresh failed rejected the whole\n  call and swallowed the \"N deleted\" status\n\nThree declined findings are recorded with reasons as DEF-12 through DEF-14.\nAdds three jest pins; 68 jest, tsc clean, lint 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"505a5a8b2581a1c6b593dc0a86898b885522cfbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/trees/505a5a8b2581a1c6b593dc0a86898b885522cfbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/commits/de8acc67e5ddf09f5461a7844937dfcf0d90232a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commit/de8acc67e5ddf09f5461a7844937dfcf0d90232a","node_id":"C_kwDOTpjRh9oAKGRlOGFjYzY3ZTVkZGYwOWY1NDYxYTc4NDQ5MzdkZmNmMGQ5MDIzMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commit/99179839dec75159b1cbd4437537f2de71de25b0","sha":"99179839dec75159b1cbd4437537f2de71de25b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commits/99179839dec75159b1cbd4437537f2de71de25b0"}],"sha":"de8acc67e5ddf09f5461a7844937dfcf0d90232a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commits/de8acc67e5ddf09f5461a7844937dfcf0d90232a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/commits/99179839dec75159b1cbd4437537f2de71de25b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:25:52Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:25:52Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: implement Kimi Code session management panel\n\nPort the jupyterlab_claude_code_extension feature set to Kimi Code CLI\nsemantics - session discovery, resume, fork, terminal reuse and coloured\ntabs - across server, frontend and three test layers.\n\n- server: sessions.py enumerates ~/.kimi-code (workspaces.json registry,\n  session_index.jsonl, per-session state.json); routes.py exposes 11\n  authenticated routes including sessions/fork, which copies a session\n  directory server-side because kimi has no fork flag\n- frontend: widget.ts side panel with favourites, fuzzy search, conversation\n  switcher and Manage Sessions popup; colour.ts derives the tab tint from an\n  FNV-1a hash of the session id, since kimi has no /color command\n- cli.py installs a bundled powerline statusline and merges its command into\n  tui.toml, preserving unrelated keys\n- tests: 152 pytest, 65 jest, 9 Playwright/Galata flows\n- docs: acceptance criteria and defect registers\n- packaging: webpack 5.106.0 and chalk 4.1.2 pinned in both resolutions and\n  overrides - removing either breaks the production build\n\nTerminal reuse keys on positive session-id identity only, never cwd, so a\nsecond click on a running conversation focuses its existing terminal rather\nthan spawning a duplicate.","tree":{"sha":"ab198a1c54ab11899959d9f3704bd7ac011aa08b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/trees/ab198a1c54ab11899959d9f3704bd7ac011aa08b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_kimi_code_extension/git/commits/99179839dec75159b1cbd4437537f2de71de25b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/